window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-2"] = [{"id":11,"rawContent":"# 第十一章：向著海平線啟航\n\n## 一、齒輪港的晨風\n\n深秋清晨的海風，帶著淡淡的鹽味與齒輪鎮特有的機油芳香，掠過波光粼粼的蔚藍海面。\n\n鹿陽國小的「404 記憶危機」徹底平息後的三天，齒輪港老舊的三號深水碼頭上，正停泊著一艘造型極為獨特的中型木質蒸氣探險船。\n\n船身長約十八公尺，龍骨採用了極其堅固的百年柚木，外側包覆著一層厚實的耐腐蝕黃銅防護甲板。船艉高聳著一根漆黑鋥亮的小型蒸氣煙囪，兩側掛著兩具由發條彈簧與水輪驅動的推進外輪。\n\n船頭的撞角上方，用工整的機械刻刀雕刻著它的名字——**「青木齒輪號」**。\n\n「這艘船，是你爺爺三十年前親手在老船塢敲下第一顆鉚釘的。」\n\n邱校長穿著一身深藍色的防風雙排扣水手呢大衣，站在碼頭的繫纜樁旁。晨光灑在他那副金邊老花眼鏡上，映出無比深邃的目光：\n\n「三十年前，我們駕駛著它在千島齒輪海進行水文勘測。後來這片海域因為古代海底機械帶來的異常洋流，被航海公會劃為禁航區……沒想到三十年後，它會交到你的手上，誠浩。」\n\n「謝謝您，校長。」\n\n誠浩穿著一件耐磨的橙色防風救生背心，胸前掛著那副擦拭得一塵不染的黃銅幽靈護目鏡。陽光下，少年眼眸中的稚氣已經蛻變成了一名真正冒險者的堅毅。\n\n站在一旁的班導師高老師，氣色已經完全恢復。他笑著遞給葉旖緁一個精緻的黃銅圓筒：\n\n「旖緁，這是千島齒輪海三十年前的『原始海圖』與『洋流手冊』。那片海域的洋流非常特殊，受到地底巨大潮汐齒輪的影響，水流每隔六小時就會發生一次不可預測的差動旋轉。到了海上，可全靠你的大腦來當指南針了。」\n\n「請老師放心！」旖緁接過海圖筒，小心翼翼地收進自己的防水背包裡。\n\n今天她特意將黑色高馬尾束在腦後，額前綁著一條天藍色的吸汗頭帶，鼻樑上的細金屬眼鏡也換上了防海水腐蝕的鈦合金鏡架，顯得格外幹練俐落。\n\n「呼……呼……等等我！等等我啊！！」\n\n就在這時，碼頭棧橋的木板突然傳來一陣沉重如打雷般的急促腳步聲！\n\n---\n\n## 二、海上大廚的保溫箱\n\n誠浩和旖緁同時轉頭看去。\n\n只見碼頭入口處，留著圓圓平頭的將江，正雙手拖著一隻足足有半人高、裝著四個越野滾輪的大號迷彩保溫野餐箱，滿頭大汗地朝著登船跳板瘋狂狂奔！\n\n他的脖子上掛著一架比他臉蛋還大的重型雙筒望遠鏡，腰間繫著一條紅白相間的格子圍裙，最離奇的是——他的後背竟然還背著一口鋥光瓦亮、足足有炒鍋那麼大的黑鐵平底鍋！\n\n「呼……呼……累死我了！」將江氣喘吁吁地一屁股坐在保溫箱上，抹了一把額頭上的大汗。\n\n「將江？！」誠浩瞪大了眼睛，「你怎麼這副打扮？你背著平底鍋幹什麼？！」\n\n「你還好意思問！」將江氣鼓鼓地叉著腰，一把掀開保溫箱的厚蓋子。\n\n剎那間，一陣濃郁撲鼻的烘焙香氣瞬間席捲了整座碼頭！\n\n只見保溫箱裡整整齊齊地碼放著上百個金黃酥脆的剛出爐菠蘿麵包、幾十包真空包裝的蒜味香腸、還有五大袋齒輪鎮特產的脫水海苔乾！\n\n「你們兩個想偷偷跑去千島齒輪海冒險，居然想把我丟在學校做數學考卷？沒門！」\n\n將江拍了拍胸前的平底鍋，發出「當當」的清脆金屬聲，理直氣壯地宣布：\n\n「遠洋航行最重要的是什麼？是營養！是熱量！是靈魂的美食！你們要是沒了我這個海上首席行政大廚，在海上天天吃冷冰冰的壓縮餅乾，不超過三天就會得壞血病！我可是跟高老師請好兩個星期的實習假了，必須帶上我！」\n\n高老師無奈地推了推眼鏡，笑著對誠浩點點頭：「這孩子昨天晚上跑到我家敲門，在我家客廳磨了兩個小時……他在廚藝上的天賦確實沒得說。帶上他吧，路上也有個照應。」\n\n「太棒啦！」將江興奮地一把跳了起來，單手拎起沉重的保溫箱，像隻靈巧的大企鵝一樣三兩步衝上了「青木齒輪號」的甲板。\n\n趴在船頭欄杆上的機械摺紙柴犬皮可，看著將江身上的菠蘿麵包，幽藍色的光學鏡頭歡快地閃爍了兩下，尾巴敲擊甲板發出清脆的摩斯密碼：\n\n`--. --- --- -..`（**GOOD —— 好極了！**）\n\n---\n\n## 三、皮可的兩棲渦輪模組\n\n「嗚————！」\n\n伴隨著一聲悠揚雄渾的蒸氣汽笛長鳴，青木齒輪號解開了纜繩，兩側的黃銅外輪拍打著白色的浪花，緩緩駛離了齒輪港。\n\n岸邊，邱校長與高老師的身影在金色的晨曦中漸漸變小，最終化作地平線上兩個揮手的小黑點。\n\n船艙底部的機械工作室內，誠浩正蹲在工作台前，將最後一枚不鏽鋼內六角螺絲緊緊擰進皮可的尾部接口。\n\n「咔噠！」\n\n一陣極其清脆悅耳的機械卡榫咬合聲響起。\n\n「完成了！」誠浩滿意地擦掉手上的機油，對著身後的旖緁和將江招了招手，「這是我這兩天結合爺爺的手冊，為皮可量身定做的——**『海事兩棲推進外骨骼』**！」\n\n「皮可，展示一下水下推進模式！」\n\n聽到誠浩的指令，皮可站直了身體。\n\n只見它身上原本柔軟薄如紙片的記憶合金薄片，忽然「嘩啦啦」向後翻折流動！它那條原本由七個圓環組成的柴犬尾巴，在三秒鐘內重組變形為一具直徑十公分的微型涵道式**高速超導渦輪螺旋槳**！\n\n而在它的四隻小爪子底部，彈出了四個高強度的微型真空負壓吸盤，讓它即使在傾斜六十度的濕滑金屬甲板上奔跑，也能如履平地，絲毫不會滑倒！\n\n「哇！太酷了吧！」正嚼著香腸的將江眼睛瞪得溜圓，「那它能不能幫我搖打蛋器？」\n\n「將江！皮可是精密的偵察機器人，不是打蛋機！」旖緁沒好氣地敲了一下將江的腦袋。\n\n「不只是推進器。」誠浩笑著按了按護目鏡，「如果遇到緊急海難，它的四肢還能平展為一米寬的『合金水翼衝浪板』，能在海浪上以時速四十浬破浪滑行！」\n\n皮可高興地仰起小腦袋，發出一聲奶聲奶氣的電子犬吠：「嗶啵！」\n\n---\n\n## 四、迷霧與閃爍的信標浮標\n\n青木齒輪號在平靜的海面上航行了整整四個小時。\n\n正午十二點剛過，原本晴空萬里的碧海藍天，突然開始發生詭異的變化。\n\n海水的顏色從澄澈的蔚藍，迅速轉變為一種深邃不見底的暗青色。更令人稱奇的是，水面下的浪花中，竟然不時翻滾出一串串肉眼可見的淡黃色齒輪狀氣泡！\n\n空氣中的濕度急劇上升，一片厚重得如同牛奶般的白色海霧，無聲無息地自海平面升騰而起，迅速將整艘船吞沒其中。\n\n「能見度不到三十公尺！」\n\n將江站在高高的桅杆瞭望台上，手裡舉著雙筒望遠鏡，大聲朝著甲板喊道：「前面全是白茫茫一片！等等……水下面有黑影！好大一片黑影！」\n\n誠浩立刻衝上駕駛台，拉下了額頭上的黃銅護目鏡。\n\n在護目鏡的光譜視野下，海面下的景象讓誠浩倒抽了一口涼氣！\n\n在船體正前方五十公尺的深水區，整齊地排列著數百根犬牙交錯、高聳如林的金屬玄武岩暗礁！每一根暗礁的表面，都咬合著直徑數公尺的古代青銅齒輪，正隨著洶湧的暗流以不同的速度轉動著！\n\n「是千島齒輪海的『剃刀暗礁群』！」旖緁迅速翻開防水海圖，臉色凝重，「這裡的水流極快，任何木船只要偏離安全航道三公尺，就會被轉動的金屬暗礁瞬間絞成碎片！」\n\n就在這時，前方迷霧深處，傳來了一陣極其規律的沉悶鐘鳴：\n\n「鐺……鐺……鐺……」\n\n只見迷霧中矗立著一座高達十公尺的黑色鐵鑄導航浮標。\n\n浮標頂端的強光探照燈，正穿透濃霧，對著青木齒輪號瘋狂閃爍著一連串明暗交替的白色強光！\n\n「那是古老的燈光海事密碼！」旖緁立刻拔出鋼筆，在黑皮筆記本上記錄光芒閃爍的秒數：\n\n```\n【剃刀暗礁引航光信標】：\n燈光閃爍特徵：\n[閃爍 1 次，長亮 3 秒] ➡️ 間隔 1 秒\n[閃爍 3 次，每次 0.5 秒] ➡️ 間隔 1 秒\n[閃爍 2 次，每次 1 秒] ➡️ 間隔 2 秒\n\n基座刻字提示：\n安全進港真航向角（True Course）計算公式：\nTC = (第一段秒數 × 100) ＋ (第二段次數 × 10) ＋ (第三段總秒數 × 5) 減去 50 度磁差！\n\n警告：若航向角誤差超過 2 度，船體將撞擊左側大齒輪礁！\n```\n\n「海事光學燈質信號（Light Characteristic）與航向角計算！」旖緁的筆尖在防水紙上飛速滑動：\n\n「第一段：閃爍 1 次，長亮 3 秒 ➡️ 秒數是 **3**！」  \n「第二段：閃爍 3 次 ➡️ 次數是 **3**！」  \n「第三段：閃爍 2 次，每次 1 秒 ➡️ 總秒數是 2 × 1 ＝ **2**！」\n\n「代入航向角公式！」旖緁大聲報出計算式：\n\n$$\\text{TC} = (3 \\times 100) + (3 \\times 10) + (2 \\times 5) - 50$$  \n$$\\text{TC} = 300 + 30 + 10 - 50 = 290^{\\circ} !$$\n\n「**真航向角：290 度！西北西方向！**」旖緁大喊，「誠浩，右滿舵！把羅盤指針對準 290 度！」\n\n「收到！舵角 290！」\n\n誠浩雙手死死握住青木齒輪號巨大的硬木舵輪，手臂肌肉暴起，拼盡全身力氣將舵輪向右猛打半圈！\n\n「嘎吱吱——轟隆！」\n\n青木齒輪號龐大的船身在洶湧的洋流中劇烈傾斜，船舷兩側的黃銅外輪發出刺耳的高轉速咆哮！\n\n就在船身完成轉向的同一秒鐘，一根高達八公尺、表面咬合著旋轉尖刺齒輪的黑色玄武岩暗礁，擦著船艏左側的銅皮僅僅**三十公分**掠過！激起的冰冷海浪劈頭蓋臉地澆在誠浩臉上，帶起一陣劫後餘生的寒意！\n\n青木齒輪號如同一條靈活的游魚，順著 290 度的安全深水航道，精準無誤地穿透了這片死亡暗礁！\n\n---\n\n## 五、破浪的滑行艇與海盜的號角\n\n「呼……衝過去了！」\n\n將江趴在瞭望台上，拍著胸脯大喊：「旖緁萬歲！我們沒被絞成魚飼料！」\n\n然而，青木齒輪號剛剛穿過暗礁群的迷霧，眼前的景象便讓三個人同時張大了嘴巴。\n\n濃霧豁然開朗。\n\n展現在他們眼前的，是一片無比瑰麗而不可思議的廣袤海域——\n\n海面上漂浮著數十座大小不一的島嶼。但那些島嶼竟然全部是由一圈圈巨大的發條青銅基座托舉著，隨著海浪有節奏地上浮、下沉；遠處的海平面上，矗立著一座座造型奇特、頂端旋轉著巨型齒輪風車的古代水上建築群！\n\n這就是傳說中的——**千島齒輪海**！\n\n然而，還沒等孩子們發出驚嘆，前方的平靜水面上，突然傳來了一陣宛如蜂鳴般的尖銳破空引擎聲！\n\n「嗡————轟！！」\n\n一道雪白的雙軌浪花在海面上瘋狂撕裂開來！\n\n一艘僅有三公尺長、通體用輕型浮木與黃銅廢料改裝的「小型水上蒸氣滑行艇」，正以驚人的五十浬高速朝著青木齒輪號迎面疾馳而來！\n\n滑行艇的船頭上，單腿站著一個皮膚呈現健康小麥色、留著帥氣短髮的十二歲女孩。\n\n她頭上歪戴著一頂插著雪白海鷗羽毛的草帽，腰間繫著一隻發光的海螺風向儀，手中緊握著一柄兩米長的折疊雙刃合金船槳！\n\n女孩迎著狂暴的海風，敏捷地一拉滑行艇的操縱桿，整艘小艇在距離青木齒輪號僅剩十公尺的水面上，劃出了一個極其瀟灑炫酷的九十度大甩尾，激起一道高達三公尺的巨大水幕！\n\n「喂！外來者！」\n\n女孩單手握槳，另一隻手扶著帽簷，露出一口潔白健康的牙齒和無比燦爛的笑容，大聲朝著甲板上的誠浩喊道：\n\n「好俊的舵法啊！居然能毫髮無傷穿過剃刀暗礁！我是海風島的首席領航員**嵐（Lan）**！」\n\n然而，嵐臉上的笑容僅僅維持了半秒鐘，她的神色突然猛地一變，急促地轉頭望向青木齒輪號身後的濃霧深處：\n\n「快轉舵！你們這艘笨重的老爺船被盯上了！」\n\n「嗚————嘟————！！」\n\n一陣低沉、粗暴、宛如遠古鋼鐵巨獸怒吼般的機械霧角聲，毫無預兆地在後方濃霧中炸響！\n\n只見一艘足足有三十公尺長、由三艘舊貨船與廢棄蒸汽火車頭粗暴焊接在一起的龐大黑鐵海盜船，如同一座移動的鋼鐵小山，蠻橫無比地撞碎了迷霧，高速衝了出來！\n\n在那艘海盜船高聳的撞角艦首上，赫然焊接著名震千島海域的骷髏海盜標記——兩柄交叉的巨大發條扳手，以及一具沉重的黑色鐵錨！\n\n而在海盜船的主甲板上，一個身披黑色海軍大衣、戴著黃銅單眼齒輪眼罩的十三歲少年，正手握一柄冒著蒸汽的魚叉槍，獰笑著將槍口直直對準了誠浩的咽喉：\n\n「此海是我開，此波是我栽！乖乖交出你們船上的所有古董零件與機械小狗……**否則鐵錨幫的巨錨砲，就要在你們的船底開個大天窗了！**」\n\n---\n\n*(第十一章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十一章：向著海平線啟航 (Chapter 11: Setting Sail Toward the Horizon)\n\n## 一、齒輪港的晨風 (I. The Morning Breeze of Gear Port)\n\nThe late-autumn morning sea breeze carried a crisp tang of salt mingled with Gear Town's unmistakable perfume of lubricating machine oil, sweeping across the sparkling azure waters.\n\nThree days following the peaceful resolution of Lu-Yang Elementary's \"Memory Crisis 404,\" an extraordinary medium-sized wooden steam expedition vessel lay berthed at Pier 3 of the historic deep-water docks.\n\nSpanning nearly sixty feet in length, her keel was hewn from century-old teak, shielded on the outside by heavy plates of corrosion-resistant polished brass armor. At the stern rose a glossy, soot-blackened steam funnel, flanked by dual paddle wheels powered by high-tension coiled clockwork springs and hydro-turbines.\n\nChiseled into the hardwood prow above the reinforced ram was her name—**\"The Aoki Gear\"**.\n\n\"Thirty years ago, your grandfather hammered the very first brass rivet into this ship's keel in the old drydocks.\"\n\nPrincipal Chiu stood beside the mooring bitts, wearing a navy double-breasted sailor's pea coat. The morning sun glinted against his gold-rimmed spectacles, mirroring deep contemplation in his eyes:\n\n\"Thirty years ago, we navigated this vessel to survey the hydrology of the Thousand-Island Gear Sea. Later, when anomalous abyssal clockwork currents rendered the waters perilous, the Maritime Guild declared it an exclusion zone... Little did I dream that three decades later, her helm would pass into your hands, Cheng Hao.\"\n\n\"Thank you, Principal Chiu.\"\n\nCheng Hao wore a rugged orange floatation vest over his hoodie, his brass Ghost Goggles polished immaculately and resting around his neck. Under the morning light, the boy's playful gaze had forged into the quiet resolve of a true explorer.\n\nStanding nearby, homeroom teacher Mr. Gao had fully recovered his healthy color. Smiling warmly, he presented an engraved brass nautical cylinder to Ye Yijie:\n\n\"Yijie, these are the original charts and current almanacs of the Thousand-Island Gear Sea from thirty years ago. The hydrodynamics there are extraordinary; influenced by colossal abyssal tidal gears, the ocean currents undergo unpredictable differential rotations every six hours. Out upon the open waves, your intellect will serve as the expedition's truest compass.\"\n\n\"Rest assured, Mr. Gao!\" Yijie accepted the nautical cylinder, stowing it securely inside her waterproof rucksack.\n\nToday her jet-black ponytail was tied high, framed by a sky-blue sweatband across her forehead, her delicate spectacles swapped for sea-spray-resistant titanium frames, radiating athletic poise.\n\n\"Huff... puff... WAIT FOR ME! WAIT FOR MEEEE!!\"\n\nJust then, heavy, thunderous footsteps clattered across the wooden planks of the pier!\n\n---\n\n## 二、海上大廚的保溫箱 (II. The Sea Chef's Thermal Hamper)\n\nCheng Hao and Yijie spun around in unison.\n\nAt the pier entrance, crew-cut Jiang Jiang was hauling a camouflaged, heavy-duty wheeled thermal cooler nearly half his height, sprinting toward the gangway drenched in sweat!\n\nAround his neck hung a pair of oversized naval binoculars larger than his face, a red-and-white checkered apron was tied around his waist, and most bizarre of all—slung across his back like a battle shield was an enormous, gleaming cast-iron skillet!\n\n\"Huff... puff... I'm dead! Absolutely dead!\" Jiang Jiang collapsed onto his cooler, wiping a waterfall of sweat from his forehead.\n\n\"Jiang Jiang?!\" Cheng Hao's eyes bulged. \"What on earth are you wearing? And why are you carrying a frying pan?!\"\n\n\"You have the nerve to ask?!\" Jiang Jiang planted his hands on his hips with righteous fury, flipping open the cooler lid.\n\n*WHOOOSH!* A mouth-watering aroma of fresh bakery goods instantly enveloped the entire dock!\n\nStacked in neat, golden tiers were over a hundred freshly baked, crispy pineapple buns, dozens of vacuum-sealed garlic sausages, and five enormous bags of Gear Town roasted seaweed crisps!\n\n\"You two tried to sneak off on a high-seas expedition to the Thousand-Island Gear Sea and leave me behind to take math pop quizzes?! Not on my watch!\"\n\nJiang Jiang banged on his chest frying pan with loud *CLANG-CLANG* strikes, declaring with supreme authority:\n\n\"What is the single most vital element of an ocean voyage? Nutrition! Calories! Soul-warming comfort food! Without me—your Chief Culinary Officer—you'd be chewing tasteless hardtack and succumb to scurvy in less than three days! Mr. Gao already approved my two-week culinary internship leave—you HAVE to take me!\"\n\nMr. Gao gave a helpless chuckle, nudging his spectacles and nodding to Cheng Hao: \"The boy showed up at my doorstep last night and pleaded for two straight hours in my living room... His culinary talent is truly undeniable. Take him along; having him will keep spirits high.\"\n\n\"HOORAY!!\" Jiang Jiang leaped into the air, hoisting the heavy hamper with one hand and scurrying up the gangway of \"The Aoki Gear\" like a nimble penguin.\n\nPerched on the prow railing, the origami Shiba Inu PICO eyed Jiang Jiang's pineapple buns. Its sapphire lenses blinked with delight as its tail tapped a crisp Morse sequence onto the teak decking:\n\n`--. --- --- -..` (**GOOD —— EXCELLENT!**)\n\n---\n\n## 三、皮可的兩棲渦輪模組 (III. PICO's Amphibious Turbine Module)\n\n*TOOOOT——!*\n\nWith a resonant, deep blast of her steam whistle, The Aoki Gear slipped her mooring lines, twin brass paddle wheels churning frothy white foam as she pulled steadily away from Gear Port.\n\nOn the pier, the figures of Principal Chiu and Mr. Gao dwindled in the golden morning light, eventually becoming two distant waving silhouettes against the horizon.\n\nDown in the ship's mechanical workshop belowdecks, Cheng Hao knelt by the workbench, tightening the final stainless-steel hex bolt into PICO's tail interface.\n\n*CLACK!*\n\nA crisp, satisfying mechanical detent engaged.\n\n\"Done!\" Cheng Hao wiped grease from his palms, gesturing to Yijie and Jiang Jiang. \"Synthesizing Grandpa's blueprints over the past two days, I tailored this especially for PICO—**The Amphibious Marine Propulsion Exoskeleton**!\"\n\n\"PICO, engage submerged drive mode!\"\n\nAt Cheng Hao's command, PICO stood at attention.\n\nThe paper-thin memory-alloy plates across its chassis shifted backward in a fluid *shhh-shing* wave! Its coiled tail, normally composed of seven nested rings, reconfigured within three seconds into a four-inch shrouded **superconducting high-speed hydro-turbine**!\n\nAnd beneath its four steel paws, four miniature high-vacuum suction cups deployed, allowing it to sprint across a slippery metal deck tilted at sixty degrees without slipping a single millimeter!\n\n\"Whoa! That is so cool!\" Jiang Jiang, chewing on a sausage, stared wide-eyed. \"Can it help me whisk egg whites for meringues?!\"\n\n\"Jiang Jiang! PICO is a precision reconnaissance automaton, not an eggbeater!\" Yijie rapped Jiang Jiang on the knuckles with her pen.\n\n\"It's far more than a propeller,\" Cheng Hao grinned, adjusting his goggles. \"In an open-sea emergency, its four limbs can unfold into a three-foot-wide alloy hydrofoil board, skimming across the swells at forty knots!\"\n\nPICO raised its head proudly, chiming a cheerful electronic bark: *Beep-boop!*\n\n---\n\n## 四、迷霧與閃爍的信標浮標 (IV. Fog and the Flashing Beacon Buoy)\n\nThe Aoki Gear navigated open waters under tranquil skies for four full hours.\n\nJust past midday, the pristine blue sky began undergoing an eerie transformation.\n\nThe azure water darkened rapidly into an impenetrable midnight-cyan. Stranger still, miniature golden bubbles resembling gear teeth surged from beneath the breaking swells!\n\nHumidity soared in an instant as a wall of milk-white sea fog materialized silently from the horizon, swiftly swallowing the vessel whole.\n\n\"Visibility is down to less than a hundred feet!\"\n\nJiang Jiang shouted down from the crow's nest atop the mast, binoculars pressed to his eyes: \"White fog in every direction! Wait... dark shapes beneath the keel! Massive dark silhouettes!\"\n\nCheng Hao leaped to the bridge, pulling down his brass Ghost Goggles.\n\nIn the polarized spectrum of the lenses, the underwater view made Cheng Hao gasp!\n\nLess than two hundred feet dead ahead in the deep trenches lay hundreds of jagged, towering metal-basalt reef spires! Across every spire, colossal antique bronze gears measuring dozens of feet wide interlocked, turning at varying velocities driven by powerful subterranean currents!\n\n\"The Razor Reefs of the Gear Sea!\" Yijie unfolded her waterproof charts, her face tightening. \"The currents here are ferocious; if a wooden hull drifts off the channel by even ten feet, rotating bronze teeth will shred it into matchwood!\"\n\nRight at that moment, a rhythmic bell tolled from within the dense fog ahead:\n\n*CLANG... CLANG... CLANG...*\n\nRising from the mist was a thirty-foot cast-iron navigational buoy.\n\nMounted atop the buoy, a high-intensity maritime searchlight was cutting through the soup, flashing a frantic sequence of white light pulses toward The Aoki Gear!\n\n\"An antique maritime light code!\" Yijie uncapped her pen, logging flash durations in her black journal:\n\n```\n[RAZOR REEF NAVIGATION BEACON]:\nFlash Pattern Characteristics:\n[1 flash, sustained 3 seconds] ➡️ 1s eclipse\n[3 quick flashes, 0.5s each] ➡️ 1s eclipse\n[2 flashes, 1.0s each] ➡️ 2s eclipse\n\nBase Inscription Formula:\nSafe Channel True Course (TC) Calculation:\nTC = (Phase 1 duration in seconds × 100)\n   + (Phase 2 flash count × 10)\n   + (Phase 3 total seconds × 5)\n   - 50 degrees magnetic variation!\n\nWARNING: A heading error greater than 2 degrees\nwill drive the ship into the port gear spire!\n```\n\n\"Maritime Light Characteristics and True Course calculation!\" Yijie's pen glided across the waterproof paper:\n\n\"Phase 1: 1 flash sustained 3 seconds ➡️ Duration is **3**!\"  \n\"Phase 2: 3 quick flashes ➡️ Flash count is **3**!\"  \n\"Phase 3: 2 flashes of 1s each ➡️ Total duration is 2 × 1 = **2**!\"\n\n\"Input into the True Course equation!\" Yijie shouted the arithmetic aloud:\n\n$$\\text{TC} = (3 \\times 100) + (3 \\times 10) + (2 \\times 5) - 50$$  \n$$\\text{TC} = 300 + 30 + 10 - 50 = 290^{\\circ} !$$\n\n\"**TRUE COURSE: 290 DEGREES! WEST-NORTHWEST!**\" Yijie yelled. \"Cheng Hao, hard to starboard! Lock the binnacle onto 290 degrees!\"\n\n\"Understood! Heading 290!\"\n\nGripping the heavy teak helm with both hands, Cheng Hao threw his weight into hauling the wheel half a turn to starboard!\n\n*CREEEAK——BOOM!*\n\nThe Aoki Gear listed sharply in the roiling swell, her paddle wheels howling at maximum RPM!\n\nThe exact second the bow swung around, a twenty-five-foot basalt spire studded with spinning, razor-sharp gear teeth shaved past the port copper plating by a mere **twelve inches**! Freezing spray washed over Cheng Hao's face, sending shivers of adrenaline down his spine!\n\nLike a swift marlin, The Aoki Gear threaded the 290-degree deep-water channel, knifing safely through the deadly reef!\n\n---\n\n## 五、破浪的滑行艇與海盜的號角 (V. The Wave-Skimmer and the Pirate Horn)\n\n\"Phew... WE MADE IT!\"\n\nJiang Jiang leaned over the crow's nest, clutching his chest: \"Long live Yijie! We didn't get ground into chum!\"\n\nYet as The Aoki Gear burst through the reef's fog bank, what met their eyes left all three children slack-jawed.\n\nThe mist vanished.\n\nUnfolding before them was a breathtaking, boundless ocean—\n\nDozens of islands dotted the waters, each supported by massive concentric bronze clockwork pedestals that rose and sank in majestic rhythm with the ocean swell. On the far horizon stood magnificent, ancient sea towers topped with revolving giant gear windmills!\n\nThis was the legendary **Thousand-Island Gear Sea**!\n\nYet before they could savor the wonder, a high-pitched engine whine ripped through the calm water!\n\n*VROOOOOM——BOOOOM!!*\n\nTwin plumes of rooster-tail spray cleaved the surface!\n\nA ten-foot watercraft fashioned from lightweight driftwood and salvaged brass plates was rocketing straight toward The Aoki Gear at an astonishing fifty knots!\n\nBalanced on one leg upon the skimmer's bow was a twelve-year-old girl with sun-kissed golden skin and a sporty short haircut.\n\nTilted over her head was a woven straw hat adorned with a white seagull feather, a glowing conch-shell wind gauge tied at her waist, and an eight-foot dual-bladed folding alloy oar gripped in her hand!\n\nRiding the gale, she yanked the throttle lever with practiced grace, carving a magnificent ninety-degree power slide across the water just thirty feet from The Aoki Gear, throwing up a ten-foot wall of sea foam!\n\n\"HEY! OUTSIDERS!\"\n\nHolding her oar with one hand and tipping her hat brim with the other, she flashed a dazzling, brilliant smile of healthy white teeth, shouting up at Cheng Hao:\n\n\"Stunning helmsmanship! Sneaking through the Razor Reefs without scratching your paint! I am **Lan**, Chief Navigator of Windward Island!\"\n\nYet the smile lingered on Lan's face for less than a heartbeat before her expression hardened, snapping her gaze toward the fog bank behind The Aoki Gear:\n\n\"Hard over! Your clumsy antique tub has been marked!\"\n\n*HOOOOONK————BLARE————!!*\n\nA deep, brutal mechanical fog horn roared like an ancient iron leviathan from within the mist!\n\nBursting through the fog like a mobile mountain of black iron was a hundred-foot pirate warship, crudely welded together from three salvage freighters and a retired steam locomotive!\n\nWelded to her towering ramming bow was the infamous skull insignia feared across the Thousand-Island Sea—two crossed giant spanners beneath a heavy black iron anchor!\n\nAnd standing upon the warship's quarterdeck was a thirteen-year-old youth cloaked in a tattered naval greatcoat, wearing a brass single-gear eyepatch, aiming a hissing steam-powered harpoon cannon straight at Cheng Hao's throat:\n\n\"This sea is our turf, these swells our toll! Hand over all your antique components and that mechanical pup... **or the Iron Anchor Gang will punch a sunroof through your hull!**\"\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 11, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":12,"rawContent":"# 第十二章：海風島的暴風少女\n\n## 一、海盜的飛爪與鐵鍋之威\n\n「轟！」\n\n黑鐵海盜船「破浪鐵錨號」龐大而粗糙的船頭，如同一座移動的鋼鐵懸崖，狠狠切開了海面上的浪花，停在距離青木齒輪號不到十公尺的水面上。\n\n空氣中瀰漫著燃燒劣質煤炭的刺鼻黑煙，以及濃烈的海藻焦味。\n\n巴克船長站在高聳的艦首甲板上，身上那件洗得發白的黑色海軍大衣在海風中獵獵作響。他扶了扶那隻黃銅單眼齒輪眼罩，嘴角扯出一抹自以為無比冷酷帥氣的獰笑：\n\n「我數到三！把你們的機械寵物和所有零件箱交出來！一……」\n\n「交個大頭鬼啊！看鍋！！」\n\n巴克那個「二」字還沒吐出口，一聲中氣十足的咆哮猛然在青木齒輪號的甲板上炸響！\n\n只見圍著格子圍裙的將江，不知道從哪裡爆發出一股驚人的蠻力，雙手緊握著那口足足有三十公分寬、鋥光瓦亮的黑鐵平底鍋，像揮動棒球棍一樣，迎著破空射來的一記磁力鋼索抓鉤，狠狠橫掃了過去！\n\n「噹————！！」\n\n一聲洪亮得宛如寺廟大鐘般的金屬撞擊巨響在海面上炸開！\n\n重達數公斤的鋼鐵抓鉤，竟然被將江那口布滿油光的老鐵鍋硬生生地拍得倒飛了回去，「啪嗒」一聲砸在海盜船的甲板上，砸裂了一塊厚木板！\n\n將江被反震力震得虎口發麻，但他依然氣喘吁吁地把鐵鍋護在胸前，眼睛瞪得像銅鈴：\n\n「哪裡來的小毛賊！敢動我的菠蘿麵包，我一鍋底拍平你的屁股！」\n\n海盜船上的巴克船長整個人都愣住了。他看了看被打飛的抓鉤，又看了看那個穿圍裙的小胖子，嘴角一陣劇烈抽搐：\n\n「哪來的廚子？！丁丁！給我上一百號重型發條網，把他們全抓過來！」\n\n「哇！那隻金屬小狗狗好可愛喔！」\n\n海盜船舷邊，一個只有十歲、梳著兩條朝天雙馬尾的小女孩猛地探出腦袋。她身上背著一把比她整個人還要大上一倍的生鏽維修大鐵鎚，兩眼放光地盯著船頭上的皮可：\n\n「船長！我要那隻銀色小狗狗！我要把它抓回來當枕頭！」\n\n皮可站在船頭欄杆上，兩隻幽藍色鏡頭嫌棄地瞇成了一條縫，尾巴敲擊甲板發出極快的摩斯密碼：\n\n`-.-. .-. .- --.. -.--`（**CRAZY —— 瘋子！**）\n\n---\n\n## 二、暴風舵手的撐桿飛躍\n\n「巴克！你這個收廢鐵的臭海盜，又在我們海風島的門口丟人現眼！」\n\n一聲清脆而充滿野性活力的嬌斥聲，突然從海面側翼破空傳來！\n\n「嗡————轟！！」\n\n只見那艘僅有三公尺長的輕型蒸氣滑行艇「海鷗號」，在水面上如同一隻掠海狂飆的雨燕，帶著一道雪白的弧形浪花，以五十浬的極速自兩船之間閃電般穿插而過！\n\n船頭上的小麥色短髮女孩——嵐，在小艇疾馳經過海盜船拋下的第二根牽引鋼纜的一瞬間，雙腿猛然發力！\n\n她將手中那柄兩公尺長的合金折疊船槳在水面上一點，整個人借著強大的反彈力，宛如一隻展翅的獵鷹，在半空中劃過一道優美驚險的十公尺拋物線！\n\n「刷！」\n\n嵐在半空中反手抽出一柄藏在槳柄裡的彈簧合金割刀，刀鋒精準無比地自上而下劃過那根粗大的牽引麻繩！\n\n「崩！」\n\n粗壯的纜繩瞬間被整齊斬斷，失去拉力的鋼纜帶著刺耳的呼嘯聲彈回海面。\n\n下一秒，女孩在空中輕巧地翻了個跟頭，雙腳穩穩落在了青木齒輪號的甲板上，海鷗羽毛草帽隨風微揚。\n\n「嵐？！」\n\n海盜船上的巴克船長像是被踩了尾巴的貓一樣，臉頰瞬間漲得通紅，連忙把魚叉槍藏在身後，結結巴巴地喊道：\n\n「誰……誰搶劫了！我是在進行日常的港口貨物抽檢！千島海域的規矩，外來船隻要繳納古董零件稅，這是公海慣例！」\n\n「慣例你個鬼！」嵐雙手抱胸，挑了挑英氣十足的眉毛，「這三位客人能解開剃刀暗礁的引航燈語，證明他們是懂航海的真正水手！你再敢把破船橫在航道上，信不信我下次回島，把海風島最好吃的糖漬海藻乾全扣下，一片都不分給你！」\n\n「妳……妳敢！」巴克船長氣得跳腳，但他身後背著大鐵鎚的丁丁卻在一旁瘋狂扯他的衣角，小聲嘟囔：「船長，認輸吧，上次沒糖漬海藻乾，你偷吃了三天生魚乾，臉都綠了……」\n\n「噗嗤……」站在後面的葉旖緁忍不住輕笑出聲。\n\n誠浩看著眼前這個帥氣灑脫的短髮女孩，上前一步微笑道：「謝謝妳替我們解圍，我是誠浩，她是葉旖緁，那是將江，還有皮可。」\n\n「叫我嵐就行！」女孩豪爽地在誠浩肩上拍了一記，力道大得讓誠浩差點沒站穩，「你們剛才轉向避開尖刺齒輪的那一手舵法，真漂亮！不過——」\n\n嵐的話音還沒落下，整片原本微波蕩漾的海面，突然發出了一聲如同地底熔岩翻滾般的沉悶轟鳴！\n\n---\n\n## 三、深淵巨齒：發條大漩渦\n\n「咕嚕嚕嚕嚕——！！」\n\n青木齒輪號與破浪鐵錨號底部的海水，顏色在一瞬間變成了墨一般的深黑！\n\n無數巨大的白色泡沫自海底瘋狂湧出，水流開始以一種不可思議的狂暴速度，順時針劇烈旋轉！\n\n一個直徑超過一百公尺的巨大海底漩渦，毫无徵兆地在兩艘船的正中央轟然塌陷開來！\n\n「是『發條潮汐大逆流』！」嵐的臉色瞬間大變，剛才的輕鬆灑脫一掃而空，「糟了！今天海風島的鐘樓發條比平時慢了三分鐘！海底的古代潮汐水泵提前逆轉了！」\n\n透過護目鏡的光譜視野，誠浩清清楚楚地看見——\n\n在深達三十公尺的海底裂縫中，兩枚直徑超過五十公尺的青銅古代巨型抽水齒輪，正在暗流的驅動下瘋狂對咬！巨大的吸力宛如一頭張開巨口的深海巨獸，產生了高達二十節的恐怖向心拉力！\n\n「舵輪打不動了！」誠浩衝進駕駛艙，雙手死死拉住舵輪。\n\n但任憑青木齒輪號兩側的外輪如何高速旋轉，在巨大的向心水流拉扯下，船身依然以每秒數公尺的速度，打著轉滑向漩渦那漆黑深邃的中心黑洞！\n\n另一邊，重達百噸的黑鐵海盜船同樣難以倖免。笨重的老式蒸汽火車頭鍋爐發出痛苦的尖叫，履帶外輪在狂暴的亂流中被折斷了好幾根葉片！\n\n「救命啊！我的平底鍋要被吸進去了！」將江死死抱著甲板上的桅杆，兩條腿被狂風吹得在半空中橫著飄。\n\n「誠浩！單靠一艘船的發動機推力，根本衝不出這個向心力場！」\n\n旖緁死死趴在駕駛台的海圖桌上，眼鏡上的防滑繩繃得筆直。她的指尖在防水筆記本上飛速劃過：\n\n「漩渦的向心流速是 22 節！青木齒輪號的最大推力是 14 節，海盜船的重型蒸汽機是 12 節！分開逃跑，兩艘船在一分鐘後都會被拖進海底齒輪絞碎！」\n\n「分開不行，那就合體！」誠浩腦海中靈光一閃，對著對面的海盜船狂吼：\n\n「巴克！不想餵魚的話，把你的主纜繩拋過來！兩船互鎖，做『向量牽引』！」\n\n「什麼？！把老子的命交給你們？！」巴克在風浪中大喊。\n\n「不想死就少廢話！快拋！」嵐站在船頭，合金船槳直指對方的鼻尖。\n\n巴克咬緊牙關，一腳踹下船頭的發條拋纜機：「丁丁！發射雙聯鋼纜！！」\n\n「嗖——砰！」\n\n兩根拳頭粗細的鋼索破空而來，皮可化作一道銀色閃電，小鐵爪在空中凌空抓住纜繩，精準無比地將其死死纏繞在青木齒輪號兩側的主受力柱上！\n\n---\n\n## 四、合力矩與伯努利夾角\n\n兩艘船被鋼纜緊緊相連，在狂暴的漩渦邊緣劇烈晃動！\n\n「旖緁！計算合力夾角！」誠浩大喊。\n\n「力學向量合成公式（Vector Resultant Force）！」\n\n旖緁的雙眼如同精密的光學傳感器，死死盯著兩船之間的牽引角度與漩渦切線：\n\n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{合}} = \\sqrt{F_1^2 + F_2^2 + 2 F_1 F_2 \\cos\\theta}$$\n\n「聽好！兩艘船不能並排向前衝，那樣推力方向會被漩渦的向心水流抵消！」  \n「海盜船在左翼，承擔切線突破力 $F_1 = 12$ 節！」  \n「我們在右翼，負責離心加速力 $F_2 = 14$ 節！」  \n「兩艘船的航向夾角 $\\theta$ 必須精確調整為——**六十度（$\\cos 60^{\\circ} = 0.5$）**！」\n\n旖緁抬起頭，聲音穿透滔天巨浪：\n\n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{合}} = \\sqrt{12^2 + 14^2 + (2 \\times 12 \\times 14 \\times 0.5)}$$  \n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{合}} = \\sqrt{144 + 196 + 168} = \\sqrt{508} \\approx 22.54 \\text{ 節！}$$\n\n「**22.54 節！大於漩渦的 22 節向心吸力！**」旖緁大聲吶喊，「只要保持六十度夾角，我們就能沿著漩渦的切線外沿，借著離心力被硬生生『甩』出去！」\n\n「巴克！聽到了嗎？！左舵三十度！全速前進！」誠浩對著通話管狂吼。\n\n「老子雖然討厭數學，但這一次信你們了！」巴克一把拉下蒸汽閥門到底，「火骨，給老子把爐子燒化！！」\n\n「等等！蒸汽壓力還差最後一格！」將江突然在甲板上大叫。\n\n只見將江一把拉開自己的大號保溫箱，抓起兩大桶用來煎菠蘿麵包的特級純豬油，奮不顧身地朝著青木齒輪號的鍋爐添煤口猛倒了進去！\n\n「吃我的超級高熱量脂肪吧！！」\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n高純度動物油脂接觸到爐火的瞬間，青木齒輪號的煙囪中猛地噴出一道長達五公尺的熾熱金黃色火焰！鍋爐蒸汽壓力錶在一秒鐘內直接爆表衝入紅線！\n\n兩具黃銅外輪以不可思議的極限轉速狂暴旋轉，海面被切出兩道沖天的白色激流！\n\n在六十度黃金夾角的引導下，兩艘相連的船隻在漩渦內壁上劃出了一道驚心動魄的螺旋軌跡，宛如一顆脫膛而出的砲彈，擦著漩渦中心咬合的青銅巨齒邊緣，帶著一聲驚天動地的呼嘯，轟然衝破了漩渦的束縛，重重砸在平靜的外海面上！\n\n「嘩啦啦——！」\n\n漫天的白沫如傾盆大雨般落下。\n\n身後，海底那座沉重的潮汐齒輪伴隨著一陣沉悶的轟鳴，緩緩閉合，漩渦徹底平息。\n\n---\n\n## 五、翡翠潟湖與血紅信標\n\n「哈……哈哈！衝出來了！我們衝出來了！！」\n\n將江抹了一把滿臉的油污和海水，舉著平底鍋在甲板上瘋狂跳舞。\n\n海盜船上的巴克船長扶正了被吹歪的眼罩，看著身邊完好無損的旗艦，又看了一眼對面甲板上的誠浩和旖緁，神情複雜無比。\n\n最後，這個嘴硬的少年海盜冷哼了一聲，抱著雙臂扭過頭去：\n\n「哼……陸地上的小鬼，算你們有兩把刷子。這一次算我們扯平了！丁丁，收起鋼纜！」\n\n小女孩丁丁一邊收線，一邊把小腦袋探出船舷，眼淚汪汪地對著皮可揮手：\n\n「銀色小狗狗！下次見面我一定會用大香腸把你換過來的！再見啦！」\n\n破浪鐵錨號拉響了一聲短促的汽笛，調轉船頭，朝著群島背面的避風港緩緩駛去。\n\n在嵐的「海鷗號」引航下，青木齒輪號穿過了一條狹窄陡峭的石灰岩水道，眼前豁然開朗。\n\n展現在所有人面前的，是一座美麗得宛如人間仙境的世外桃源——**海風島**。\n\n這裡的水面呈現出一種如寶石般透徹的翡翠綠色。水面上漂浮著數百座由巨大黃銅浮桶支撐的高腳木屋，屋頂上旋轉著精巧的發條風向雞；懸索吊橋橫跨在青翠的懸崖與瀑布之間，島民們划著小木舟在水巷中穿梭，空氣中瀰漫著烤魚與甘甜椰奶的香氣。\n\n「歡迎來到海風島！」嵐站在船頭，燦爛地張開雙臂。\n\n然而，青木齒輪號剛剛在老碼頭邊拋下船錨，趴在船頭曬乾合金毛皮的皮可，兩隻耳朵突然猛地豎立了起來！\n\n「嗶————！！」\n\n皮可發出了一聲前所未有的尖銳長鳴，眼部的幽藍鏡頭在瞬間切換成了**警暴紅光**！\n\n誠浩心頭一跳，立刻戴上黃銅護目鏡，順著皮可注視的方向望去——\n\n只見在海風島外海數公里處的一座孤立礁石上空，一道刺目無比的**血紅色求救信號彈**，正尖嘯著撕裂了傍晚的彩霞！\n\n透過護目鏡的高倍放大光譜，誠浩清清楚楚地看見，在求救信號彈下方的深綠色海面下，正有十幾道長達數公尺的冰冷鋼鐵流線型黑影，以超過四十浬的恐怖速度，成群結隊地撕裂浪花，朝著信標直撲而去！\n\n那些鋼鐵黑影的背脊上，全都豎立著泛著森冷金屬寒光的倒三角背鰭！\n\n那是——**全自動高壓機械獵鯊群**！\n\n而在護目鏡的右下角，一行被截獲的緊急加密電報代碼，瘋狂跳了出來：\n\n> `[DISTRESS CALL: 迷失燈塔哨戒艇遭伏擊！]`  \n> `[襲擊者：黑潮重工 · 第一深海清掃分隊！]`  \n> `[目標：奪取老莫里斯手中的古代星象石板！]`\n\n---\n\n*(第十二章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十二章：海風島的暴風少女 (Chapter 12: The Tempest Girl of Windward Island)\n\n## 一、海盜的飛爪與鐵鍋之威 (I. The Pirate Grapple and the Power of the Skillet)\n\n*BOOM!*\n\nThe massive, crude iron prow of the pirate flagship \"Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor\" sheared through the ocean swells like a mobile iron cliff, halting less than thirty feet from The Aoki Gear.\n\nThe air hung thick with pungent black smoke from combustion of low-grade coal and the acrid tang of charred kelp.\n\nCaptain Buck stood atop the towering forecastle, his sun-bleached naval greatcoat snapping violently in the gale. Nudging his brass single-gear eyepatch, he curled his lip into a grim, self-satisfied smirk:\n\n\"I'll count to three! Surrender your mechanical beast and all your salvage crates! One...\"\n\n\"Surrender your face! TASTE THE SKILLET!!\"\n\nBefore Buck could utter the word \"two,\" a roar of righteous thunder detonated across the deck of The Aoki Gear!\n\nCheckered apron fluttering, Jiang Jiang summoned an astonishing surge of brute strength, gripping his gleaming twelve-inch cast-iron skillet with both hands like a baseball bat, swinging it in a ferocious arc straight into the path of an incoming magnetic grappling claw!\n\n*CLANG————!!*\n\nA resonant metallic crash echoing like a temple bell boomed across the sea!\n\nThe multi-pound steel grapple was smacked in reverse by Jiang Jiang's seasoned iron skillet, rocketing backward with a sharp *CLATTER* onto the pirate deck, splintering a heavy teak plank!\n\nThe recoil jarred Jiang Jiang's palms numb, yet he planted his feet and held the skillet before his chest, eyes wide as saucers:\n\n\"What kind of petty pirate tries to touch my pineapple buns?! I'll flatten your rear with my seasoned iron cast!\"\n\nAboard the pirate vessel, Captain Buck froze in utter disbelief. Looking from the ricocheted grapple to the chubby boy in the apron, his eye twitched uncontrollably:\n\n\"Where did this cook crawl out of?! Ding-Ding! Deploy the heavy-duty Size 100 clockwork capture net—bag every single one of them!\"\n\n\"Waaah! That little metal puppy is so precious!\"\n\nPeeking over the pirate bulwarks, a ten-year-old girl with bouncing twin pigtails popped her head out. Slung across her back was a rusted industrial spanner twice her size, her eyes sparkling with adoration at PICO:\n\n\"Captain! I want that silver doggy! I'm going to capture it and use it as my pillow!\"\n\nPerched on the bow rail, PICO's sapphire lenses narrowed into disdainful slits, its tail tapping a furious Morse sequence against the deck:\n\n`-.-. .-. .- --.. -.--` (**CRAZY —— LUNATICS!**)\n\n---\n\n## 二、暴風舵手的撐桿飛躍 (II. The Storm Helmsman's Vault)\n\n\"Buck! You scrap-metal scoundrel, embarrassing yourself on Windward Island's front porch again!\"\n\nA crisp, fiercely spirited cry ripped through the maritime air from the starboard flank!\n\n*VROOOOOM——BOOOOM!!*\n\nThe ten-foot steam skimmer \"Seagull\" sliced across the water like a diving petrel, carving a brilliant white crescent wave as it darted between the two vessels at fifty knots!\n\nBalanced on the skimmer's bow, the sun-kissed girl with sporty cropped hair—Lan—coiled her legs with explosive force the instant the skimmer crossed beneath the pirate ship's second tow cable!\n\nPlanting the tip of her eight-foot alloy folding oar into the swell, she rode the recoil into an astonishing thirty-foot aerial arc like an eagle in flight!\n\n*SHING!*\n\nIn midair, Lan drew a spring-loaded alloy blade concealed within the oar grip, slicing down through the heavy hemp hawser with surgical precision!\n\n*SNAP!*\n\nThe thick hawser severed instantly, whipped back across the waves with a whistling shriek.\n\nA heartbeat later, the girl completed a graceful aerial somersault, landing lightly on the teak deck of The Aoki Gear, her seagull-feathered straw hat tilting with the breeze.\n\n\"Lan?!\"\n\nCaptain Buck jumped like a cat having its tail stepped on, his cheeks flushing crimson. Hastily tucking his harpoon gun behind his back, he stammered defensively:\n\n\"W-Who said anything about robbing anyone?! This is standard maritime cargo inspection! Thousand-Island regulations require all foreign hulls to pay antique component tariffs—it's high-seas protocol!\"\n\n\"Protocol, my foot!\" Lan crossed her arms, raising an imperious eyebrow. \"These three travelers deciphered the Razor Reef light signals, proving they are true, seasoned sailors! If you dare park your rusted barge across the channel again, see if I don't confiscate every slice of candied kelp crisps on Windward Island next time—not a single crumb for you!\"\n\n\"Y-You wouldn't dare!\" Captain Buck sputtered in fury, but behind him, pigtail-clad Ding-Ding tugged at his coat hem, whispering aloud: \"Give it up, Captain. Last time she withheld the kelp crisps, you chewed on raw dried mackerel for three days until your face turned green...\"\n\n*Pfft...* Standing behind them, Ye Yijie couldn't help stifling a giggle.\n\nCheng Hao stepped forward, offering a warm smile to the spirited girl: \"Thank you for intervening. I'm Cheng Hao, this is Ye Yijie, that's Jiang Jiang, and this is PICO.\"\n\n\"Just call me Lan!\" She clapped Cheng Hao on the shoulder with enough force to make his knees buckle. \"That evasive turn past the spiny gear reef was brilliant helmsmanship! However—\"\n\nBefore Lan could finish, the calm ocean waters erupted with a subterranean rumble like boiling abyssal magma!\n\n---\n\n## 三、深淵巨齒：發條大漩渦 (III. Abyssal Fangs: The Clockwork Maelstrom)\n\n*GLUG-GLUG-ROAAAR——!!*\n\nThe water beneath The Aoki Gear and the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor darkened instantly into ink!\n\nMassive white froth surged from the seabed as the water began spinning in a furious, clockwise vortex!\n\nA colossal whirlpool over three hundred feet across collapsed abruptly right between the two vessels!\n\n\"The Clockwork Tidal Reversal!\" Lan's easygoing smile vanished, replaced by sheer alarm. \"Disaster! Windward Island's clock tower spring was three minutes slow today! The ancient seabed tide pump reversed early!\"\n\nThrough the polarized spectrum of his Ghost Goggles, Cheng Hao saw the nightmare with terrifying clarity—\n\nA hundred feet below in the abyssal trench, two gargantuan antique bronze water-pumping gears over a hundred and fifty feet in diameter were grinding together in furious reverse! The vortex acted like the gaping maw of a deep-sea leviathan, generating a terrifying centripetal drag exceeding twenty knots!\n\n\"The helm won't answer!\" Cheng Hao dashed into the wheelhouse, throwing his weight against the spokes.\n\nYet no matter how furiously The Aoki Gear's paddle wheels churned, the relentless centripetal current dragged the vessel spinning toward the black abyss at the center of the vortex at several yards per second!\n\nNearby, the hundred-ton iron pirate ship fared no better. Her antiquated steam locomotive boiler wailed in agony, several paddle blades snapping clean off in the violent turbulence!\n\n\"Help! My cast-iron skillet is getting sucked in!\" Jiang Jiang wrapped both arms around the mainmast, his legs flapping horizontally in the gale.\n\n\"Cheng Hao! A single ship's thrust cannot overcome this centripetal force field!\"\n\nYijie braced herself against the chart table, her notebook pages flapping violently:\n\n\"The whirlpool's centripetal current velocity is 22 knots! The Aoki Gear produces 14 knots of forward thrust, and the pirate steam engine produces 12 knots! If we try to flee separately, both ships will be pulled into the abyssal teeth within sixty seconds!\"\n\n\"If we can't escape alone, we unite!\" An engineering spark ignited in Cheng Hao's mind, roaring through the megaphone:\n\n\"Buck! If you don't want to become fish food, heave your main towlines across! Lash hulls together for a **Vector Traction Maneuver**!\"\n\n\"WHAT?! Entrust our lives to you landlubbers?!\" Buck screamed through the sea spray.\n\n\"Shut up and throw the lines if you want to live!\" Lan shouted, leveling her alloy oar at his nose.\n\nBuck gritted his teeth, stomping on the spring-loaded line-thrower: \"Ding-Ding! LAUNCH THE DUAL HAWSERS!!\"\n\n*WHOOSH——THUD!*\n\nTwo thick steel cables shot through the air. PICO blurred into a silver flash, catching the hawsers in midair with steel claws, lashing them securely around The Aoki Gear's primary load-bearing bollards!\n\n---\n\n## 四、合力矩與伯努利夾角 (IV. Resultant Vectors and the Golden Angle)\n\nTethered by heavy steel cables, both ships pitched violently along the vortex rim!\n\n\"Yijie! Calculate the resultant vector angle!\" Cheng Hao bellowed.\n\n\"Vector Resultant Force Equation!\"\n\nYijie's eyes functioned like high-precision optical sensors, locking onto the towing angle and the tangent of the vortex:\n\n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{net}} = \\sqrt{F_1^2 + F_2^2 + 2 F_1 F_2 \\cos\\theta}$$\n\n\"Listen carefully! We cannot charge forward side by side—that aligns thrust against the centripetal current!\"  \n\"The pirate ship holds the port flank, providing tangential breakthrough force $F_1 = 12$ knots!\"  \n\"We take the starboard flank, providing centrifugal acceleration force $F_2 = 14$ knots!\"  \n\"The course angle $\\theta$ between both hulls must be locked at exactly—**sixty degrees ($\\cos 60^{\\circ} = 0.5$)**!\"\n\nYijie raised her voice above the thunder of the crashing waves:\n\n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{net}} = \\sqrt{12^2 + 14^2 + (2 \\times 12 \\times 14 \\times 0.5)}$$  \n$$\\vec{F}_{\\text{net}} = \\sqrt{144 + 196 + 168} = \\sqrt{508} \\approx 22.54 \\text{ knots!}$$\n\n\"**22.54 KNOTS! GREATER THAN THE 22-KNOT CENTRIPETAL DRAG!**\" Yijie screamed. \"Hold sixty degrees, and centrifugal force will sling us outward along the tangent of the whirlpool!\"\n\n\"Buck! Did you copy that?! Port rudder thirty degrees! FULL SPEED AHEAD!\" Cheng Hao barked into the speaking tube.\n\n\"I despise mathematics, but I'm trusting you this once!\" Buck slammed the throttle to the firewall. \"Fire-Bones, MELT THE FURNACE!!\"\n\n\"Wait! We're one bar short of boiler pressure!\" Jiang Jiang shrieked from the deck.\n\nThrowing open his oversized cooler, Jiang Jiang hauled out two massive tubs of pure pork lard meant for frying pineapple buns, hurling them straight into The Aoki Gear's firebox door!\n\n\"TASTE MY ULTRA-HIGH-CALORIE FAT SURGE!!\"\n\n*BOOOOOM——!!*\n\nThe moment the refined fat hit the roaring coals, a sixteen-foot pillar of golden flame roared from The Aoki Gear's funnel! The steam pressure gauge spiked past the redline in a heartbeat!\n\nBoth brass paddle wheels spun at blinding RPMs, churning two titanic rooster tails into the sky!\n\nGuided by the sixty-degree golden angle, the twin lashed vessels traced a breathtaking spiral along the vortex wall, rocketing outward like an artillery shell past the grinding bronze teeth at the center, bursting free with a thunderous roar to slam safely onto the tranquil outer waters!\n\n*SPLAAASH——!*\n\nA torrential shower of sea foam cascaded down like tropical rain.\n\nBehind them, the abyssal tidal gear closed with a subterranean thud, the maelstrom calming into glass.\n\n---\n\n## 五、翡翠潟湖與血紅信標 (V. The Emerald Lagoon and the Crimson Flare)\n\n\"Ha... Haha! WE BROKE OUT! WE'RE ALIVE!!\"\n\nJiang Jiang wiped grease and sea salt from his face, dancing across the deck with his skillet held high.\n\nAboard the pirate ship, Captain Buck straightened his crooked eyepatch. Looking from his intact flagship to Cheng Hao and Yijie on the opposite deck, his expression was a battleground of emotion.\n\nFinally, the stubborn youth crossed his arms and looked away with a gruff scoff:\n\n\"Hmph... You landlubbers have some grit after all. We'll call it even this time! Ding-Ding, cast off the lines!\"\n\nReeling in the cables, little Ding-Ding leaned over the gunwale, waving tearfully at PICO:\n\n\"Silver puppy! Next time I see you, I'll trade an enormous sausage for you! Goodbye!\"\n\nThe Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor gave a brief toot of her whistle, turning her prow toward the sheltered harbor on the far side of the archipelago.\n\nGuided by Lan's skimmer \"Seagull,\" The Aoki Gear navigated a narrow limestone sea channel, bursting into a breathtaking paradise.\n\nUnfurled before them was the jewel of the sea—**Windward Island**.\n\nThe water here glowed a translucent, jewel-like emerald green. Hundreds of stilt houses supported by colossal brass pontoons floated upon the lagoon, topped with whimsical clockwork weathercocks. Suspended rope bridges linked lush verdant cliffs to cascading waterfalls, islanders paddling outrigger canoes through water alleys filled with the scent of grilled fish and sweet coconut milk.\n\n\"Welcome to Windward Island!\" Lan spread her arms proudly from the prow.\n\nYet just as The Aoki Gear dropped anchor by the weathered pier, PICO, sunbathing on the forecastle, suddenly snapped its ears straight up!\n\n*BEEEEEEP————!!*\n\nThe pup unleashed an unprecedented, shrill warning howl, its sapphire optics flaring instantly into **blood-red alert**!\n\nCheng Hao's heart leaped into his throat. Pulling down his goggles, he traced PICO's line of sight toward the outer reef—\n\nMiles offshore above an isolated crag, a piercing **blood-red distress flare** shrieked into the twilight sky, carving through the sunset clouds!\n\nThrough the high-magnification spectrum of the goggles, Cheng Hao saw a dozen streamlined black steel shapes tearing through the water at forty knots beneath the red smoke, homing in on the distress point!\n\nRising from their armored spines were razor-sharp, inverted-triangle dorsal fins!\n\nA pack of—**Automated High-Pressure Mechanical Hunting Sharks**!\n\nAnd in the lower corner of the goggles, an intercepted emergency encrypted telegram decoded furiously across the lens:\n\n> `[DISTRESS CALL: LOST LIGHTHOUSE PATROL SKIFF AMBUSHED!]`  \n> `[ATTACKER: KUROSHIO HEAVY INDUSTRIES · 1ST ABYSSAL PURGE SQUADRON!]`  \n> `[OBJECTIVE: SEIZE THE ANCIENT CELESTIAL SLATE FROM OLD MORRIS!]`\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 12, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":13,"rawContent":"# 第十三章：鐵錨幫的發條海盜船\n\n## 一、海盜的榮譽與結盟的號角\n\n「咻————啪！」\n\n刺目欲裂的血紅色信號彈，在海風島外海的暮色中拖曳出一道濃稠的硝煙。\n\n老碼頭邊，海風島的民居水巷頓時陷入了一陣慌亂。孩子們被大人拉進木屋，一扇扇雕刻著海鳥圖騰的厚木窗紛紛關閉。\n\n「那是老守燈人莫里斯的專屬緊急信標！」\n\n嵐站在青木齒輪號的甲板上，雙手死死攥著折疊船槳，手背上的青筋清晰可見，那雙原本明亮靈動的眼睛裡燃燒著憤怒的火光：\n\n「三個月前，迷失燈塔的永恆光束無故熄滅，整片海域陷入濃霧。莫里斯爺爺一直獨自留守在燈塔周圍的哨戒艇上調查……黑潮重工這群貪婪的強盜，居然敢在我們的家門口動手！」\n\n「黑潮重工？」葉旖緁推了推鈦合金眼鏡，迅速從筆記本中調出資料，「難道是總部位於西大陸海事科技財閥？第一卷中逮捕的沈啟明，他的離岸帳戶就接受過黑潮重工的巨額資金！」\n\n「沒錯，這是一條線上的毒蛇！」誠浩眼神冷冽，一把拉下額頭上的黃銅護目鏡，「莫里斯是爺爺三十年前的生死之交，我們必須去救他！」\n\n「我也去！我的菠蘿麵包需要和平的海域！」將江把大鐵鍋在腰帶上一卡，雙手抓住了舵輪旁邊的蒸汽閥門。\n\n「嗚————嘟————！！」\n\n就在青木齒輪號準備斬斷纜繩出擊的瞬間，身後的避風港水道裡，突然傳來了一陣震耳欲聾的粗暴汽笛！\n\n只見黑鐵巨艦「破浪鐵錨號」噴吐著滾滾濃黑的煤煙，以野蠻無比的姿態橫切到了青木齒輪號的身側！\n\n巴克船長身披黑色海軍大衣，單腳踩在船頭的鐵錨砲架上，齒輪單眼眼罩泛著森然的金屬光澤。他手裡的蒸汽魚叉槍猛地往甲板上一頓，傲慢又狂野地咧嘴大笑：\n\n「喂！陸地來的小鬼！你們以為千島齒輪海是你們過家家的浴缸嗎？！」\n\n「巴克！你想趁火打劫？！」嵐厲聲嬌斥。\n\n「放屁！」巴克啐了一口唾沫，冷哼道，「老子是海盜，但老子是千島齒輪海土生土長的發條海盜！黑潮重工那群穿西裝的走狗，把這片海域當成他們的私人油田，還想抓老莫里斯？問過老子船頭的這門鐵錨砲沒有？！」\n\n站在巴克身後的十歲怪力蘿莉丁丁，揮舞著那把比她人還大的生鏽鐵鎚，興奮地大叫：\n\n「聯手！聯手打爛黑潮的鐵罐頭！打完之後我要借銀色小狗抱一個晚上！」\n\n誠浩看著巴克那張雖滿是煤灰卻寫滿傲骨的臉，嘴角揚起一抹微笑，對著海盜少主伸出拳頭：\n\n「青木齒輪號負責高速機動突防，破浪鐵錨號負責重火力壓制，敢不敢賭一把誰先擊碎敵人的旗艦？！」\n\n巴克狠狠一拳砸在誠浩的手背上，金屬護腕撞擊出耀眼的火星：\n\n「賭就賭！誰輸了，誰就給全船人洗一個月的鍋爐！鐵錨幫全體——滿舵！全速前進！！」\n\n---\n\n## 二、鋼鐵死神：高壓機械獵鯊\n\n「嘩啦————！」\n\n兩艘戰艦同時拉響戰鬥警報，如同一黑一金兩條怒龍，並排撕裂了海風島的翡翠潟湖，以二十節的極速撲向三公里外的血紅信標礁！\n\n當兩艘船衝出潟湖水道的剎那，眼前的慘烈景象讓所有人倒抽了一口涼氣。\n\n只見在孤懸海中的「黑礁岩」邊緣，一艘只有七公尺長的老式木質巡邏艇，已經被撞得千瘡百孔，船底擱淺在犬牙交錯的珊瑚礁上，海水正汩汩湧入船艙。\n\n而在巡邏艇周圍直徑兩百公尺的水域內，海水如同開水般劇烈沸騰！\n\n十幾道長達四公尺、通體覆蓋著冷軋深海合金裝甲的龐然大物，正以超過四十浬的狂暴速度，在海面下高速巡弋！\n\n它們的背部豎立著鋒利如剃刀的碳纖維倒三角鰭，頭部嵌著兩排由高壓液壓活塞驅動的鎢鋼鋸齒，泛著令人心悸的幽暗紅光。每一次擺尾，都在海面上拉出一條雪白的空化激流！\n\n更可怕的是，在機械鯊魚群的後方數百公尺外，靜靜停泊著一艘長達五十公尺、通體漆黑、沒有任何舷窗的隱形無人水面母艦。母艦頂部的紅色雷達正在瘋狂旋轉，發出高頻脈衝，指揮著獵鯊群進行最後的收網撕咬！\n\n「是黑潮重工的**『深海清掃者 Mk-III 型』機械獵鯊**！」旖緁手持聲納監聽器，臉色煞白，「它們的咬合力高達五噸，連鋼板都能一口咬穿！巡邏艇上的裝甲最多只能再撐三分鐘！」\n\n「轟！」\n\n一頭機械獵鯊猛地自海面下一躍而起，張開森然的鋸齒巨口，狠狠撕扯下了巡邏艇船尾的一大塊舵板！木屑與金屬火花在黃昏的夜空中狂暴炸裂！\n\n「開砲！！給我轟爛這群鐵皮泥鰍！！」\n\n巴克船長怒吼一聲，親自拉下鐵錨砲的擊發閥門！\n\n「咚————！！」\n\n一記沉悶如雷霆的火砲轟鳴炸響，一枚重達兩百公斤的帶刺實心發條抓錨裹挾著滾滾濃煙呼嘯而出，重重砸在一頭機械獵鯊的背甲上！\n\n「鐺！」\n\n然而，令人震驚的一幕發生了——\n\n這記足以擊穿貨船甲板的重砲，竟然只是在獵鯊的超硬度冷軋鎢鋼裝甲上擦出了一大串耀眼的火星，硬生生被滑彈彈開！那頭獵鯊甚至連晃都沒晃一下，冰冷的電子紅眼猛地轉向，鎖定了破浪鐵錨號！\n\n「沒用的！」嵐操控著海鷗號疾馳在側翼，大聲疾呼，「它們的裝甲經過深海抗壓硬化，常規實體砲彈根本打不穿！它們唯一的弱點是控制頭部的聲納導航儀！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、聲波共振與水翼衝浪極限衝鋒\n\n「既然物理打不穿，那就用物理共振瓦解它！」\n\n葉旖緁摘下耳機，將水下聽音器捕捉到的一組高頻聲波頻譜圖拍在海圖桌上：\n\n```\n【黑潮機械獵鯊集群通信數據】：\n聲納導航中心頻率：f = 40 kHz (40,000 Hz) 超聲波\n海水介質中聲速：v ≈ 1500 m/s\n集群同步脈衝：每秒 120 次連續掃描\n\n物理破譯核心：\n波動方程波長：λ = v / f\nλ = 1500 / 40000 = 0.0375 m = 3.75 cm！\n\n弱點提示：\n每頭獵鯊頭頂均有一處長度剛好為 3.75 cm 的聲學共振腔！\n若以相同頻率、反相 180°（Anti-phase）注入反相破壞性聲波，\n將引發內部壓電陶瓷傳感器瞬間超載自爆！\n```\n\n「**波長 3.75 公分！反相破壞性干擾（Destructive Interference）！**」\n\n旖緁的眼中閃爍著智慧的光芒：「誠浩！獵鯊的通訊頻率是 40 千赫茲！只要將反向聲波探針精準插入領頭鯊的頭頂聲學腔，就能引發整個鯊群的聲納網絡多米諾骨牌連鎖短路崩潰！」\n\n「但是誰能靠近那些以四十浬奔馳的水中怪物？！」巴克大吼。\n\n「我能！」\n\n誠浩猛地抬起頭，拍了拍身旁蓄勢待發的銀色機械犬：「皮可！變形——**水翼衝浪板模式（Hydrofoil Mode）**！」\n\n「喀啦啦啦——！」\n\n伴隨著一陣令人眼花繚亂的記憶合金流動，皮可的身軀瞬間展開為一塊寬達一公尺、表面雕刻著導流水槽的雙層水翼衝浪板！它的尾部噴水渦輪發出高亢純淨的蜂鳴，兩側伸出兩道貼水滑行的超導滑履！\n\n誠浩一把抓起自己的多功能瑞士刀螺絲筆，將頂端的導電探針拉長為一根三十公分的微型聲波發射天線，頻率旋鈕精準卡死在 **40 kHz** 的反相位置！\n\n「將江！給我最大推力！」誠浩單腳踩上水翼板，英姿颯爽地立於船舷邊緣。\n\n「好嘞！看我的終極推動力——特製高壓蒸氣彈射！」\n\n將江怒吼一聲，手中的黑鐵平底鍋狠狠砸在青木齒輪號的應急彈射閥門上！\n\n「砰————！！」\n\n一道熾熱的蒸氣在船尾爆開，誠浩腳踏皮可化成的水翼衝浪板，宛如一道離弦的銀色利箭，帶著撕裂夜空的尖嘯，直接貼著海面高速滑射而出！\n\n---\n\n## 四、波峰上的致命一刺\n\n「太瘋狂了！那小子居然敢在鯊魚群上衝浪！」巴克船長手裡的望遠鏡差點掉在甲板上。\n\n此時的海面上，夕陽已然落入海平線，深黑色的海浪波濤洶湧。\n\n誠浩躬著身子，在高速水翼板帶來的狂暴氣流中死死穩住重心。皮可四隻抓扣吸盤牢牢鎖定著誠浩的防滑鞋底，水下涵道螺旋槳噴射出長達三公尺的白色水龍！\n\n時速四十五浬！\n\n在黃銅護目鏡的超感光熱成像中，海水中的雜波被徹底過濾，只剩下一頭體長近五公尺、背部泛著金屬金光的「鯊群指揮官」，正帶著三頭僚鯊從深水區直衝而上，張開血盆大口朝著誠浩的落點狠狠噬來！\n\n五公尺！三公尺！一公尺！\n\n「嵐！就是現在！」誠浩在狂風中大吼。\n\n「交給我吧！」\n\n只見側翼疾馳的蒸氣滑行艇「海鷗號」，竟然以神乎其技的角度迎著巨浪高速側滑！嵐雙手猛拉船舵，將整艘滑行艇的左舷高高翹起，形成了一道天然的三十度水上傾斜跳台！\n\n「上跳台！！」\n\n誠浩眼神一凜，操控皮可順著海鷗號翹起的船底水翼狂飆而上！\n\n「咻————！」\n\n水翼衝浪板借著滑行艇的衝力凌空飛躍，在半空中劃過一道高達七公尺的耀眼銀色弧線！\n\n在那頭指揮官獵鯊自水面躍起、鋸齒即將合攏的一剎那，誠浩在半空中一個極限側身翻滾，右手握緊聲波螺絲筆，筆尖匯聚著耀眼的藍色高頻電光，對著獵鯊頭頂那道 3.75 公分的狹長散熱縫隙，狠狠刺了下去！\n\n「滋滋滋————轟隆！！」\n\n**40 kHz 反相破壞性共振脈衝，瞬間灌入！**\n\n物理聲學的破壞力在這一刻展現得淋漓盡致！\n\n超聲波在密閉的共振腔內形成相位抵消死鎖，強大的聲壓在千分之一秒內將獵鯊內部的壓電陶瓷傳感器硬生生震成了齏粉！\n\n「滋啦——啪啪啪！」\n\n指揮官獵鯊雙眼的紅光瞬間熄滅，短路的電弧如同狂暴的雷蛇般在它的金屬背脊上瘋狂竄動！更致命的是，它失控發出的雜亂反相噪聲，順著海水介質狂暴擴散開來！\n\n周圍十幾頭高速巡弋的機械獵鯊，導航系統在一瞬間全部癱瘓！它們的尾鰭瘋狂抽搐，像無頭蒼蠅一樣在海浪中劇烈打轉，紛紛狠狠撞向了黑礁岩堅硬的玄武岩石壁上，撞得零件四濺、沉入海底！\n\n「打中了！全滅！！」將江在青木齒輪號上跳著腳振臂高呼！\n\n「丁丁！放錨砲！把那艘母艦趕跑！」巴克船長抓住戰機，再次開火。\n\n沉重的鐵錨劃破夜空，精準砸碎了遠處無人母艦的雷達天線。那艘黑潮母艦見獵鯊群全滅、指揮中斷，不敢戀戰，立刻釋放出一大片黑色的防禦煙幕，下潛逃入外海。\n\n---\n\n## 五、深海利維坦與爺爺的手寫信\n\n誠浩穩穩地落在黑礁岩的沙灘上，皮可「嘩啦」一聲重新收縮組裝成金屬柴犬形態，抖了抖身上的水珠，得意地朝著海盜船的方向叫了一聲：\n\n「汪！」\n\n遠處甲板上的丁丁看得兩眼冒星星，兩隻小手拍得通紅。\n\n巴克雙手叉腰，看著踩著浪花走上礁石的誠浩，臉上的傲慢終於徹底化作了打心底的佩服，他低聲咕噥了一句：「好吧……算這幫陸地小鬼厲害。」\n\n嵐與旖緁等人立刻駕船靠岸，衝進了幾乎沉沒的巡邏艇殘骸中。\n\n然而，當誠浩用螺絲筆撬開扭曲變形的船艙大門時，裡面的景象卻讓所有人的心猛地一沉。\n\n船艙內躺著的，並不是老守燈人莫里斯。\n\n而是一位身穿破舊防護服、渾身是傷的二十歲年輕學徒。他的胸口被鋼板砸傷，呼吸無比微弱，但雙手依然死死抱著一隻刻滿星象符號的黃銅機械手提箱。\n\n「莫里斯爺爺呢？！」嵐撲上前，眼眶泛紅地扶起他。\n\n年輕學徒艱難地咳嗽了一聲，鮮血順著嘴角溢出，他顫抖著指向外海深不見底的漆黑海溝：\n\n「莫里斯師父……在半小時前……被黑潮重工的深海旗艦『利維坦號』強行拖進了……萬米大裂谷……」\n\n「黑潮的董事長親自來了……他們要逼師父打開通往海底古代遺跡的最後大門……」\n\n學徒用盡最後的力氣，將手中的黃銅箱子推到了誠浩的懷中：\n\n「師父在被抓走前交代過……如果看見一個戴著黃銅幽靈護目鏡的少年……一定要把這個交給他……」\n\n話音落下，學徒因體力不支昏迷了過去。將江連忙上前，用乾淨的急救繃帶和隨身帶來的熱水為他處理傷口。\n\n在所有人凝重的注視下，誠浩緩緩打開了那隻沉重的黃銅箱子。\n\n「咔噠。」\n\n箱內沒有金銀財寶，而是靜靜陳列著一塊由黃金與隕石水晶雕刻而成的「十二面體古代星象儀核心」。\n\n而在星象儀的底座下方，壓著一張邊緣泛黃、被機油浸潤的手寫信紙。\n\n信紙上的字跡蒼勁有力，正是誠浩再熟悉不過的筆跡——\n\n> **【浩浩：】**  \n> **【當你打開這個箱子時，說明你已經跨過了千島海的第一道浪潮。】**  \n> **【不要為莫里斯擔心，也不要為我擔心。黑潮重工想要奪取的，不僅僅是海底的能量，而是這片海域埋藏了三百年的『星穹密鑰』。】**  \n> **【真正的考驗在深海大裂谷底部的『迷失燈塔』。拿好這塊星象儀，只有當它的十二面稜鏡在燈塔頂端與北極星重疊時，深海的封鎖才會被解除。】**  \n> **【我在燈塔的最深處，等待著與你們相見的那一天。】**  \n>  \n> —— **爺爺：誠遠山 留**\n\n「爺爺……」誠浩緊緊攥著信紙，眼眶微微濕潤，但心中的迷霧在一瞬間被徹底驅散。\n\n爺爺真的還活著！\n\n而且，就在那座傳說中的迷失燈塔深處！\n\n「轟隆隆隆隆————！！」\n\n突然間，遠方數公里外的深海海面上，海水毫無預兆地向上隆起了一座數十公尺高的恐怖水山！\n\n在無邊無際的黑夜中，一艘足足有兩百公尺長、宛如遠古鋼鐵巨鯨般的龐然大物，緩緩自海溝深處破水而出！\n\n艦橋頂部，亮起了一隻巨大、猩紅、冰冷無比的深海探照眼，將冰冷刺骨的光芒，筆直地照在了黑礁岩上的孩子們身上！\n\n那是黑潮重工的深海巨無霸旗艦——**「利維坦零號（Leviathan-0）」**！\n\n一場關乎這片海域命運的終極深海爭奪戰，已然吹響了號角！\n\n---\n\n*(第十三章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十三章：鐵錨幫的發條海盜船 (Chapter 13: The Clockwork Pirate Ship of the Iron Anchor Gang)\n\n## 一、海盜的榮譽與結盟的號角 (I. Pirate's Honor and the Horn of Alliance)\n\n*SCREEECH——BANG!*\n\nThe blinding crimson distress flare etched a thick trail of sulfurous smoke against the twilight sky beyond Windward Island.\n\nAlong the old docks, the island's tranquil waterborne village was thrown into immediate commotion. Adults ushered children inside stilt cabins, heavy wooden shutters carved with seabird totems slamming shut one after another.\n\n\"That is Old Lighthouse Keeper Morris's private distress beacon!\"\n\nLan stood upon the deck of The Aoki Gear, knuckles white around her folding alloy oar, veins bulging against her tanned skin as fury ignited within her spirited eyes:\n\n\"Three months ago, the eternal beam of the Lost Lighthouse died without warning, plunging the sea into fog. Grandpa Morris has been standing solitary vigil aboard his patrol skiff near the reefs to investigate... How dare those greedy Kuroshio Heavy Industries vultures strike right at our doorstep?!\"\n\n\"Kuroshio Heavy Industries?\" Ye Yijie adjusted her titanium glasses, quickly retrieving intelligence from her notebook: \"The maritime tech conglomerate headquartered on the Western Continent? Shen Qi-Ming, who was arrested in Volume 1, received offshore financing from Kuroshio!\"\n\n\"A nest of vipers coiled around the same stone!\" Cheng Hao pulled down his brass Ghost Goggles, his expression cold and focused. \"Morris was Grandpa's brother-in-arms thirty years ago. We are going to save him!\"\n\n\"Count me in! My pineapple buns demand peaceful waters!\" Jiang Jiang jammed his cast-iron skillet onto his tool belt, gripping the steam throttle valve beside the helm.\n\n*HOOOOONK————BLARE————!!*\n\nJust as The Aoki Gear prepared to cast off, a deafening, thunderous horn blasted through the harbor channel!\n\nSpewing plumes of dense black coal smoke, the iron dreadnought \"Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor\" carved through the water, cutting across The Aoki Gear's flank with aggressive swagger!\n\nCaptain Buck stood atop the bow anchor catapult in his black naval greatcoat, his gear eyepatch glinting with metallic coldness. Slamming his steam harpoon gun against the deck, he grinned with haughty, untamed bravado:\n\n\"Hey! Landlubbers! Did you think the Thousand-Island Gear Sea was your backyard bathtub?!\"\n\n\"Buck! Are you trying to rob us in the middle of a crisis?!\" Lan snapped.\n\n\"Rot!\" Buck spat into the foam, scowling: \"I am a pirate, but I was born and bred an honest clockwork pirate of the Thousand-Island Sea! Those corporate dogs from Kuroshio treat our home waters like their private oil basin, and now they want to drag off Old Morris?! Have they asked the iron anchor cannon on my bow?!\"\n\nStanding behind Buck, ten-year-old brute-strength powerhouse Ding-Ding brandished an oversized rusted hammer, cheering with delight:\n\n\"Allies! Let's smash Kuroshio's tin cans together! Once we win, I get to borrow the silver puppy for a whole night of cuddles!\"\n\nCheng Hao looked upon Buck's soot-streaked yet fiercely proud face. A smile touched his lips as he extended a closed fist toward the young pirate captain:\n\n\"The Aoki Gear takes high-speed tactical breakthrough; the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor provides heavy suppressive firepower. Care to wager who shatters the enemy flagship first?!\"\n\nBuck slammed his armored fist against Cheng Hao's, sparks dancing from the collision:\n\n\"You're on! Loser scrubs the fleet's boilers for a whole month! Iron Anchor Gang—HELM OVER! MAXIMUM REVS!!\"\n\n---\n\n## 二、鋼鐵死神：高壓機械獵鯊 (II. The Steel Reapers: High-Pressure Mechanical Hunting Sharks)\n\n*SPLAAASH——!*\n\nBoth warships sounded general quarters in unison, tearing across the emerald lagoon like two roaring dragons of black iron and polished bronze, charging at twenty knots toward the crimson flare three kilometers away!\n\nThe moment the vessels cleared the lagoon channel, the savage scene before them made every heart skip a beat.\n\nStranded on the jagged coral teeth of the isolated \"Black Crag Reef\" was a battered twenty-foot vintage patrol skiff, her hull pierced in dozens of places as seawater surged into her bilges.\n\nAnd churning within a six-hundred-foot radius around the skiff, the ocean boiled like a cauldron!\n\nA dozen streamlined behemoths thirteen feet long, sheathed in cold-rolled deep-sea alloy plating, patrolled the perimeter at terrifying speeds exceeding forty knots!\n\nCarbon-fiber dorsal fins sharp as razor blades broke the surface, their snouts armed with dual rows of tungsten-steel saw teeth driven by high-pressure hydraulic rams that pulsed with malevolent crimson luminescence. Every lash of their tails carved cavitation wakes through the dark swells!\n\nMore formidable still: stationed several hundred yards behind the pack lay a sleek, windowless black autonomous surface mothership over a hundred and fifty feet long. Its revolving crimson radar dome broadcasted high-frequency command pulses, coordinating the hunting sharks for the final slaughter!\n\n\"Kuroshio Heavy Industries' **'Deep-Sea Purger Mk-III' Mechanical Hunting Sharks**!\" Yijie held her hydrophone, face pale. \"Their jaw clamping force exceeds five tons—they can bite clean through steel plate! The skiff's hull will collapse in less than three minutes!\"\n\n*BOOM!*\n\nA mechanical shark leaped from the swell, its saw-toothed jaws clamping shut to shear off a massive section of the patrol skiff's rudder! Splintered timber and fiery electrical sparks exploded into the twilight air!\n\n\"FIRE CANNON!! BLOW THOSE TIN SQUIDS TO SCRAP!!\"\n\nCaptain Buck roared, manually tripping the anchor cannon's firing actuator!\n\n*THUUUUMP————!!*\n\nWith a concussive roar of thunder, a four-hundred-pound barbed solid clockwork anchor shot through billows of black smoke, slamming squarely onto the dorsal armor of a mechanical shark!\n\n*CLANG!*\n\nYet what followed stunned everyone aboard—\n\nThe devastating kinetic strike, capable of caving in a cargo hold, merely scraped blinding sparks across the shark's ultra-hard tungsten-carbide shell, ricocheting harmlessly away! The shark did not even flinch, its cold electronic sensor eye pivoting to lock onto the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor!\n\n\"Useless!\" Lan shouted from the skimmer on the flank. \"Their hulls are deep-sea pressure-tempered! Solid shot won't penetrate! Their sole vulnerability is the acoustic sonar guidance array in their skulls!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、聲波共振與水翼衝浪極限衝鋒 (III. Acoustic Resonance and the Hydrofoil Surf Charge)\n\n\"If kinetic strikes fail, we shatter them with acoustic resonance!\"\n\nYijie slipped off her headset, slapping a high-frequency acoustic spectrogram onto the chart table:\n\n```\n[KUROSHIO MECHANICAL HUNTING SHARK PACK TELEMETRY]:\nSonar Guidance Center Frequency: f = 40 kHz (40,000 Hz) Ultrasonic\nSpeed of Sound in Seawater: v ≈ 1500 m/s\nSwarm Sync Pulse: Continuous sweeping at 120 pulses/second\n\nAcoustic Decryption Core:\nWave Equation Wavelength: λ = v / f\nλ = 1500 / 40000 = 0.0375 m = 3.75 cm!\n\nVulnerability Assessment:\nEach shark's cranial vertex features an acoustic cavity\nmeasuring exactly 3.75 cm in length!\nInjecting an anti-phase (180° offset) acoustic wave at identical frequency\nwill trigger immediate catastrophic overload\nin their internal piezoelectric ceramic transducers!\n```\n\n\"**WAVELENGTH 3.75 CM! DESTRUCTIVE INTERFERENCE!**\"\n\nIntellectual brilliance blazed in Yijie's eyes: \"Cheng Hao! The sharks communicate at 40 kHz! If we drive a reverse acoustic probe into the cranial resonance chamber of the pack alpha, it will trigger a domino chain-reaction short across the entire pack's sonar lattice!\"\n\n\"Who can get close enough to a pack of steel monsters moving at forty knots?!\" Buck roared over the wind.\n\n\"I can!\"\n\nCheng Hao raised his head, patting the poised silver hound beside him: \"PICO! Transform——**Hydrofoil Surf Mode**!\"\n\n*CLACK-CLACK-SHING——!*\n\nWith a dazzling ripple of memory alloy, PICO's chassis unfolded into a three-foot-wide dual-tier hydrofoil surfboard etched with flow-channel grooves! Its tail water-jet turbine emitted a pure, high-frequency whine as twin superconducting skimming runners locked into place!\n\nCheng Hao drew his multi-tool screwdriver pen, extending its conductive probe into a twelve-inch acoustic transmitting antenna, dialing the frequency selector firmly to the **40 kHz** anti-phase detent!\n\n\"Jiang Jiang! Maximum launch boost!\" Cheng Hao planted one foot on the board, poised heroically at the bulwark.\n\n\"You got it! Behold my ultimate culinary propulsion—Special Reserve High-Pressure Steam Catapult!\"\n\nJiang Jiang bellowed, slamming his cast-iron skillet down upon The Aoki Gear's emergency steam dump valve!\n\n*BOOOOOM————!!*\n\nA roaring jet of superheated steam erupted from the stern. Cheng Hao, riding the hydrofoil board, shot across the dark swells like a silver javelin, knifing through the night spray at terrifying speed!\n\n---\n\n## 四、波峰上的致命一刺 (IV. The Lethal Strike on the Crest)\n\n\"Insane! The kid is surfing over a pack of sharks!\" Captain Buck's binoculars nearly slipped from his fingers.\n\nOut on the open water, the sun had plunged beneath the horizon, leaving midnight-black swells rolling beneath the stars.\n\nCrouched low, Cheng Hao maintained his center of gravity against the hurricane-force slipstream. PICO's vacuum suction pads locked firmly to Cheng Hao's soles, its water-jet turbine spewing a ten-foot white rooster tail!\n\nForty-five knots!\n\nThrough the high-sensitivity infrared mode of the Ghost Goggles, ambient ocean clutter dissolved, revealing a sixteen-foot Alpha Shark gleaming with golden alloy plating rising from the depths flanked by three wing-sharks, its gaping maw surging straight toward Cheng Hao's landing vector!\n\nFifteen feet! Ten feet! Three feet!\n\n\"Lan! NOW!\" Cheng Hao roared into the gale.\n\n\"Leave it to me!\"\n\nFlanking the swell, Lan's steam skimmer \"Seagull\" executed an impossible high-speed power slide into the crest! Heaving the helm, Lan pitched the skimmer's port hull high into the air, creating a natural thirty-degree inclined launch ramp across the water!\n\n\"HIT THE RAMP!!\"\n\nCheng Hao locked eyes on the ramp, steering PICO's runners straight up the upturned hull of the Seagull!\n\n*WHOOOOSH————!*\n\nThe hydrofoil board rode the kinetic launch into the sky, carving a radiant twenty-foot silver arc against the stars!\n\nThe exact millisecond the Alpha Shark breached with snapping steel jaws, Cheng Hao executed an acrobatic lateral twist in midair. Gripping his acoustic tool pen blazing with blue high-frequency arcing light, he drove the antenna probe straight into the 3.75-centimeter cooling slit on the shark's skull!\n\n*ZZZZZZZZ————BOOOOOM!!*\n\n**A 40 kHz anti-phase destructive resonance pulse flooded the cranial cavity!**\n\nThe devastating physics of wave interference detonated within the enclosed chamber!\n\nThe ultrasonic pulse created a phase-cancellation feedback loop, the localized acoustic pressure pulverizing the piezoelectric ceramic sensor into microscopic dust in less than a millisecond!\n\n*ZZZZ-POP-CRACKLE!*\n\nThe Alpha Shark's crimson sensor eyes died instantly, blinding electrical arcs thrashing along its armored spine like furious lightning serpents! Deadlier still, its scrambled anti-phase interference screamed outward through the seawater medium!\n\nEvery mechanical shark in the hunting pack suffered instant, catastrophic navigation failure! Their tail fins seized in violent spasms, tumbling blind through the swells to smash headlong into the basalt cliffs of the Black Crag Reef, shattering into scrap iron that sank into the deep!\n\n\"DIRECT HIT! ENEMY SWARM ANNIHILATED!!\" Jiang Jiang cheered from the deck of The Aoki Gear, pumping his fists!\n\n\"Ding-Ding! Anchor cannon! Drive off the mothership!\" Buck seized the tactical initiative, firing another heavy anchor.\n\nThe barbed iron anchor whistled through the night, smashing the unmanned mothership's radar mast to pieces. With its swarm destroyed and telemetry severed, the Kuroshio mothership deployed a cloud of black defensive smoke, submerging in hasty retreat into the outer ocean.\n\n---\n\n## 五、深海利維坦與爺爺的手寫信 (V. The Deep-Sea Leviathan and Grandpa's Letter)\n\nCheng Hao landed cleanly upon the pebble beach of the Black Crag Reef. PICO reassembled into its Shiba Inu form with fluid clicks, shaking spray from its coat and giving a proud bark toward the pirate ship:\n\n*BARK!*\n\nAcross the water, Ding-Ding's eyes sparkled with awe, clapping her little hands until they were pink.\n\nBuck stood with hands on his hips, watching Cheng Hao walk through the surf. The swagger in his posture finally softened into genuine, deep-seated respect, muttering under his breath: \"Fine... Those landlubbers have real iron in their blood.\"\n\nLan, Yijie, and the others brought their ships alongside, rushing into the wreckage of the flooded patrol skiff.\n\nYet when Cheng Hao pried open the twisted cabin door with his screwdriver pen, the scene within made everyone's hearts sink.\n\nLying in the cabin was not Old Morris.\n\nIt was a twenty-year-old apprentice in a battered protective suit, covered in bruises and cuts. His chest was injured by fallen bulkheads, his breathing shallow, yet his arms were locked tightly around a heavy brass mechanical case etched with astrological constellations.\n\n\"Where is Grandpa Morris?!\" Lan rushed to his side, lifting his head with tears in her eyes.\n\nThe young apprentice coughed weakly, blood trickling from the corner of his mouth as his trembling finger pointed toward the bottomless black trench offshore:\n\n\"Master Morris... half an hour ago... was forcibly dragged into the ten-thousand-meter rift... by Kuroshio's deep-sea flagship, the Leviathan...\"\n\n\"The Chairman of Kuroshio came in person... They are forcing Master to unlock the final portal to the ancient seabed ruins...\"\n\nSummoning the last of his strength, the apprentice shoved the brass case into Cheng Hao's arms:\n\n\"Before he was taken... Master ordered me... if I encountered a boy wearing brass Ghost Goggles... I had to give this to him...\"\n\nHis strength spent, the apprentice lapsed into unconsciousness. Jiang Jiang rushed forward with clean bandages and warm water from his hamper to tend his wounds.\n\nUnder everyone's solemn gaze, Cheng Hao unlocked the heavy brass case.\n\n*Click.*\n\nWithin lay no gold or jewels, but a gleaming dodecahedral \"Ancient Astrolabe Core\" carved from gold and meteoric crystal.\n\nAnd beneath the astrolabe's pedestal lay a yellowed sheet of machine-oil-stained parchment.\n\nThe handwriting upon it was bold, steady, and unmistakably familiar—\n\n> **[Hao-Hao:]**  \n> **[If you have opened this case, you have successfully crossed the first tide of the Gear Sea.]**  \n> **[Do not fear for Morris, and do not fear for me. Kuroshio Heavy Industries seeks not merely the energy beneath the sea, but the 'Celestial Key' buried here for three hundred years.]**  \n> **[The true trial lies at the 'Lost Lighthouse' on the floor of the Abyssal Rift. Guard this astrolabe well; only when its twelve prism facets align with Polaris atop the lighthouse will the abyssal seal dissolve.]**  \n> **[I am waiting for you at the deepest heart of the lighthouse.]**  \n>  \n> —— **Your Grandfather: Cheng Yuan-Shan**\n\n\"Grandpa...\" Cheng Hao clutched the parchment, his eyes misting over as the lingering haze in his soul dissolved into absolute clarity.\n\nGrandpa was alive!\n\nAnd he was waiting down in the depths of the legendary Lost Lighthouse!\n\n*RUUUUUUMBLE————!!*\n\nSuddenly, miles offshore in the midnight deep, the ocean surface bulged upward into a terrifying water mountain dozens of yards high!\n\nBreaking through the dark waves from the bottomless trench was a colossal leviathan over six hundred feet long, resembling an ancient primeval steel whale!\n\nAtop the conning tower, a colossal, blood-red deep-sea cyclops searchlight snapped on, casting an icy, piercing crimson glare across the black waters squarely onto the children upon the reef!\n\nIt was Kuroshio Heavy Industries' deep-sea juggernaut flagship—**\"Leviathan-0\"**!\n\nThe clarion call for the ultimate battle that would decide the fate of the Gear Sea had sounded!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 13, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":14,"rawContent":"# 第十四章：海事旗語與浮標信號迷陣\n\n## 一、巨獸的陰影與避難迷道\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n黑夜中的海面，被黑潮重工旗艦「利維坦零號」艦首噴射出的兩道數十公尺高的超高壓水砲，硬生生轟成了漫天狂暴的白霧！\n\n這艘長達兩百公尺的深海核蒸汽巨無霸，通體覆蓋著厚達一公尺的消音橡膠與特種防爆鎢鋼複合裝甲。艦橋頂端那隻巨大的猩紅探照眼，如同一柄懸在海面上的血色光劍，將黑礁岩上的所有人牢牢鎖死在冰冷的光斑之中！\n\n「深海聲納鎖定！高壓脈衝魚雷管注水中！」\n\n利維坦零號擴音喇叭中傳來冰冷機械的電子廣播音，那聲音穿透海浪，震得所有人耳膜發痛：\n\n> `[警告：未註冊武裝船隻及非法非法觀察者！]`  \n> `[立即放下武器，交出十二面體古代星象儀與全部機械樣本！]`  \n> `[否則將於三十秒後執行全區域毀滅性飽和打擊！倒數計時：29、28……]`\n\n「這群穿西裝的混蛋，開著這麼大的鐵疙瘩來欺負小孩子，要不要臉啊！」\n\n巴克船長咬牙切齒地吐掉嘴裡的火柴棍，狠狠抹了一把臉上的海水，雙眼噴火。但他心裡很清楚，自己的「破浪鐵錨號」雖然堅固，但在兩百公尺長、裝備著反艦重型魚雷的現代工業怪物面前，硬拼無異於以卵擊石！\n\n「不能跟它在開闊海面上打！」\n\n嵐一把拉過身旁的誠浩與巴克，手指急促地指向後方那片被濃稠乳白色霧氣籠罩的奇異海域：\n\n「往西北方向逃！那裡是千島齒輪海的天然禁區——**『雙霧海峽 · 浮標信號迷陣』**！」\n\n「迷陣？！」葉旖緁急忙將手電筒的光芒打在濕漉漉的海圖上。\n\n「沒錯！」嵐飛快地說道，「那片海峽的水下布滿了密集如林的古代金屬鐘乳石柱與發條防禦尖刺。利維坦零號長達兩百公尺的笨重船體只要敢硬闖進去，一分鐘之內就會被水下石柱開膛破肚！」\n\n「但那片迷陣每隔數百公尺就有一道水下鋼鎖攔江閘！」巴克臉色凝重地補充道，「只有按照正確的順序解讀浮標上的海事信號，才能打開水閘！要是解錯一個，整艘船就會被水下彈射的尖刺網死死勾住！」\n\n「解密的事情交給我和旖緁！」誠浩將裝著星象儀的黃銅箱緊緊綁在胸前，翻身跳上青木齒輪號的甲板，「巴克，你的鐵錨號負責在後方干擾敵人的無人機！嵐，妳的海鷗號在前方帶路探查浮標！」\n\n「好！動手！」\n\n兩艘戰艦同時引擎全開，兩股白色的浪花在利維坦零號射出的第一枚試探性燃燒彈在身後炸裂的同一秒，風馳電掣般衝進了雙霧海峽厚重無比的白色濃霧之中！\n\n---\n\n## 二、迷霧中的五色航標\n\n「呼————」\n\n衝入雙霧海峽的瞬間，外海狂暴的巨浪奇蹟般地平息了下來。\n\n取而代之的，是一種令人窒息的死寂。空氣中瀰漫著濃烈的硫磺味與古老青銅的鏽蝕氣息。海面平靜得像一面黑色的鏡子，只有兩側巍峨聳立的黑色玄武岩懸崖，在濃霧中若隱若現，宛如兩排高聳入雲的巨人骨架。\n\n「前方能見度不足二十公尺！」\n\n將江把脖子上的巨型望遠鏡調到最大焦距，兩條腿踩在搖搖晃晃的桅杆橫梁上，扯著嗓子大喊：\n\n「報告艦長！正前方出現了一座巨大的黑鐵浮標塔！塔頂掛著五面旗子！正在發光！」\n\n誠浩、旖緁和嵐立刻衝上船頭。\n\n只見在第一道狹窄的海峽咽喉處，矗立著一座高達十五公尺的古老浮標塔。塔身上咬合著沉重的水壓齒輪，兩側伸出兩根長達百公尺的粗大鑄鐵鎖鏈，將整條水道徹底封死！\n\n而在浮標塔頂端的五根旗桿上，赫然懸掛著五面顏色與幾何圖案截然不同的方形與三角形海事信號旗！\n\n「是**國際海事信號旗語（International Code of Signals, ICS）**！」\n\n葉旖緁雙手飛快地翻開黑皮筆記本，指尖在各國航海通用的國際信號旗對照表上極速滑動：\n\n```\n【第一道古代防禦水閘解密矩陣】：\n浮標塔基座銘文：\n「唯有真正的引航者，方能通往深淵之門。」\n「依序列辨識五面海事信號旗，拼讀出古代通關咒語（Passcode），輸入主水閘音頻頻率！」\n\n五面旗幟特徵記錄：\n第 1 面：深藍色底，中央鑲嵌一塊純白色正方形！\n第 2 面：鮮黃色底，中央有一個實心純黑色圓點！\n第 3 面：黃黑相間的四分割棋盤方格旗（左上黑、右上黃、左下黃、右下黑）！\n第 4 面：正方形旗幟，自左上至右下被黃色與紅色對角線均勻切分！\n第 5 面：由紅、白、藍三色均勻分布的垂直條紋旗！\n```\n\n「旖緁！敵人的先遣追擊無人機追上來了！還有最後三十秒！」嵐看著後方迷霧中閃爍的十幾個紅色激光點，焦急地喊道。\n\n「別慌！我在破譯！」\n\n旖緁深吸了一口氣，冷靜得如同一部高速運轉的量子計算機。她的目光在一面面旗幟與筆記本上的圖例之間飛速比對：\n\n「第 1 面旗：深藍底白方塊 ➡️ 國際海事旗語字母代碼 **『P』（Papa 旗）**！在航海中代表『全員登船，船舶即將啟航出海』！」\n\n「第 2 面旗：黃底黑圓點 ➡️ 國際代碼 **『I』（India 旗）**！代表『正在向左轉舵轉向』！」\n\n「第 3 面旗：黃黑四分割棋盤方格 ➡️ 國際代碼 **『L』（Lima 旗）**！代表『請立即停船通訊』！」\n\n「第 4 面旗：黃紅對角斜切 ➡️ 國際代碼 **『O』（Oscar 旗）**！代表『有人落水，注意避讓』！」\n\n「第 5 面旗：紅白藍三色垂直條紋 ➡️ 國際代碼 **『T』（Tango 旗）**！代表『大型捕撈作業，請遠離我船』！」\n\n「把五個字母拼在一起！」誠浩脫口而出。\n\n「**P - I - L - O - T**！」旖緁大聲喊出破譯的單詞，「**PILOT——引航員！**」\n\n「基座上有五個音叉按鈕！」嵐縱身一躍，海鷗號貼著浮標塔飛馳而過，她揮動合金折疊船槳，按照 P（16）、I（9）、L（12）、O（15）、T（20）的英文字母順序，精準無比地接連敲擊在五根長短不一的共振青銅音叉上！\n\n「鐺——嚀——鈴——啷——咚！」\n\n五記清脆純淨的音符在迷霧中形成了一組完美的諧波共鳴！\n\n「轟隆隆隆——！」\n\n只見那座橫亙在海面上的巨大鐵鑄攔江水閘，底部的古代水壓浮筒猛然排氣，沉重的水下鎖鏈伴隨著一陣劇烈的轟鳴，緩緩沉入十幾公尺深的海底淤泥之中！\n\n航道大開！\n\n---\n\n## 三、巴克的絕殺：發條鏈彈阻擊\n\n「全速衝過去！！」\n\n青木齒輪號與破浪鐵錨號幾乎是擦著剛剛落下的水閘頂端，以毫釐之差疾馳穿過！\n\n然而，還沒等大家喘口氣，身後不到兩百公尺的濃霧中，六架閃爍著森冷金屬光澤的「黑潮飛鏢追擊無人艇」，正以五十浬的瘋狂速度破浪追殺而來！\n\n無人艇的兩側，各自架設著一具六聯裝高壓水下穿甲微型魚雷發射器，猩紅的激光準星已經死死鎖定了青木齒輪號的舵輪！\n\n「誠浩！往前開，別回頭！」\n\n身後的鐵錨號上，巴克船長猛地脫下了自己的海軍大衣，露出一身精壯黝黑的臂膀。他一把拉開艦首重砲的彈藥艙，裡面整齊碼放著一種極其罕見的奇特砲彈——兩枚由粗重鋼鐵鏈條緊緊鎖在一起的實心鐵球！\n\n「這是我老爸留給我的秘密武器——**『海盜雙聯重型鏈彈（Chain-shot）』**！」\n\n巴克咬緊牙關，雙手死死搖動瞄準手輪，將砲口高高揚起：\n\n「丁丁！給我灌滿三倍發條壓力！這群穿西裝的科技狗，讓他們見識一下老派海盜的浪漫！」\n\n「發條過載 300%！壓力就緒！」丁丁掄起大鐵鎚，一錘狠狠砸在擊發底火上！\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n一記撕裂蒼穹的狂暴巨響在海峽內迴盪開來！\n\n兩枚被三公尺長合金鎖鏈死死相連的沉重鐵球，在半空中高速旋轉，化作一道呼嘯旋轉的**「鋼鐵死亡鐮刀」**，帶著毀滅一切的旋轉動能橫掃而過！\n\n「喀嚓！轟隆隆！」\n\n旋轉的鏈彈在半空中精準絞碎了最前方的兩架無人艇的複合碳纖維桅杆與發射架！被鉸斷的鋼纜與失去平衡的螺旋槳在海面上引發了一連串驚天動地的劇烈連環爆炸！\n\n漫天沖天的火光，將身後整條狹窄的水道化作了一片翻滾燃燒的火海，將剩餘的追擊部隊徹底阻隔在厚重的鐵閘門之外！\n\n「打得好！巴克！」將江在桅杆上興奮得直揮舞平底鍋。\n\n巴克傲嬌地哼了一聲，用大拇指擦了擦鼻子上的黑灰：「哼，說過這片海域是老子的地盤了！」\n\n---\n\n## 四、深海大裂谷與囚籠中的老莫里斯\n\n穿過第一道浮標迷陣後，兩艘船順著湍急的地下暗河，一路向下俯衝。\n\n四周的海水溫度驟降，光線完全消失。\n\n當青木齒輪號衝出狹長陡峭的地下水洞時，眼前的景象，讓在場的所有少年屏住了呼吸——\n\n展現在他們面前的，是一片廣袤無垠、幽暗而壯麗的萬米深海海底大盆地。\n\n頭頂上方數千公尺處，是翻滾不休的黑色洋流；而腳下的海底平原上，生長著成片成片散發著幽藍與淡紫光芒的**古代發光珊瑚群**與**地熱煙囪林**，將整個深海照耀得如同璀璨的阿凡達奇幻森林。\n\n而在這片幽藍盆地的最中央，一道深不見底、寬達數公里的**深海大裂谷**邊緣，靜靜矗立著一座震撼人心的龐然大物——\n\n那是一座高達八十公尺、完全由青銅齒輪、水銀浮桶與水晶稜鏡堆疊而成的奇蹟建築——**「迷失燈塔（The Lost Beacon）」**！\n\n然而，此刻這座神聖古老的燈塔，頂部的菲涅耳巨型透鏡卻陷入了一片死寂的漆黑。\n\n無數粗如百年巨蟒的黑色液壓電纜，如同一條條吸血的藤蔓，將燈塔的底座死死纏繞鎖定。\n\n而在燈塔正前方幾百公尺外，一具體長足足有六十公尺、由數百組巨型液壓活塞與核動力蒸汽渦輪驅動的**「深海百眼巨械（Leviathan Extractor）」**，正揮舞著八條巨大的鋼鐵挖掘巨爪，瘋狂鑿擊著燈塔底部的古代石門！\n\n在巨械那龐大無比的核心維修平台上，懸掛著一隻由高強度鈦合金打造的深海透明囚籠。\n\n囚籠之中，正被鐵鏈死死鎖著一位白鬍子垂到胸口、穿著油布水手雨衣的老人！\n\n「莫里斯爺爺！！」嵐看著囚籠中的身影，忍不住失聲尖叫！\n\n老燈匠莫里斯雖然渾身血跡斑斑，但那雙飽經風霜的藍色眼睛裡，依然閃爍著不屈的光芒。他似乎聽到了海面傳來的動靜，吃力地抬起頭，望向了正急速逼近的青木齒輪號。\n\n就在這時，巨械頂部的擴音器中，響起了一聲優雅、冰冷而令人毛骨悚然的成年男子輕笑聲：\n\n「呵呵呵……真沒想到，幾個毛都沒長齊的小學生，居然真的能解開浮標旗語，把我可愛的獵鯊和無人機全給拆了。」\n\n伴隨著這個聲音，深海巨械的駕駛艙艙門緩緩升起。\n\n一個身穿昂貴的黑色防壓高級西裝、胸前佩戴著一枚純金齒輪懷錶的優雅中年男子，手裡端著一杯冒著熱氣的紅茶，居高臨下地俯視著下方的誠浩：\n\n「自我介紹一下。我是黑潮重工執行董事長——**沈天成**。」\n\n「沈啟明那個廢物是我的弟弟。不過沒關係，多虧你們把他送進了監獄，我才能毫無阻礙地獨吞千島海的終極遺產。」\n\n沈天成抿了一口紅茶，目光落在了誠浩胸前的十二面體星象儀上，眼底爆發出貪婪的熾熱光芒：\n\n「誠遠山老爺子的親孫子，對吧？你手裡的十二面體星象儀，是打開燈塔核心永恆動力的最後一把鑰匙。」\n\n「乖乖把它交給我。否則……我只需輕輕按一下按鈕，莫里斯這條老命，就會被我的挖掘爪碾成深海肉泥！」\n\n---\n\n*(第十四章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十四章：海事旗語與浮標信號迷陣 (Chapter 14: Maritime Flag Semaphore and the Beacon Labyrinth)\n\n## 一、巨獸的陰影與避難迷道 (I. Shadow of the Behemoth and the Refuge Channel)\n\n*BOOOOOM————!!*\n\nThe pitch-black sea exploded into torrential white fog as twin ultra-high-pressure water cannons roared from the prow of Kuroshio Heavy Industries' flagship, \"Leviathan-0\"!\n\nThe six-hundred-foot deep-sea nuclear-steam juggernaut was armored in three-foot-thick sound-dampening acoustic rubber and special tungsten-carbide blast plating. Atop her conning tower, a colossal cyclopean red searchlight flared like a bloody broadsword, pinning everyone upon the Black Crag Reef within its icy beam!\n\n\"Deep-sea sonar locked! Flooding high-pressure pulse torpedo tubes!\"\n\nChilling, synthesized machine commands crackled through Leviathan-0's acoustic loudspeakers, rattling through the swells to pound against the children's eardrums:\n\n> `[WARNING: UNREGISTERED ARMED VESSELS AND ILLEGAL RECONNAISSANCE ENTITIES!]`  \n> `[SURRENDER ALL WEAPONS, THE DODECAHEDRAL ASTROLABE, AND ALL MECHANICAL SPECIMENS!]`  \n> `[FAILURE TO COMPLY WILL ENGAGE AREA-WIDE SATURATION ANNIHILATION STRIKE IN 30 SECONDS! COUNTDOWN: 29, 28...]`\n\n\"Those corporate cowards—deploying a city-sized steel mountain to bully children! Have they no shame?!\"\n\nCaptain Buck spat his matchstick into the surf, wiping sea spray with his sleeve, his eyes ablaze with fury. Yet he knew all too well that though his Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor was rugged, standing toe-to-toe against a modern six-hundred-foot industrial colossus armed with heavy anti-ship torpedoes was sheer suicide!\n\n\"We can't fight it in open water!\"\n\nLan seized Cheng Hao and Buck by their coats, her hand pointing urgently toward the dense, milky fog bank churning behind them:\n\n\"Head northwest! Into the natural exclusion zone of the Gear Sea—**The Twin-Mist Strait & Beacon Signal Labyrinth**!\"\n\n\"A labyrinth?!\" Ye Yijie quickly trained her flashlight onto her soaked sea charts.\n\n\"Exactly!\" Lan shouted over the wind. \"The sea floor there bristles with a dense forest of ancient metal stalactites and clockwork defense spikes! If Leviathan-0's clumsy six-hundred-foot hull dares force its way in, subterranean stone pillars will eviscerate her bilges within sixty seconds!\"\n\n\"But that maze is barricaded by submerged hydraulic chain-gates every few hundred yards!\" Buck added grimly. \"The locks open ONLY by deciphering maritime flag signals on the buoys in exact sequence! One wrong input, and barbed underwater capture nets will snag our hulls solid!\"\n\n\"Leave the deciphering to Yijie and me!\" Cheng Hao lashed the brass astrolabe case tightly across his chest, vaulting onto The Aoki Gear's deck. \"Buck, your Iron Anchor holds the rear to suppress enemy drones! Lan, your Seagull leads the vanguard to recon the buoys!\"\n\n\"Let's move!\"\n\nBoth warships engaged maximum throttle. Just as Leviathan-0's first ranging incendiary shell detonated behind them, the two vessels tore like lightning into the dense, white milk-soup of the Twin-Mist Strait!\n\n---\n\n## 二、迷霧中的五色航標 (II. The Five-Color Beacons in the Mist)\n\n*WHOOOOSH————*\n\nThe moment they plunged into the Twin-Mist Strait, the furious open-ocean swells died down miraculously.\n\nIn their place descended an eerie, suffocating hush. The air hung heavy with the reek of volcanic sulfur and ancient bronze corrosion. The sea was as flat as black glass, framed by towering basalt cliffs looming like the ribcages of primeval titans in the fog.\n\n\"Forward visibility is under sixty feet!\"\n\nJiang Jiang dialed his heavy binoculars to maximum magnification, balancing precariously upon the mast yardarm, yelling down at the top of his lungs:\n\n\"Report from the crow's nest! Massive black iron buoy tower dead ahead! Five signal flags hoisted atop the spire! They're illuminated!\"\n\nCheng Hao, Yijie, and Lan rushed to the bow.\n\nStraddling the throat of the narrow channel stood a fifty-foot antique cast-iron beacon tower. Meshed with heavy hydraulic gears, two colossal cast-iron anchor chains stretched hundreds of feet to either shore, completely blockading the passage!\n\nAnd fluttering from five halyards atop the tower were five distinct square and triangular maritime signal flags, glowing under electric lamps!\n\n\"The **International Code of Signals (ICS)**!\"\n\nYijie's fingers flew across her black notebook, cross-referencing standard international naval flag charts at blinding speed:\n\n```\n[FIRST ANCIENT HYDRAULIC LOCK DECRYPTION MATRIX]:\nBuoy Base Inscription:\n\"None but true pilots shall pass the threshold of the deep.\"\n\"Identify the five maritime flags in sequence, spell out the ancient Passcode,\nand input the acoustic resonance frequency to drop the lock!\"\n\nFlag Characteristics Logged:\nFlag 1: Deep blue field with a solid white square in the center!\nFlag 2: Bright yellow field with a solid black circle in the center!\nFlag 3: Yellow-and-black checkered flag in four quadrants (Black upper-left,\n        Yellow upper-right, Yellow lower-left, Black lower-right)!\nFlag 4: Square flag divided diagonally from upper-left to lower-right\n        into equal Yellow and Red triangles!\nFlag 5: Vertical tricolor of equal Red, White, and Blue stripes!\n```\n\n\"Yijie! Enemy vanguard pursuit drones are breaking through the soup! Thirty seconds remaining!\" Lan warned, watching a dozen crimson laser designators dancing through the mist astern.\n\n\"Don't panic! I am decoding!\"\n\nYijie took a steadying breath, her mind calculating like a quantum processor as her eyes darted between the flags and her charts:\n\n\"Flag 1: Blue field with white central square ➡️ International Naval Code **'P' (Papa Flag)**! Meaning: 'All persons report on board; vessel is about to proceed to sea'!\"\n\n\"Flag 2: Yellow field with black circle ➡️ International Code **'I' (India Flag)**! Meaning: 'I am altering my course to port'!\"\n\n\"Flag 3: Yellow-and-black checkered quadrants ➡️ International Code **'L' (Lima Flag)**! Meaning: 'You should stop your vessel immediately'!\"\n\n\"Flag 4: Diagonal yellow and red split ➡️ International Code **'O' (Oscar Flag)**! Meaning: 'Man overboard; take evasive action'!\"\n\n\"Flag 5: Red, white, blue vertical tricolor ➡️ International Code **'T' (Tango Flag)**! Meaning: 'Engaged in pair trawling; keep clear of me'!\"\n\n\"String the five letters together!\" Cheng Hao shouted.\n\n\"**P - I - L - O - T**!\" Yijie shouted at the top of her lungs. \"**PILOT——The Helmsman!**\"\n\n\"Five tuning-fork levers on the pedestal!\" Lan vaulted onto her skimmer. Skimming past the buoy base, she swung her alloy oar, striking the five bronze tuning forks in the alphabetical sequence of P (16), I (9), L (12), O (15), and T (20)!\n\n*CLANG——PING——CHIME——RING——DONG!*\n\nFive crystalline notes formed a flawless harmonic chord in the mist!\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE——!*\n\nThe massive iron lock gate's pneumatic floats purged air with a deafening hiss. Driven by counterweights, the colossal iron chains sank into the deep silt of the channel bed!\n\nThe waterway was clear!\n\n---\n\n## 三、巴克的絕殺：發條鏈彈阻擊 (III. Buck's Masterstroke: The Clockwork Chain-Shot Intercept)\n\n\"FULL THROTTLE! PUNCH THROUGH!!\"\n\nThe Aoki Gear and the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor skimmed over the sinking chain gate with inches to spare!\n\nYet before anyone could catch their breath, six streamlined \"Kuroshio Dart-Drone Pursuit Craft\" broke through the fog less than two hundred yards behind them, skimming the surface at fifty knots!\n\nFlanking each drone were six-tube high-pressure underwater armor-piercing torpedo launchers, their crimson targeting lasers locked onto The Aoki Gear's rudder!\n\n\"Cheng Hao! Steer straight, don't look back!\"\n\nAboard the trailing Iron Anchor, Captain Buck ripped off his naval greatcoat, revealing wiry, sun-darkened muscular arms. Hauling open the ammunition locker of his bow cannon, he revealed a rare, devastating antique ordnance—two solid cast-iron cannonballs bound together by three feet of forged steel chain!\n\n\"My old man's legacy—**Heavy Clockwork Chain-Shot**!\"\n\nGritting his teeth, Buck spun the elevation handwheels, raising the cannon barrel high:\n\n\"Ding-Ding! Wind the mainspring to 300% overload! Let these corporate tech-hounds taste the romance of old-school piracy!\"\n\n\"Clockwork overload 300%! Pressure primed!\" Ding-Ding swung her heavy sledgehammer, smashing the percussion cap with a thunderous blow!\n\n*BOOOOOM————!!*\n\nA deafening roar split the heavens within the narrow canyon walls!\n\nBound by the high-tensile chain, the twin iron balls spun at supersonic velocity through the air, transforming into a screaming **Flying Scythe of Steel Death**, sweeping across the water with cataclysmic rotational kinetic energy!\n\n*CRASH! KABOOOOM!!*\n\nThe whirling chain-shot sheared through the carbon-fiber masts and launcher rails of the two lead drones with surgical fury! Severed fuel lines and fractured props ignited in a blinding series of secondary explosions across the strait!\n\nA towering wall of roaring flames engulfed the narrow gorge, sealing the remaining pursuit craft behind a curtain of fire and the sunken iron barrier!\n\n\"BEAUTIFULLY SHOT, BUCK!\" Jiang Jiang waved his skillet from the crow's nest in wild celebration.\n\nBuck gave a haughty sniff, wiping soot from his nose with a thumb: \"Hmph. Told you this sea was my turf!\"\n\n---\n\n## 四、深海大裂谷與囚籠中的老莫里斯 (IV. The Abyssal Rift and Old Morris in the Cage)\n\nClearing the first signal labyrinth, the two vessels rode the roaring subterranean current, plummeting down a steep hydraulic flume.\n\nWater temperatures plummeted; natural sunlight vanished entirely.\n\nWhen The Aoki Gear burst out from the narrow limestone tunnel, what unfurled before them stole the breath from every child aboard—\n\nA vast, abyssal subterranean basin spanning miles across lay before their eyes in majestic twilight splendor.\n\nThousands of feet overhead rolled the black subterranean thermocline. Across the ocean floor, vast fields of bioluminescent azure and violet corals swayed beside towering geothermal chimneys, illuminating the abyss like an enchanted alien forest.\n\nAnd poised directly at the precipice of a bottomless **Abyssal Rift** miles wide stood a monumental wonder—\n\nAn eighty-meter-tall marvel of architectural genius, sculpted entirely from bronze gears, mercury counterweights, and crystal prisms—**The Lost Beacon**!\n\nYet atop this sacred, ancient sentinel, the giant Fresnel lens lay dark and dead.\n\nDozens of hydraulic cables as thick as primeval serpents gripped the base of the lighthouse like vampiric vines.\n\nAnd anchored several hundred yards before the lighthouse was a two-hundred-foot industrial nightmare—the **Leviathan Extractor**, powered by hundreds of hydraulic rams and nuclear-steam turbines, swinging eight colossal excavator talons to batter the ancient stone portal at the lighthouse foundation!\n\nSuspended beneath the extractor's central gantry was a transparent deep-sea cage crafted from high-tensile titanium.\n\nChained within that cage was an elderly man in an oilskin sailor's coat, his snow-white beard trailing down his chest!\n\n\"GRANDPA MORRIS!!\" Lan shrieked, tears springing to her eyes!\n\nThough battered and bruised, the old keeper's weathered blue eyes burned with unconquered fire. Hearing the approach across the water, he raised his head weakly toward The Aoki Gear.\n\nAt that moment, a smooth, chilling, cultured male laugh echoed from the extractor's PA speakers:\n\n\"Heheheh... How delightful. A handful of elementary school fledglings actually deciphered the buoy flags and dismantled my prized hunters and drones.\"\n\nWith that voice, the pressurized canopy of the command bridge slowly hissed open.\n\nStepping onto the balcony in a tailored deep-sea bespoke suit, a solid-gold pocket watch glinting at his breast pocket, an elegant middle-aged gentleman sipped from a steaming cup of Earl Grey, gazing down at Cheng Hao:\n\n\"Allow me to introduce myself. I am the Executive Chairman of Kuroshio Heavy Industries—**Shen Tian-Cheng**.\"\n\n\"Shen Qi-Ming was my incompetent younger brother. No matter; thanks to you locking him away, I am free to claim the ultimate heritage of the Gear Sea entirely for myself.\"\n\nTaking a delicate sip of tea, Shen Tian-Cheng's eyes locked onto the dodecahedral astrolabe upon Cheng Hao's chest, blazing with unvarnished corporate greed:\n\n\"The grandson of old Cheng Yuan-Shan, I presume? That dodecahedral astrolabe in your hands is the final master key to unlock the lighthouse core's eternal dynamo.\"\n\n\"Surrender it obediently. Otherwise... a single tap of this button, and my hydraulic talons will crush old Morris into deep-sea chum!\"\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 14, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":15,"rawContent":"# 第十五章：皮可的水翼極速破浪\n\n## 一、深海懸崖上的最後倒數\n\n萬米深海大裂谷的深處，水溫低至接近冰點，但環繞在迷失燈塔周圍的數十座地熱噴泉，卻正咕嚕嚕噴吐著滾燙灼熱的白色氣泡。\n\n冷熱交匯的深海對流，在八十公尺高的青銅燈塔周圍形成了一道道肉眼可見的扭曲鹽躍層。\n\n黑潮重工長達六十公尺的「深海百眼巨械」，如同一頭狂暴的遠古深海巨蜘蛛，正用它那八根粗大如火車車廂的液壓鋼爪，死死扣在懸崖邊緣的玄武岩上。\n\n而在巨械中央那條高高揚起的重型起重吊臂下方，老守燈人莫里斯被囚禁在一隻兩公尺見方的透明鈦合金深潛吊籠裡，懸空在萬米深淵的正上方！\n\n「滴答……滴答……」\n\n沈天成手裡端著金邊骨瓷茶杯，另一隻戴著白手套的手優雅地握著起重機的紅色脫鉤扳機。他居高臨下地看著甲板上的誠浩，嘴角帶著一抹殘忍的冷笑：\n\n「倒數最後十秒。十、九、八……」\n\n「住手！我給你！！」\n\n誠浩突然上前一步，雙手高高舉起了那隻泛著璀璨金光的「十二面體古代星象儀核心」！\n\n「誠浩？！」身後的嵐急得一把抓住船舷欄杆。\n\n「別衝動！那可是打開燈塔的唯一鑰匙！」巴克也急得滿頭大汗。\n\n然而，所有人都沒注意到，誠浩背在身後的左手，正悄悄扣動著無線骨傳導耳麥的通訊按鈕，將一連串急促無比的加密敲擊聲，送進了葉旖緁的耳機裡：\n\n`---. --- / -.-. .- - -.-. ....`（**GO CATCH —— 準備接應！**）\n\n葉旖緁的瞳孔猛地一縮，瞬間領會了誠浩的真正作戰意圖！\n\n「沈董事長，星象儀在這裡，但它重達十公斤，我只能用繩索吊過去給你！」誠浩大聲喊道，腳步看似慌亂地朝著青木齒輪號的左舷滑動。\n\n「很好，識時務者為俊傑。扔到我的機械臂掌心上！」沈天成眼中閃過一抹得意的貪婪，身子微微前傾。\n\n就在沈天成的注意力完全被黃金星象儀吸引的千分之一秒——\n\n「巴克！煙霧干擾！丁丁，斬斷吊纜！」誠浩猛然發出一聲驚天動地的暴喝！\n\n---\n\n## 二、水翼升力矩與地熱亂流的極限計算\n\n「老子早就等得不耐煩了！！」\n\n破浪鐵錨號上的巴克船長狂吼一聲，單腳狠狠跺下甲板底部的排煙踏板！\n\n「轟——砰！」\n\n十幾枚由海盜自製的硫磺墨魚煙火彈破空而起，在深海巨械的駕駛艙玻璃前轟然炸裂，濃稠如墨汁般的黑霧瞬間將沈天成的光學觀測窗徹底覆蓋！\n\n「混蛋！敢耍我？！去死吧老東西！！」\n\n失去視野的沈天成惱羞成怒，憑著記憶瘋狂按下了手邊的脫鉤按鈕！\n\n「喀啦！」\n\n吊臂頂部的液壓卡榫瞬間彈開，重達數百公斤的鈦合金囚籠，載著老莫里斯，如同一顆脫線的沉重鉛球，朝著漆黑一片、深不見底的萬米大裂谷轟然墜落！\n\n「墜落加速度 $g' \\approx 8.2\\,\\text{m/s}^2$！距離深淵吸力層只有三十公尺！」\n\n葉旖緁的雙眼死死盯著聲納測距儀，嘴唇飛速翻動，大腦爆發出超神經級的運算極限：\n\n```\n【流體力學水翼升力計算公式（Hydrofoil Lift Equation）】：\nL = 1/2 × C_L × ρ × v² × A\n\n參數確認：\n囚籠＋人體＋誠浩總重力：W ≈ 7,000 N\n皮可展開水翼雙層受力面積：A = 1.2 m²\n深海地熱混合海水密度：ρ ≈ 980 kg/m³\n攻角 18° 時的水翼升力係數：C_L ≈ 0.85\n\n反推升空極限臨界速度 v：\n7000 = 0.5 × 0.85 × 980 × v² × 1.2\n7000 = 499.8 × v²\nv² ≈ 14.00 ➡️ v ≈ 3.74 m/s (基礎漂浮速度)\n\n【致命危機修正】：\n大裂谷深淵邊緣存在強大的地熱下沉冷拽流，垂直下墜速度達 -6.5 m/s！\n若要抵抗下拽流並在 2.5 秒的黃金窗口內拉起囚籠：\n皮可的水下推進速度必須強行超頻至——42 節（約 21.6 m/s）以上！\n```\n\n「**四十二節！攻角十八度！**」\n\n旖緁的尖叫聲穿透耳膜：「誠浩！你只有兩秒半的時間！錯過就永遠掉進地心裂隙了！」\n\n「皮可！超導引擎全解鎖——**暴風水翼衝浪模式（Full Burst Hydrofoil）**！！」\n\n「嗡————轟！！」\n\n誠浩雙腳如吸盤般穩穩踩在皮可背部展開的一米二雙層合金水翼板上，皮可尾部的微型高速渦輪在瞬間暴漲出刺目的幽藍電弧，伴隨著一聲高亢如龍吟的空化嘯叫，整塊水翼板貼著海面，以不可思議的極限姿態暴射而出！\n\n---\n\n## 三、波谷深處的極限救贖\n\n「呼嘯——！」\n\n深海的暗流如同鋼刀般颳在誠浩的黃銅護目鏡上，水壓劇烈壓縮著少年的胸膛。\n\n在護目鏡的超感光熱成圖中，那座透明的鈦合金囚籠正以驚人的速度穿透一道道幽藍色的珊瑚枝椏，垂直墜向下方那張開巨口般的漆黑海溝！\n\n距離跌入深淵，還剩最後一點五秒！\n\n「十公尺！五公尺！」\n\n誠浩在高速水流中俯下身軀，雙手死死扣緊水翼板前沿的壓力舵。\n\n在皮可雙眼紅光的指引下，水下渦輪爆發出高達萬轉的恐怖動力，水流在水翼下表面被極速壓縮，在水翼上表面形成巨大的負壓差——\n\n強大的**流體動態升力（Dynamic Lift）**在零點一秒內成形！\n\n誠浩操控著皮可，以貼著海溝岩壁四十五度向下俯衝的極限軌跡，硬生生切進了囚籠的正下方！\n\n「皮可！磁力抓扣！！」\n\n「喀噠！」\n\n皮可前胸的記憶合金薄片瞬間向前翻折流動，化作兩根粗壯靈巧的液壓機械長臂，在兩船相交的一剎那，「砰」的一聲死死抱住了囚籠底部的加固鋼梁！\n\n「抓住了！！」誠浩狂吼！\n\n然而，沉重的下墜慣性與大裂谷的下拽洋流，瞬間將誠浩連人帶板硬生生往下拖拽了整整二十公尺！冰冷的海水像巨錘一樣砸在誠浩的脊樑上，水翼板發出令人牙酸的金屬呻吟！\n\n「給我……**起飛啊啊啊啊——！！**」\n\n誠浩雙眼充血，咬緊牙關，拼盡全身的力氣將皮可的水翼舵角狠狠向上一提，精確調整至——**十八度極限攻角**！\n\n「轟隆！！」\n\n原本向下的恐怖慣性，在十八度水翼的導流下，被不可思議地轉化為垂直向上的沖天升力！\n\n皮可尾部的渦輪噴射出一道長達五公尺的雪白空化氣泡柱，整塊水翼板托舉著重達數百公斤的囚籠，在萬米深海中劃出了一道驚心動魄、宛如海豚破浪般的壯麗拋物線，轟然衝破了下沉洋流，重重砸回到了迷失燈塔基座的平坦石台上！\n\n「砰！」\n\n囚籠穩穩著陸。\n\n老莫里斯在囚籠中驚魂未定地喘著粗氣，看著眼前這個單膝跪地、胸膛劇烈起伏、額頭上青筋暴起的少年，老人的眼眶在一瞬間濕潤了：\n\n「這身手……這眼神……遠山……是你把這孩子帶來的嗎……」\n\n---\n\n## 四、巨械傾覆與落荒而逃\n\n「廢物！一群廢物！！」\n\n懸崖上方，濃煙剛剛散去的沈天成，看見老莫里斯居然被硬生生搶了回去，整個人氣得臉部扭曲，優雅的西裝被機油染得一塌糊塗。\n\n他一把推開副官，瘋狂推下主操控台上的全彈發射桿：\n\n「把燈塔給我炸平！誰也別想得到星穹密鑰！！」\n\n深海巨械那八根龐大的液壓鋼爪同時揚起，頭部的六門重型穿甲鑽頭發出刺耳的高轉速旋轉聲，如同一座崩塌的鋼鐵大山，朝著燈塔基座上的眾人瘋狂碾壓而來！\n\n「敢砸我的老船長？！嚐嚐將江大廚的熱油大禮包！！」\n\n就在這千鈞一髮之際，青木齒輪號的甲板上，將江雙手戴著厚厚的石棉防燙手套，竟然端著整整一大鍋燒得通紅、滾燙沸騰的高溫機油與高壓蒸汽混合物，借著海鷗號的纜繩牽引，狠狠將鐵鍋向前猛擲而出！\n\n「呼啦————！」\n\n滾燙的高溫油霧精準潑灑在深海巨械主驅動關節的裸露橡膠液壓密封圈上！\n\n深海的極度低溫與滾燙熱油瞬間引發了劇烈的材料脆化效應！\n\n「巴克！打它右腿的密封圈！」嵐大聲提醒。\n\n「得令！！」\n\n破浪鐵錨號的艦首重砲早已經校準完畢，巴克一記重錘砸下底火！\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n一枚重達兩百公斤的穿甲發條錨彈，化作一道火光，精準無比地轟擊在脆化的關節密封軸承上！\n\n「喀嚓——崩！！」\n\n深海巨械右側的三根主支撐腿應聲折斷！重達數百噸的鋼鐵身軀在懸崖邊緣瞬間失去了平衡，伴隨著一陣天崩地裂般的金屬斷裂哀鳴，整座巨型機械慘叫著側翻滾落，順著深海大裂谷的萬米深淵，轟然墜落進了永恆的黑暗之中，引爆出一道道沖天的水下泥沙巨柱！\n\n「可惡的小鬼……你們給我等著！利維坦大軍會把你們碎屍萬段的！！」\n\n沈天成在最後一秒乘坐著球形高壓逃生艙，狼狽不堪地彈射而出，朝著外海倉皇逃竄。\n\n---\n\n## 五、阿基米德浮力重壓水門\n\n深海大裂谷的邊緣，終於重新恢復了平靜。\n\n「呼……贏了……我們居然打翻了一座山一樣的鋼鐵怪物！」將江癱坐在石台上，摸了摸自己被燻黑的鼻尖，傻笑了起來。\n\n丁丁興奮地撲上前，一把抱住變回柴犬形態的皮可，用臉蛋使勁蹭著皮可的合金耳朵，皮可無奈地翻著白眼，發出輕輕的電子哀鳴。\n\n誠浩快步上前，用多功能螺絲筆切斷了鈦合金囚籠的門鎖，將虛弱的老莫里斯小心攙扶了出來。\n\n老燈匠緊緊握著誠浩長滿老繭的手，激動得鬍子發抖：\n\n「好孩子……像！太像了！三十年前，你爺爺遠山就是這樣，在暴風雨裡硬生生把我從暗礁上拖回來的！」\n\n莫里斯顫抖著指向身後那座巍峨如遠古豐碑般的迷失燈塔：\n\n「遠山就在燈塔的最核心……三十年前，我們在這裡發現了深海古代文明留下的『恆光反應堆』。為了不讓黑潮重工這群野心家把反應堆改裝成毀滅世界的海底地震武器，遠山用自己的生命矩陣，將燈塔的能量反向鎖定在了核心中樞！」\n\n「爺爺在裡面？！」誠浩的心臟瘋狂跳動。\n\n「沒錯！但黑潮重工剛才的鑽擊，破壞了燈塔的外層水壓平衡！」老莫里斯臉色突然變得無比凝重，指著燈塔底部那扇緊閉的青銅巨門：\n\n「這扇門叫做**『阿基米德浮力重壓水門』**！門內有三組互通的水銀重力浮箱。現在海水正在瘋狂湧入外廊，如果不能在**一百八十秒內**平衡水箱浮力，整座燈塔的菲涅耳水晶透鏡就會被水壓壓碎，永遠沉沒！」\n\n「嗡————！！」\n\n彷彿在印證老莫里斯的話，整座高達八十公尺的迷失燈塔突然劇烈震顫起來！\n\n青銅石門的中央，浮現出一圈散發著幽藍熒光的古代流體力學真值符號，以及一道觸目驚心的血紅色倒數計時：\n\n> `[EMERGENCY: 外部水壓 100 ATM 超載！]`  \n> `[水位上升中！距水晶透鏡結構崩塌剩餘：179秒、178秒……]`  \n> `[請立即校準三組浮箱排水配重比（V1 : V2 : V3）！]`\n\n一場與時間賽跑的終極生死解謎，在燈塔的大門前轟然拉開序幕！\n\n---\n\n*(第十五章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十五章：皮可的水翼極速破浪 (Chapter 15: PICO's High-Velocity Hydrofoil Breaker)\n\n## 一、深海懸崖上的最後倒數 (I. The Final Countdown on the Abyssal Cliff)\n\nIn the fathomless depths of the ten-thousand-meter Abyssal Rift, water temperatures hovered near freezing, yet dozens of geothermal vents encircling the Lost Lighthouse gurgled furiously, spewing clouds of blistering white bubbles.\n\nThe clash of icy deep-sea currents and superheated thermal plumes forged rippling, visible haloclines around the eighty-meter bronze sentinel.\n\nKuroshio Heavy Industries' two-hundred-foot \"Leviathan Extractor\"—resembling a primeval iron spider from the ocean floor—clamped its eight train-car-sized hydraulic steel claws firmly into the basalt cliff edge.\n\nAnd dangling beneath the extractor's towering heavy-duty gantry, Old Lighthouse Keeper Morris was imprisoned within a six-foot transparent titanium diving cage, suspended directly over the bottomless void!\n\n*Tick... tock... tick... tock...*\n\nShen Tian-Cheng held a gold-rimmed bone china teacup in one hand, while his white-gloved fingers rested with cultured poise upon the red quick-release winch trigger. Glancing down at Cheng Hao upon the deck, a cruel smirk touched his lips:\n\n\"Final ten seconds. Ten, nine, eight...\"\n\n\"STOP! I'LL GIVE IT TO YOU!!\"\n\nCheng Hao took a sudden stride forward, holding aloft the dazzling golden \"Dodecahedral Ancient Astrolabe Core\" with both hands!\n\n\"Cheng Hao?!\" Lan gasped behind him, gripping the bulwark railing.\n\n\"Don't lose your head! That's the only key into the lighthouse!\" Buck shouted, drenched in cold sweat.\n\nYet none of them noticed Cheng Hao's left hand, concealed behind his back, rhythmically tapping his wireless bone-conduction comms unit, transmitting a flurry of encrypted taps straight into Ye Yijie's earpiece:\n\n`---. --- / -.-. .- - -.-. ....` (**GO CATCH —— PREPARE FOR THE SNATCH!**)\n\nYijie's pupils constricted, instantly deciphering Cheng Hao's tactical gamble!\n\n\"Chairman Shen, the astrolabe is here, but it weighs over twenty pounds—I can only rig a towline to hoist it to you!\" Cheng Hao shouted, feigning panic as he shuffled toward the port railing of The Aoki Gear.\n\n\"A wise bird chooses the right branch. Drop it onto my manipulator claw!\" Greed flashed in Shen Tian-Cheng's eyes as he leaned eagerly forward.\n\nIn that microsecond when Shen Tian-Cheng's attention was completely ensnared by the golden relic—\n\n\"BUCK! SMOKE SCREEN! DING-DING, SEVER THE CABLE!\" Cheng Hao roared with earth-shattering authority!\n\n---\n\n## 二、水翼升力矩與地熱亂流的極限計算 (II. Hydrofoil Lift and Geothermal Turbulence Calculations)\n\n\"I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS ALL DAY!!\"\n\nAboard the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor, Captain Buck bellowed, stomping his boot down upon the deck smoke-pedal!\n\n*BOOM——CRACK!*\n\nA dozen pirate-engineered sulfur-cuttlefish smoke mortar rounds shrieked into the air, detonating directly before the observation bridge of the Leviathan Extractor, blinding Shen Tian-Cheng's viewing dome in an impenetrable curtain of inky black smog!\n\n\"Little wretches! You dare play me?! DIE, OLD MAN!!\"\n\nRobbed of vision, Shen Tian-Cheng mashed the quick-release actuator in a spasm of blind fury!\n\n*CLACK!*\n\nThe hydraulic winch claw snapped open. The multi-ton titanium cage carrying Old Morris plunged like an untethered lead sinker toward the pitch-black, bottomless ten-thousand-meter abyss!\n\n\"Downward acceleration $g' \\approx 8.2\\,\\text{m/s}^2$! Only a hundred feet to the abyssal suction zone!\"\n\nYijie's eyes remained glued to the sonar telemetry, her lips moving at hyper-computational speed:\n\n```\n[HYDROFOIL LIFT CALCULATION EQUATION]:\nL = 1/2 × C_L × ρ × v² × A\n\nParameter Baseline:\nTotal mass of cage + occupant + Cheng Hao: W ≈ 7,000 N\nPICO dual-tier hydrofoil surface area: A = 1.2 m²\nDeep-sea geothermal seawater density: ρ ≈ 980 kg/m³\nHydrofoil lift coefficient at 18° angle of attack: C_L ≈ 0.85\n\nCalculating critical takeoff velocity v:\n7000 = 0.5 × 0.85 × 980 × v² × 1.2\n7000 = 499.8 × v²\nv² ≈ 14.00 ➡️ v ≈ 3.74 m/s (Basic buoyancy glide speed)\n\nCRITICAL TURBULENCE CORRECTION:\nThe abyssal rift precipice suffers violent geothermal downwelling,\npulling downward at -6.5 m/s!\nTo conquer the downwelling and arrest the fall within a 2.5s window:\nPICO's submerged velocity must overdrive to——42 knots (approx. 21.6 m/s)!\n```\n\n\"**FORTY-TWO KNOTS! EIGHTEEN-DEGREE ATTACK ANGLE!**\"\n\nYijie's shriek pierced the comms: \"Cheng Hao! You have exactly two and a half seconds! Miss it, and you plunge into the mantle rift forever!\"\n\n\"PICO! SUPERCONDUCTING OVERDRIVE——**FULL BURST HYDROFOIL MODE**!!\"\n\n*VROOOOOOOM——BOOOOM!!*\n\nCheng Hao's soles locked with vacuum grip onto PICO's four-foot dual-tier alloy hydrofoil board. The micro-turbine at PICO's stern flared with blinding sapphire electrical arcs, and with a roaring cavitation howl like a surging dragon, the board rocketed across the dark swell at impossible speed!\n\n---\n\n## 三、波谷深處的極限救贖 (III. Extreme Salvation in the Trough)\n\n*WHOOOOOSH——!*\n\nAbyssal slipstreams slammed against Cheng Hao's brass Ghost Goggles like steel blades, tremendous ambient water pressure bearing down upon the boy's chest.\n\nIn the high-sensitivity infrared HUD, the transparent titanium cage was plummeting through forests of glowing blue coral branches, falling straight toward the gaping jaws of the midnight trench!\n\nOne and a half seconds before total abyss entry!\n\n\"Thirty feet! Fifteen feet!\"\n\nCrouched low against the torrent, Cheng Hao's knuckles turned white around the board's pressure rudder.\n\nGuided by the scarlet beams from PICO's eyes, the submerged turbine spun past ten thousand RPM, compressing flow along the lower foil surface to create a massive pressure differential—\n\nTremendous **Dynamic Lift** solidified in a tenth of a second!\n\nBanking along the trench wall at a suicidal forty-five-degree dive, Cheng Hao knifed straight beneath the falling cage!\n\n\"PICO! MAGNETIC GRAPPLING JAWS!!\"\n\n*CLANG!*\n\nMemory-alloy plates along PICO's prow flowed forward, morphing into two muscular hydraulic grappling arms that clamped violently onto the cage's reinforced steel undercarriage!\n\n\"LOCKED ON!!\" Cheng Hao roared!\n\nYet the crushing downward momentum and downwelling current instantly dragged Cheng Hao and the board downward by more than sixty feet! The freezing water hammered against his spine like a sledgehammer, the alloy board groaning in structural agony!\n\n\"LIFT... **TAKE OFFFFFF——!!**\"\n\nVeins bulging across his temples, Cheng Hao threw every ounce of his soul into hauling back the hydrofoil elevator, locking it onto the extreme—**eighteen-degree critical attack angle**!\n\n*BOOOOOOM!!*\n\nGuided by the eighteen-degree hydrofoils, the crushing downward inertia was miraculously inverted into skyward vertical lift!\n\nPICO's turbine blasted a sixteen-foot column of cavitating white bubbles. Supporting the multi-ton titanium cage, the board carved an awe-inspiring, dolphin-like leap through the deep ocean, bursting through the downwelling current to slam heavily down onto the level stone terrace of the Lost Lighthouse!\n\n*THUD!*\n\nThe cage touched down safely.\n\nInside, Old Morris drew ragged, breathless gasps. Gazing upon the kneeling boy before him—sweat-drenched, veins pulsing, chest heaving—the old keeper's eyes welled with tears:\n\n\"That grit... that fire in your eyes... Yuan-Shan... did you bring this boy to me...\"\n\n---\n\n## 四、巨械傾覆與落荒而逃 (IV. The Behemoth Overturns and Flees in Ruin)\n\n\"Useless! A pack of useless fools!!\"\n\nAbove the cliff, as the smoke cleared, Shen Tian-Cheng watched Morris being snatched away right under his nose. His face contorted with rage, his bespoke suit ruined with grease.\n\nShoving his co-pilot aside, he slammed the master salvo lever to the stops:\n\n\"LEVEL THE LIGHTHOUSE! NO ONE GETS THE CELESTIAL KEY!!\"\n\nAll eight colossal hydraulic claws of the Leviathan Extractor reared upward. Six heavy armor-piercing drill heads spun up with ear-splitting shrieks, bearing down like a collapsing steel mountain to crush everyone upon the terrace!\n\n\"Trying to squash my old captain?! TASTE CHEF JIANG'S SCALDING OIL SURPRISE!!\"\n\nIn that razor-thin fraction of a second, Jiang Jiang—wearing thick asbestos furnace mitts aboard The Aoki Gear—heaved an enormous stockpot filled with bubbling, incandescent scalding grease and steam, slinging it forward along the Seagull's towline!\n\n*SPLAAAASH——!*\n\nThe superheated oil mist splashed squarely across the exposed rubber hydraulic seals on the extractor's primary knee joint!\n\nThe extreme deep-sea cold clashed instantly with the boiling grease, triggering violent thermal shock and material embrittlement!\n\n\"Buck! Target the starboard knee seal!\" Lan shouted the cue.\n\n\"ORDERS RECEIVED!!\"\n\nThe bow anchor cannon on the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor was already locked on. Buck drove his sledgehammer onto the primer!\n\n*BOOOOOM————!!*\n\nA four-hundred-pound armor-piercing clockwork anchor round screamed through the water, detonating squarely upon the brittle joint bearing!\n\n*CRACK——SHATTER!!*\n\nThe three primary starboard support legs snapped like dry twigs! The multi-hundred-ton steel behemoth lost all equilibrium along the cliff edge. With a subterranean shriek of twisting iron, the entire industrial leviathan rolled sideways, tumbling into the bottomless abyss of the rift, throwing up towering plumes of deep-sea silt as it plunged into eternal darkness!\n\n\"Wretched brats... MARK MY WORDS! THE LEVIATHAN FLEET WILL GRIND YOU TO DUST!!\"\n\nAt the final second, Shen Tian-Cheng ejected in a spherical high-pressure escape capsule, fleeing in frantic retreat toward the outer ocean.\n\n---\n\n## 五、阿基米德浮力重壓水門 (V. The Archimedean Buoyancy Blast Door)\n\nCalm returned to the edge of the Abyssal Rift once more.\n\n\"Phew... We won... We actually flipped a mountain-sized steel monster!\" Jiang Jiang slumped onto the terrace, smearing soot across his nose, giggling like a madman.\n\nDing-Ding bounced over, wrapping both arms around PICO in its Shiba Inu form, rubbing her cheek against its alloy ears as PICO rolled its eyes in comic, long-suffering electronic sighs.\n\nCheng Hao stepped forward, slicing through the cage's titanium locks with his screwdriver pen, gently helping the weathered old Morris out.\n\nThe veteran lighthouse keeper gripped Cheng Hao's calloused hands, his beard trembling with emotion:\n\n\"Fine boy... You are the spitting image of your grandfather! Thirty years ago, Yuan-Shan dragged me off the reef in a gale in just the same way!\"\n\nMorris pointed trembling fingers toward the towering sentinel behind them:\n\n\"Yuan-Shan is inside the deepest heart of the lighthouse... Thirty years ago, we discovered the ancient 'Eternal Light Reactor' here. To stop Kuroshio from turning it into a tectonic seismic weapon, Yuan-Shan used his own life-force neural matrix to lock the reactor's core!\"\n\n\"Grandpa is inside?!\" Cheng Hao's heart hammered against his ribs.\n\n\"Yes! But Kuroshio's drilling breached the outer hydraulic balance!\" Old Morris's face darkened, pointing toward the colossal bronze double doors at the base of the tower:\n\n\"This is the **Archimedean Buoyancy Blast Door**! Behind it lie three interconnected mercury ballast tanks. Seawater is flooding the outer corridor; if we cannot balance the ballast buoyancy within **one hundred and eighty seconds**, the hydrostatic pressure will crush the Fresnel crystal lens, sinking the lighthouse forever!\"\n\n*HUMMMMMM——!!*\n\nAs if confirming Old Morris's warning, the eighty-meter Lost Beacon shuddered violently!\n\nAcross the center of the bronze portal, glowing azure glyphs of fluid dynamics flared to life, alongside a blood-red countdown timer:\n\n> `[EMERGENCY: EXTERNAL PRESSURE OVERLOAD AT 100 ATM!]`  \n> `[WATER RISING! FRESNEL LENS COLLAPSE IN: 179s, 178s...]`  \n> `[IMMEDIATELY CONFIGURE BALLAST DISPLACEMENT RATIOS (V1 : V2 : V3)!]`\n\nA desperate race against time and crushing water pressure began before the ancient gates!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 15, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":16,"rawContent":"# 第十六章：齒輪漩渦中的水下迷宮\n\n## 一、阿基米德浮箱的生死配重\n\n「嘩啦啦啦————！」\n\n冰冷刺骨的深海水流，如同無數條狂暴的巨蟒，自被鑽裂的青銅外廊縫隙中瘋狂湧入！\n\n短短三十秒內，海水就已經淹沒了所有人的膝蓋，水位正以每秒兩公分的恐怖速度急劇上漲。水流沖擊在燈塔那扇高達十公尺的「阿基米德浮力重壓水門」上，發出震耳欲聾的金屬呻吟。\n\n老莫里斯抹了一把鬍子上的鹽水，指著門樑兩側三根粗大透明的承壓水銀玻璃計量柱，焦急地大喊：\n\n「水門的開關由左、中、右三組互通的水銀浮力配重艙（$V_1, V_2, V_3$）控制！它們分別連接著三條長短不一的差動齒輪槓桿力臂（$L_1 = 1\\,\\text{m}, L_2 = 2\\,\\text{m}, L_3 = 3\\,\\text{m}$）！」\n\n「黑潮的鑽機破壞了三組水箱的初始壓力平衡！如果三組浮箱產生的反向托舉力矩不能在**一百八十秒內**完全相等，門軸就會被外側 100 個大氣壓的深海水壓硬生生扭斷！整座燈塔的菲涅耳水晶透鏡將會被徹底壓碎！」\n\n青銅門樑上的紅色倒數計時，正冰冷無情地瘋狂跳動：\n\n> `[WARNING: 距離門軸金屬疲勞極限剩餘：89秒、88秒……]`  \n> `[左力臂 L1 = 1m ｜ 中力臂 L2 = 2m ｜ 右力臂 L3 = 3m]`  \n> `[總注水配重格數：11 格（必須一次性分配完畢！）]`  \n> `[請立即旋動三組注水轉輪，設定排水配重比 V1 : V2 : V3！]`\n\n「十一格總水量！力矩平衡（Torque Equilibrium）！」\n\n葉旖緁一腳踩在凸起的青銅閥門基座上，抹開眼鏡上的水霧，手中的鋼筆在防水筆記本上劃出刺耳的摩擦聲：\n\n「阿基米德浮力定律：浮箱產生的向上托舉力 $F$ 與排開液體體積 $V$ 成正比（$F \\propto V$）！」  \n「槓桿力矩平衡條件：力矩 $\\tau = F \\times L$！要讓三條不同長度的槓桿對水門產生的平衡力矩完全均等（$\\tau_1 = \\tau_2 = \\tau_3$），浮箱體積 $V$ 與力臂長度 $L$ 必須成**嚴格的反比關係**！」\n\n$$\\tau_1 = \\tau_2 = \\tau_3 \\implies V_1 \\times L_1 = V_2 \\times L_2 = V_3 \\times L_3$$\n\n「代入力臂長度 $L_1 = 1, L_2 = 2, L_3 = 3$！」\n\n旖緁的眼中閃過精準的光芒：\n\n$$\\text{設公共平衡力矩為 } 6 \\text{ 個單位：}$$  \n$$V_1 = \\frac{6}{L_1} = \\frac{6}{1} = 6 \\text{ 格！}$$  \n$$V_2 = \\frac{6}{L_2} = \\frac{6}{2} = 3 \\text{ 格！}$$  \n$$V_3 = \\frac{6}{L_3} = \\frac{6}{3} = 2 \\text{ 格！}$$\n\n「驗算總水量：$6 + 3 + 2 = 11$ 格！剛好耗盡全部十一格注水配重！」\n\n「**排水配重比：六比三比二（6 : 3 : 2）！**」\n\n旖緁猛地抬頭大喊：「左輪轉動六圈！中輪轉動三圈！右輪轉動兩圈！快！！」\n\n「左輪交給我！」誠浩一把撲向左側沉重的青銅轉輪。  \n「中輪老子包了！」巴克擼起袖子，雙手死死扣緊中輪把手。  \n「右輪看我的！」嵐嬌叱一聲，合金船槳插進右轉輪孔洞，借力猛推！\n\n「一！二！三……轉！！」\n\n「嘎吱吱吱——轟隆！」\n\n在水流漫過胸膛的最後十秒鐘，三道轉輪同時發出沉重的機油咬合聲！\n\n左側轉輪旋轉整整六圈！中間轉輪旋轉三圈！右側轉輪旋轉兩圈！\n\n柱內的三股水銀與重力浮子在一瞬間攀升到了同一水平基準線！\n\n「咔噠————轟隆隆隆！！」\n\n三具重達數十噸的液壓槓桿在同一微秒內完成了力矩平衡！厚達半公尺的阿基米德青銅重壓水門，宛如一尊甦醒的遠古金屬巨神，帶著一聲撼動海溝的巨響，轟然下砸、嚴絲合縫地閉合卡死！\n\n底部的排水格柵同時彈開，不到三十秒，內廊洶湧的海水被高壓排水泵徹底抽空。\n\n危機解除！\n\n---\n\n## 二、垂直八十公尺的立體發條迴廊\n\n「呼……哈……救命……我的鞋子裡全是鹹魚味！」\n\n將江整個人癱坐在乾燥的地板上，脫下鞋子倒出一大灘海水，大口大口地喘著粗氣。\n\n「別抱怨了小胖子，要不是剛才關門及時，你現在已經是一條深海醃魚了。」巴克抹了把臉上的水，嘴硬地嘲笑道，但眼神中卻滿是對這幫少年不可思議的敬佩。\n\n丁丁則蹲在一旁，拿出一塊小手帕，溫柔地替渾身濕透的皮可擦拭著金屬耳朵，皮可舒服地瞇起鏡頭，尾巴搖得像個小風扇。\n\n誠浩擦乾護目鏡，緩緩推開了通往燈塔內部的第二重閘門。\n\n當閘門開啟的一瞬間，所有人都被眼前的壯麗景象徹底震撼得說不出話來——\n\n燈塔內部竟然是一個直徑達三十公尺、垂直高度整整八十公尺的巨大中空立體豎井！\n\n這裡完全隔絕了海水，乾燥而溫暖。空氣中瀰漫著古老發條油與臭氧的特殊芳香。\n\n更不可思議的是，在整座豎井的內部空間中，根本沒有傳統的旋轉樓梯，而是懸空咬合著數百枚大小不一、直徑從兩公尺到十公尺不等的**巨型水平青銅齒輪平台**！\n\n「咔噠……咔噠……咔噠……」\n\n這些青銅齒輪平台在中央巨大發條軸芯的帶動下，正以不同的齒數、不同的速度，順時針與逆時針交錯旋轉著！齒輪的咬合面雕刻著防滑的花紋，齒牙之間閃爍著微弱的金黃色熒光，宛如一座垂直懸掛在深海中的立體機械迷宮！\n\n而在豎井的最頂端、八十公尺的高空中央，正靜靜懸浮著一座足足有三層樓高的巨大水晶透鏡——**「菲涅耳永恆大透鏡」**！\n\n只不過此刻，透鏡的內部光束微弱如風中殘燭，只剩下一道微弱的金光，在八十公尺的頂端忽明忽暗地跳動著。\n\n「這就是你爺爺和我們三十年前建造的『齒輪旋轉大迷宮』。」老莫里斯抬頭凝望著那座巨塔，眼中泛著無盡的追憶，「要登上頂層控制台，唯一的路徑就是踩著旋轉齒輪平台的交匯點，一路跳上去！」\n\n「但這些齒輪的轉速各不相同！」嵐仔細觀察著前方的平台，「如果跳錯了時機，就會直接從幾十公尺的高空跌落，被下層交錯咬合的金屬齒牙碾得粉碎！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、最小公倍數與相位共振跳躍\n\n「這不是瞎跳，這是精密的數學相位跳躍！」\n\n葉旖緁站在起跳點邊緣，推了推眼鏡，目光瞬間鎖定了前方三組關鍵的銜接齒輪平台：\n\n```\n【齒輪迷宮跳躍相位參數】：\n底層 A 齒輪（齒數 48）：每 12 秒自轉一週（逆時針）\n中層 B 齒輪（齒數 32）：每 8 秒自轉一週（順時針）\n高層 C 齒輪（齒數 24）：每 6 秒自轉一週（逆時針）\n\n安全跳躍窗口：\n只有當三枚齒輪的「防滑安全登陸踏板」在同一垂直軸線上重疊時，\n才會形成一條維持 3 秒鐘的無縫跳躍走廊！\n\n數學運算法則：\n求解三個自轉週期的「最小公倍數（Least Common Multiple, LCM）」！\nLCM(12, 8, 6) = 24 秒！\n\n相位規律：\n每隔 24 秒，三枚齒輪的金色卡槽會精準重合一次！\n下一次重合倒數：7秒、6秒、5秒……\n```\n\n「**最小公倍數是二十四秒！**」\n\n旖緁的聲音清脆堅定：「每隔二十四秒，齒輪的金色防滑卡槽會精準對齊三秒鐘！大家聽我的倒數口令，整隊一起起跳！」\n\n「倒數三秒！三……二……一……**跳！！**」\n\n「唰！唰！唰！」\n\n誠浩一馬當先，腳尖在 A 齒輪的邊緣狠狠一蹬，整個人在半空中劃過一道靈巧的弧線，精準落在了剛好旋轉而來的 B 齒輪邊緣！\n\n身後，嵐的身手宛如雨燕般敏捷，折疊船槳在空中輕輕一撐，輕盈跟上；巴克單手拎著丁丁的大衣領子，像隻矯健的山羊一樣穩穩落地；將江懷裡抱著大保溫箱，在皮可超導吸盤的拉扯下，連滾帶爬地撲上了安全平台！\n\n「咔噠！」\n\n就在眾人腳步落定的下一秒，身後兩枚巨型齒輪的咬合處，便帶著足以碾碎鋼板的萬噸衝量狠狠咬合在了一起，激盪出一連串耀眼的金色火花！\n\n「好險好險……我的屁股差點就少了一半！」將江拍著心口，滿臉煞白。\n\n「跟緊節奏！還有最後三組齒輪！下一次共振相位：十八秒後！」\n\n在旖緁精確到毫秒級的數學倒數下，冒險小隊化身為一支配合天衣無縫的特種部隊，在八十公尺高的旋轉發條立體迴廊中穿梭跳躍。\n\n三十公尺！五十公尺！七十公尺！\n\n每一次起跳，都伴隨著齒輪沉悶優雅的金屬交響；每一次落地，都踏在數學與物理定律最純粹的美感之上！\n\n---\n\n## 四、爺爺的全息投影與三十小時大限\n\n「呼——哈！」\n\n伴隨著最後一記奮力攀登，誠浩一把抓住了頂層環形控制台的黃銅欄杆，翻身躍上了八十公尺高空的主甲板！\n\n所有人隨後陸續登頂。\n\n展現在他們面前的，是整座迷失燈塔的終極心臟。\n\n直徑十公尺的菲涅耳水晶大透鏡近在咫尺，數以千計由天然水晶研磨而成的環形稜鏡，在微弱的金光下散發出彩虹般的折射光暈。\n\n而在透鏡的正下方，擺放著一張陳舊卻一塵不染的木質航海工作椅。椅背上整整齊齊地掛著一件洗得發白的深藍色羊毛水手毛衣。\n\n工作台中央，正靜靜擺放著一具閃爍著幽藍微光的古代全息發射台。\n\n當誠浩胸前那枚「十二面體古代星象儀」靠近控制台的瞬間，發射台上的感應光環突然劇烈旋轉了起來！\n\n「嗡————！」\n\n一道純淨無暇的白色全息光柱自平台中央沖天而起，在半空中交織重組——\n\n下一秒，一個身穿深藍色毛衣、滿頭銀髮、眼神無比溫暖堅毅的老人全息投影，帶著那抹誠浩無比熟悉的微笑，憑空出現在了所有人的眼前！\n\n「爺爺……」誠浩的眼眶瞬間紅了，忍不住伸出手去，但手指卻只是穿過了虛幻的光影。\n\n全息投影中的誠遠山老爺子，手裡端著一杯冒著熱氣的咖啡，目光彷彿穿透了三十年的時光，直直注視著眼前的孫子：\n\n> 『浩浩，如果你正站在這座菲涅耳透鏡前……說明你已經成功穿越了千島齒輪海，來到了爺爺一生奮鬥的終點。』  \n>  \n> 『不要害怕，我現在就在這座燈塔正下方三千公尺處的“古代地熱核心大廳”。』  \n>  \n> 『黑潮重工的沈天成，已經徹底瘋了。他駕駛著利維坦零號，在深海地殼插下了七枚“地熱地震針”，企圖強行引爆海底火山，掠奪所有的古代結晶能量……』  \n>  \n> 『我正在用這裡的最後發條大陣，死死頂住地殼斷裂層……但我這把老骨頭，**最多只能再撐最後三十個小時**。』  \n>  \n> 『一旦三十個小時耗盡，不僅深海大裂谷會徹底塌陷，引發的超級海嘯還會將整座海風島與鹿陽國小徹底吞沒！』  \n>  \n> 『要重啟燈塔、瓦解地震針，你們必須拿到最後的第三把鑰匙——那是當年我藏在海風島北側**“海市蜃樓全息折射海域”**中的【天琴座光學星盤】！』  \n>  \n> 『時間不多了，孩子們……世界的未來，就託付給你們了！』\n\n「滋啦啦——」\n\n話音落下，全息投影伴隨著一陣劇烈的信號干擾，化作點點金色的光斑消散在空氣中。\n\n三十個小時！\n\n這是一場關乎全島、全鎮、乃至爺爺生死的最後極限倒數！\n\n「轟隆隆隆隆————！！」\n\n突然間，整座八十公尺高的迷失燈塔，爆發出了一陣前所未有的劇烈搖晃！\n\n透過燈塔頂端厚重的耐壓水晶觀測窗，所有人駭然看見——\n\n在深海大裂谷底部的漆黑海溝中，七道直徑達數十公尺、燃燒著猩紅地熱岩漿的鋼鐵巨柱，正伴隨著無比恐怖的刺耳尖嘯，如同一根根淬毒的鋼針，狠狠刺進了深海地殼的裂縫深處！\n\n海水開始瘋狂沸騰！\n\n大地在悲鳴，深海在咆哮！\n\n---\n\n*(第十六章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十六章：齒輪漩渦中的水下迷宮 (Chapter 16: The Submerged Labyrinth of the Clockwork Maelstrom)\n\n## 一、阿基米德浮箱的生死配重 (I. Life-or-Death Counterweights of Archimedes)\n\n*SWOOOSH——ROAAAR!!*\n\nFrigid deep-sea torrents, like raging primeval serpents, surged through the fractures bored into the outer bronze corridor!\n\nIn less than thirty seconds, seawater flooded past everyone's knees, rising at a terrifying two inches per second. Churning swells hammered against the thirty-foot \"Archimedean Buoyancy Blast Door\" with deafening metallic groans.\n\nWiping brine from his beard, Old Morris pointed toward three thick, transparent mercury pressure metering columns flanking the lintel, shouting desperately:\n\n\"The portal's mechanism is driven by three interconnected mercury ballast tanks ($V_1, V_2, V_3$)! Each links to differential gear lever arms of varying lengths ($L_1 = 1\\,\\text{m}, L_2 = 2\\,\\text{m}, L_3 = 3\\,\\text{m}$)!\"\n\n\"Kuroshio's drill breached the initial pressure equilibrium! If the counter-lifting torques generated by the three tanks are not balanced within **one hundred and eighty seconds**, 100 atmospheres of external hydrostatic pressure will shear the door hinges clean off! The Fresnel crystal lens will be obliterated!\"\n\nAcross the bronze lintel, crimson countdown digits ticked down with icy cruelty:\n\n> `[WARNING: TIME TO HINGE STRUCTURAL FATIGUE: 89s, 88s...]`  \n> `[LEFT LEVER L1 = 1m ｜ CENTER LEVER L2 = 2m ｜ RIGHT LEVER L3 = 3m]`  \n> `[TOTAL WATER BALLAST UNITS: 11 UNITS (MUST BE COMPLETELY DISTRIBUTED!)]`  \n> `[IMMEDIATELY ADJUST VALVES TO CONFIGURE DISPLACEMENT RATIO V1 : V2 : V3!]`\n\n\"Eleven total ballast units! Torque Equilibrium!\"\n\nPlanting her foot upon a raised bronze valve pedestal, Ye Yijie wiped sea mist from her glasses, her pen scratching furiously across her waterproof journal:\n\n\"Archimedes' Principle of Buoyancy: Upward buoyant force $F$ is directly proportional to displaced fluid volume $V$ ($F \\propto V$)!\"  \n\"Lever Torque Equilibrium Condition: Torque $\\tau = F \\times L$! To equalize the balancing torques exerted by three unequal lever arms upon the portal hinges ($\\tau_1 = \\tau_2 = \\tau_3$), ballast volume $V$ and lever arm length $L$ must be **strictly inversely proportional**!\"\n\n$$\\tau_1 = \\tau_2 = \\tau_3 \\implies V_1 \\times L_1 = V_2 \\times L_2 = V_3 \\times L_3$$\n\n\"Input the lever lengths: $L_1 = 1, L_2 = 2, L_3 = 3$!\"\n\nIntellectual brilliance burned in Yijie's eyes:\n\n$$\\text{Assume a common equilibrium torque of } 6 \\text{ units:}$$  \n$$V_1 = \\frac{6}{L_1} = \\frac{6}{1} = 6 \\text{ units!}$$  \n$$V_2 = \\frac{6}{L_2} = \\frac{6}{2} = 3 \\text{ units!}$$  \n$$V_3 = \\frac{6}{L_3} = \\frac{6}{3} = 2 \\text{ units!}$$\n\n\"Verify total volume: $6 + 3 + 2 = 11$ units! Exactly exhausts all eleven units of ballast water!\"\n\n\"**DISPLACEMENT RATIO: SIX TO THREE TO TWO (6 : 3 : 2)!**\"\n\nYijie snapped her head up, screaming over the roar: \"Spin the left wheel six turns! Center wheel three turns! Right wheel two turns! HURRY!!\"\n\n\"Left wheel is mine!\" Cheng Hao threw himself onto the massive left wheel.  \n\"Center is mine!\" Buck rolled up his sleeves, gripping the center wheel spoke.  \n\"Watch the right!\" Lan shouted, jamming her alloy oar into the wheel spokes to heave with all her might!\n\n\"One! Two! Three... HEAVE!!\"\n\n*CREEEAK——CLANK-BOOOM!*\n\nIn the final ten seconds as water crested their chests, all three bronze wheels engaged with heavy gear clatter!\n\nLeft wheel: exactly six revolutions! Center wheel: three revolutions! Right wheel: two revolutions!\n\nThe three columns of mercury and gravity floats rose simultaneously to the exact same datum line!\n\n*CLANG————RUUUUUUMBLE!!*\n\nThree multi-ton hydraulic levers locked into torque equilibrium in the same microsecond! The half-meter-thick Archimedean bronze blast door slammed down like an awakened primeval titan, sealing with an airtight, ocean-shaking boom!\n\nSubterranean drainage grates snapped open, and in less than thirty seconds, high-pressure pumps purged every gallon of seawater from the vestibule.\n\nCrisis averted!\n\n---\n\n## 二、垂直八十公尺的立體發條迴廊 (II. The Eighty-Meter Vertical Clockwork Gallery)\n\n\"Phew... hah... Mercy... my shoes smell like salted mackerel!\"\n\nJiang Jiang collapsed onto the dry floor, dumping a torrent of seawater from his sneaker, wheezing in exhaustion.\n\n\"Stop whining, chubby. If that blast door hadn't sealed in time, you'd be a deep-sea kipper right now,\" Buck scoffed, wiping brine from his brow, though his gaze shone with boundless awe for the youngsters.\n\nDing-Ding knelt beside PICO with a little handkerchief, gently drying its alloy ears. PICO purred with half-closed lenses, its tail wagging like an electric fan.\n\nCheng Hao dried his goggles, gently opening the inner sanctum gates leading into the lighthouse interior.\n\nThe instant the portal parted, every breath in the room caught in throat at the staggering spectacle—\n\nThe interior of the lighthouse was a colossal hollow vertical shaft nearly one hundred feet in diameter, soaring two hundred and sixty feet straight up!\n\nCompletely sealed from the ocean, the chamber was warm and dry, scented with antique clockwork oils and crisp ozone.\n\nMore extraordinary still: there were no staircases. Suspended throughout the vertical chasm were hundreds of interlocking **Colossal Horizontal Bronze Gear Platforms** ranging from six to thirty feet in diameter!\n\n*Tick-clack... tick-clack... tick-clack...*\n\nDriven by a central clockwork spine, these bronze gear platforms rotated in alternating clockwise and counter-clockwise orbits at varying ratios and velocities! Etched with tread patterns, the gear teeth glinted with soft golden fluorescence, forming a three-dimensional mechanical labyrinth suspended in the abyss!\n\nAnd suspended in the center of the shaft two hundred and sixty feet above hung a three-story crystal wonder—**The Fresnel Eternal Lens**!\n\nYet at this moment, the inner beam was as faint as a dying candle, flickering with feeble golden pulses high in the rafters.\n\n\"This is the 'Clockwork Revolving Labyrinth' your grandfather and we constructed thirty years ago,\" Old Morris gazed upward, eyes reflecting thirty years of memory. \"To reach the pinnacle console, the only route is leaping from one intersecting gear platform to the next!\"\n\n\"Their rotational velocities are entirely different!\" Lan observed the platforms. \"Miss the jump window by half a heartbeat, and you plummet hundreds of feet into interlocking steel teeth to be ground into dust!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、最小公倍數與相位共振跳躍 (III. Least Common Multiple and Phase Resonance Jumps)\n\n\"It's not random jumping—it is pure mathematical phase resonance!\"\n\nYe Yijie stood at the precipice, nudging her glasses as her gaze locked onto three critical gear platforms ahead:\n\n```\n[CLOCKWORK LABYRINTH PHASE PARAMETERS]:\nLower Gear A (48 teeth): 1 revolution every 12 seconds (counter-clockwise)\nMiddle Gear B (32 teeth): 1 revolution every 8 seconds (clockwise)\nUpper Gear C (24 teeth): 1 revolution every 6 seconds (counter-clockwise)\n\nSafe Traverse Window:\nOnly when the non-slip tread plates of all three gears align vertically\ndoes a seamless 3-second jump corridor manifest!\n\nMathematical Principle:\nCalculate the \"Least Common Multiple (LCM)\" of the three periods!\nLCM(12, 8, 6) = 24 seconds!\n\nPhase Alignment Law:\nEvery 24 seconds, the golden detents align precisely once!\nCountdown to next alignment: 7s, 6s, 5s...\n```\n\n\"**THE LEAST COMMON MULTIPLE IS TWENTY-FOUR SECONDS!**\"\n\nYijie's voice rang clear and unwavering: \"Every twenty-four seconds, the golden tread plates align for exactly three seconds! Jump together on my mark!\"\n\n\"Countdown: Three... two... one... **JUMP!!**\"\n\n*SWOOSH! SWOOSH! SWOOSH!*\n\nCheng Hao led the vanguard, vaulting from the rim of Gear A, soaring across the chasm to land squarely upon the arriving rim of Gear B!\n\nBehind him, Lan darted with the grace of a swallow, her alloy oar planting softly midair; Buck gripped Ding-Ding's collar with one hand, landing like a mountain goat; Jiang Jiang clutched his cooler, scrambled over the platform under PICO's magnetic tow!\n\n*CLANK!*\n\nThe millisecond everyone landed, the grinding teeth of the gears below engaged with thousands of tons of shearing force, unleashing a blinding shower of golden sparks!\n\n\"Too close... My backside was nearly sheared in two!\" Jiang Jiang clutched his heart, white as a sheet.\n\n\"Maintain rhythm! Three gear sets remaining! Next resonance phase: eighteen seconds!\"\n\nGuided by Yijie's millisecond-precise mathematical cadence, the team moved like a disciplined elite unit, leaping across the rotating two-hundred-and-sixty-foot vertical clockwork gallery.\n\nOne hundred feet! One hundred and eighty feet! Two hundred and forty feet!\n\nEvery leap resonated with the solemn, majestic symphony of interlocking bronze; every landing was anchored in the purest beauty of mathematical and physical law!\n\n---\n\n## 四、爺爺的全息投影與三十小時大限 (IV. Grandpa's Hologram and the Thirty-Hour Deadline)\n\n\"Phew... HAH!\"\n\nWith one final athletic pull, Cheng Hao caught the brass railing of the pinnacle circular bridge, vaulting onto the master observation deck two hundred and sixty feet above the ocean floor!\n\nOne by one, the others hauled themselves up.\n\nSpreading before them was the ultimate heart of the Lost Lighthouse.\n\nThe thirty-foot Fresnel crystal lens stood right before their eyes, thousands of hand-ground concentric prisms casting rainbow halos under the faint golden core light.\n\nBeneath the lens rested an antique teak navigator's desk. Draped over the chair was a faded, meticulously cared-for navy-blue woolen sailor's sweater.\n\nAnd in the center of the desk rested an ancient holographic projector pulsing with soft cerulean luminescence.\n\nThe instant the \"Dodecahedral Ancient Astrolabe\" on Cheng Hao's chest neared the dais, the induction rings spun up with a flurry of whirs!\n\n*HUMMMMMM——!*\n\nA pillar of pure white holographic radiance erupted skyward, weaving together in midair—\n\nThe next instant, a silver-haired elder wearing a navy-blue sweater, his eyes warm and unconquerable, appeared before them with the very smile Cheng Hao knew so well!\n\n\"Grandpa...\" Cheng Hao's eyes welled with tears, reaching out his hand, only for his fingers to pass through immaterial light.\n\nIn the recording, Grandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan held a steaming mug of coffee, his gaze seeming to pierce three decades of time to look straight into his grandson's eyes:\n\n> *\"Hao-Hao, if you stand before this Fresnel lens... it means you have crossed the Thousand-Island Sea and arrived at the final frontier of my life's work.\"*  \n>  \n> *\"Do not fear. I am currently in the 'Ancient Geothermal Core Chamber' three thousand meters beneath this very lighthouse.\"*  \n>  \n> *\"Shen Tian-Cheng of Kuroshio Heavy Industries has gone utterly mad. Operating Leviathan-0, he drove seven 'Geothermal Seismic Spikes' into the mantle, attempting to detonate the subterranean volcanos and plunder the ancient crystal energy...\"*  \n>  \n> *\"I am utilizing the final clockwork array here to brace the tectonic fault line... but these old bones **can hold out for thirty hours at most**.\"*  \n>  \n> *\"Once thirty hours expire, not only will the Abyssal Rift collapse, but the resulting megatsunami will drown Windward Island and Lu-Yang Elementary entirely!\"*  \n>  \n> *\"To restart the lighthouse and disarm the seismic spikes, you must obtain the final third key—the 【Lyra Optical Astrolabe】 I concealed in the **'Mirage Optical Refraction Waters'** north of Windward Island!\"*  \n>  \n> *\"Time is short, children... The future of our world is entrusted to you!\"*\n\n*ZZZZZT——CRACKLE——*\n\nThe holographic transmission broke up into static, dissolving into golden motes of light.\n\nThirty hours!\n\nA desperate final countdown deciding the fate of the island, their school, and Grandpa's very life!\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE————!!*\n\nSuddenly, the entire two-hundred-and-sixty-foot Lost Lighthouse shuddered violently!\n\nPeering through the pressure crystal viewing ports, everyone looked down in horror—\n\nIn the midnight chasm of the Abyssal Rift below, seven colossal steel pillars dozens of meters thick, blazing with volcanic magma, shrieked through the water like poisoned needles, plunging straight into the mantle fault lines!\n\nThe sea began to boil furiously!\n\nThe earth groaned in agony; the deep sea roared in fury!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 16, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":17,"rawContent":"# 第十七章：海市蜃樓與全息折射航線\n\n## 一、破曉的二十七小時倒數\n\n清晨六點，當青木齒輪號與破浪鐵錨號穿過燈塔水壓外廊，重新破水而出浮上千島齒輪海的洋面時，東方的天際線上正泛起一抹詭譎的紫金色朝霞。\n\n海面上沒有一絲風，水面平整得宛如一面無邊無際的黑色水銀鏡子。\n\n老莫里斯的聲音透過長波水下電台，在駕駛艙的揚聲器裡帶著沉重的沙沙雜音響起：\n\n> 『誠浩，聽得見嗎？』  \n> 『剛才燈塔底部的地震波傳感器再次記錄到一次芮氏 4.2 級的微震……沈天成的第一根地震針已經開始向地殼注入超高壓液態蒸汽！』  \n> 『地熱發條大陣的承壓指針已經滑落到黃色警戒區……你們的剩餘時間只剩下——**二十七小時**！』\n\n「收到，莫里斯爺爺！」誠浩握緊話筒，目光堅毅如鐵，「我們已經抵達海風島北側海域，一定會在天黑前取回天琴座光學星盤！」\n\n掛斷通訊，誠浩轉身走上甲板。\n\n此時的甲板上，所有人都在爭分奪秒地進行戰備檢修。\n\n將江把剩下的菠蘿麵包全部切成小塊，用錫箔紙緊緊包裝好分發給每個人，嘴裡嘟囔著：「一人三塊，這是我們最後的熱量儲備！誰要是敢餓著肚子解題，我第一個不答應！」\n\n巴克和丁丁則忙著在破浪鐵錨號的甲板上裝填最後兩箱合金發條彈藥。\n\n「喂，誠浩！」嵐站在海鷗號的船頭，手裡握著貝殼風向儀，眉頭深深鎖起，「看前面！我們已經進入海風島北側最邪門的禁區了——**『幻鏡之海』**！」\n\n誠浩、旖緁順著嵐手指的方向極目遠眺。\n\n只見在正前方不到三公里的平靜海平面上，晨霧與初升的朝陽交織在一起，竟然憑空浮現出了**三座一模一樣的巨大島嶼**！\n\n每一座島嶼上，都聳立著高達百公尺的陡峭水晶懸崖，在晨光中折射出耀眼的七彩光芒；甚至連懸崖下方拍打的白色浪花、旋轉的發條風車，都分毫不差地同頻晃動著！\n\n「三座天琴礁島？！」將江揉了揉眼睛，手裡的望遠鏡差點拿倒，「見鬼了！難道這島還會影分身術？！」\n\n「這不是超自然現象，這是大氣光學中的**『上蜃景（Superior Mirage）』**，加上古代全息投影中繼器產生的折射迷宮！」葉旖緁迅速戴上偏光遮陽鏡，神色嚴肅至極。\n\n---\n\n## 二、布魯斯特角與大氣逆溫層\n\n「上蜃景？」巴克狐疑地湊了過來，「老子在海上漂了三年，只聽說過大熱天路面上有水坑的下蜃景，這上蜃景又是個什麼名堂？」\n\n「下蜃景發生在炎熱的沙漠或柏油路面，是因為地面空氣熱、上層空氣冷形成的下凹折射；」\n\n旖緁打開黑皮筆記本，手中的破譯鋼筆迅速繪製出兩道彎曲的光線路徑：\n\n「但我們腳下的千島齒輪海，由於海底萬米大裂谷不斷泛出冰冷刺骨的深層洋流，貼近海面的空氣溫度極低，密度極大（折射率 $n_1$ 較高）；而上方數十公尺的大氣受到地熱蒸氣與晨曦照射，溫度急劇升高，密度變小（折射率 $n_2$ 較低）！」\n\n「這在氣象學上叫做**『極端逆溫層（Temperature Inversion）』**！」\n\n「當光線從下層稠密冷空氣斜射向上層稀薄熱空氣時，光線會不斷朝著密度大、溫度低的海面方向向下彎曲（Continuous Refraction），將地平線以下的物體硬生生『抬升』到半空中，形成虛幻的上蜃景！」\n\n「更要命的是——」誠浩取下胸前的十二面體星象儀，指著底座邊緣刻著的一圈精密黃銅刻度，「爺爺在底座上留下了提示銘文：」\n\n```\n【天琴海市蜃樓破譯警語】：\n「三島同現，兩虛一實。」\n「虛者，一為深海暗礁之鏡像幻景，一為黑潮人工激光全息陷阱；」\n「誤入虛島者，必遭水下暗刺或地熱沸泉焚毀。」\n\n光學破譯指引：\n「自然光反射具備布魯斯特偏振特性（Brewster's Law），而人造激光全息無此規律。」\n「轉動護目鏡偏振轉輪至完全偏振臨界角（Brewster's Angle）θ_B：」\ntan(θ_B) = n_2 / n_1\n\n當前大氣介質參數：\n海面冷空氣折射率：n_1 = 1.00035\n逆溫層熱空氣折射率：n_2 = 1.00020\n激光波長：λ = 532 nm\n\n操作法則：\n將偏振鏡片旋動至 θ_B 消除反射眩光，\n折射率不隨高度梯級畸變、且星光偏振軸垂直者，即為真島！\n```\n\n「**布魯斯特角（Brewster's Angle）！完全偏振定律！**」\n\n葉旖緁眼中精芒大盛：「當自然光以特定角度射入兩種不同折射率的介質界面時，反射光將變為完全垂直於入射面的線偏振光！只要利用偏振鏡片旋轉到特定角度，就能利用光波的偏振特性，徹底過濾掉人工全息激光與海面反射眩光！」\n\n「計算布魯斯特角！」\n\n旖緁的筆尖如飛針走線：\n\n$$\\tan\\theta_B = \\frac{n_2}{n_1} = \\frac{1.00020}{1.00035} \\approx 0.99985$$\n\n$$\\theta_B = \\arctan(0.99985) \\approx 44.995^{\\circ} \\approx 45.0^{\\circ} !$$\n\n「**四十五度完全偏振角！**」\n\n旖緁對著誠浩大喊：「誠浩！將幽靈護目鏡的右側偏光轉輪旋動至**四十五度**！仔細觀察三座島嶼的基座邊緣！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、偏振鏡下的真偽撕裂\n\n「收到！偏振轉輪——四十五度鎖定！」\n\n誠浩深吸了一口氣，手指輕輕撥動黃銅護目鏡右側的精密滾花齒輪旋鈕。\n\n「咔噠、咔噠……」\n\n伴隨著一陣微型鏡片的咬合聲，護目鏡的視野在一瞬間發生了翻天覆地的奇妙變化——\n\n海面上刺眼炫目的晨曦金光在一微秒內被偏振鏡片徹底濾除，原本白茫茫的海水瞬間變成了澄澈透明的暗墨綠色。\n\n而前方那三座高聳入雲的水晶島嶼，在四十五度偏振視野下，露出了截然不同的真實面目：\n\n左側的**「A 號島嶼」**：在偏振鏡下，整座島嶼的岩壁邊緣竟然浮現出一道道閃爍不定的橫向綠色掃描激光線！那是黑潮重工布設在海面浮標上的「人工全息干涉投影」，是用來引誘船隻撞向水下密集漂雷的死亡陷阱！\n\n中央的**「B 號島嶼」**：在偏振鏡下，島嶼的倒影竟然呈現出詭異的上下顛倒反轉，岩壁扭曲如波浪！這是大氣逆溫層將後方數十公里外無人荒島的影像向下折射形成的「天然上蜃景虛像」，下方是一片深達千米的致命地熱沸騰湧泉！\n\n而右側三十度方向的**「C 號島嶼」**：\n\n在四十五度偏振鏡的過濾下，島嶼的輪廓非但沒有消失，反而清晰無比！\n\n懸崖峭壁呈現出天然玄武岩特有的深邃黑褐色，岩壁中央赫然嵌著一座散發著璀璨星芒的古老青銅日晷觀星台！天空中天琴座織女星微弱的光芒，正筆直地與日晷頂端的青銅指針重合在了一起！\n\n「**右側！C 號島嶼是唯一的真實實體！**」\n\n誠浩猛然推開駕駛艙舷窗，指著右舵三十度方向狂吼：「巴克！嵐！右轉舵三十度！全速前進！衝破幻象海域！」\n\n「右滿舵三十度！衝啊！！」\n\n兩艘戰艦同時拉響戰鬥汽笛，在水面上劃出兩道平行的雪白大弧線，咆哮著直撲 C 號島嶼！\n\n---\n\n## 四、蜃樓中的致命伏擊\n\n然而，就在青木齒輪號剛剛修正航向的剎那，左側那座虛幻的「A 號島嶼」光影之中，突然傳來了一陣刺耳無比的噴氣式渦輪呼嘯！\n\n「咻——咻——咻——！」\n\n八架由黑潮重工部署在全息陷阱後方的高速**「蝠鱝型隱形巡邏飛艇」**，猛地撕碎了虛幻的光影，如同一群嗜血的黑色獵鷹，自半空中俯衝而下！\n\n飛艇兩側的六聯裝微型水面穿甲火箭巢，已經閃爍起危險的紅光！\n\n「被埋伏了！」嵐嬌斥一聲，海鷗號如同一尾靈巧的飛魚，在海面上連續走出了三個漂移大 Z 字，手中折疊船槳猛地拋出兩枚微型水上發煙筒，製造出一堵數公尺高的白色水幕。\n\n「丁丁！給我把那群鐵蝙蝠轟下來！」巴克怒髮衝冠，親自搖動鐵錨重砲。\n\n「發條連環三連發，裝填完畢！」丁丁掄起大鐵鎚，以驚人的怪力連環砸下三記重擊！\n\n「咚！咚！咚！」\n\n三枚裝填了高敏白磷與碎鐵片的發條榴彈在半空中梯次炸裂，漫天呼嘯的彈片瞬間將最前方的兩架蝠鱝飛艇的機翼打成了篩子，黑煙翻滾著栽入大海！\n\n然而，剩餘的六架飛艇卻憑藉著極高的航速，迅速調整陣型，朝著青木齒輪號的舵輪傾瀉下密集的穿甲火箭雨！\n\n「誠浩！小心舵機！」將江驚叫一聲，整個人奮不顧身地撲向船尾，手裡的黑鐵平底鍋在空中「當當當」連續彈開了三顆流彈火星！\n\n「皮可！水翼防暴巨盾模式！！」\n\n「嗡——喀啦啦！」\n\n立於船頭的皮可四肢一收，身軀上的記憶合金薄片在零點一秒內如孔雀開屏般瘋狂展開，重組為一面厚達五公分、表面雕刻著導流槽的兩米寬**「合金重型防暴防彈盾牌」**，死死護在駕駛艙舷窗前！\n\n「砰砰砰砰砰！」\n\n火箭彈的破片在防暴盾牌上撞擊出耀眼刺目的火樹銀花，高達上千度的高溫熔漿顺著導流槽滑落大海，皮可的幽藍雙眼在烈焰中堅如磐石，連半步都沒有退縮！\n\n借著皮可爭取的寶貴黃金防禦窗口，青木齒輪號順利衝入了 C 號島嶼天然的石灰岩拱門海蝕洞中！\n\n海蝕洞兩側厚實堅硬的玄武岩石壁，如同一頂天然的鋼盔，將追擊飛艇的轟炸徹底隔絕在外！\n\n---\n\n## 五、天琴座光學星盤與深海鑽艇\n\n穿過幽暗狹長的水下海蝕洞，眼前豁然開朗。\n\n這是一座深藏在海島腹地中央的天然避風天坑。天坑頂部懸垂著無數發光的鐘乳石，柔和的晨曦透過岩頂的裂隙傾瀉而下，宛如神聖的聚光燈。\n\n在天坑平靜的水池中央，矗立著一座造型奇特、完全由透光白玉與純銅齒輪打造的**「古代天琴觀星台」**。\n\n而在觀星台的正中央，正靜靜懸浮著一塊直徑約三十公分、由天然紫水晶研磨而成的星盤核心——**【天琴座光學星盤（Lyra Optical Astrolabe）】**！\n\n星盤懸浮在四道純淨的聲學懸浮微波光束之中，內部精緻無比的十二道發條指針，正隨著天空中天琴座織女星的運行微弱自轉著，散發著令人心醉神迷的淡紫色璀璨星芒！\n\n「找到了……第三把星穹密鑰！」\n\n葉旖緁捂著狂跳的胸口，眼中噙著激動的淚光：「有了它，加上十二面體星象儀，我們就能完全重啟迷失燈塔的菲涅耳透鏡！」\n\n誠浩快步踏上觀星台的石階，伸出雙手，小心翼翼地觸摸向那塊懸浮的紫晶星盤。\n\n然而，就在誠浩的指尖距離星盤僅剩三公分的剎那——\n\n「轟隆隆隆隆————！！」\n\n天坑底部的平靜水池，突然發出了一聲令整座海島為之劇烈顫抖的沉悶地鳴！\n\n水池底部原本平整的岩層轟然碎裂，一根直徑達十公尺、前端旋轉著六枚金剛石螺旋鑽頭的漆黑巨型潛水艇——**黑潮重工「深海重型盾構鑽艇 Mk-IV」**，帶著滔天的泥漿與水浪，如同一條破土而出的鋼鐵惡龍，蠻橫無比地撞碎了觀星台的下層基座！\n\n鑽艇的頂部艙門升起，沈天成手裡握著一柄泛著高壓電弧的金屬權杖，陰魂不散地出現在了艦橋頂端！\n\n他的身後，一塊巨大的全息倒數計時屏幕上，血紅色的數字正觸目驚心地狂暴閃爍：\n\n> `[距離七枚地震針全面超載引爆剩餘：23小時59分！]`\n\n沈天成優雅地整了整領帶，眼神中透著一抹勝券在握的猖狂冷笑：\n\n「呵呵呵……真是精彩絕倫的光學破解啊，小鬼們。」\n\n「感謝你們替我穿過了海市蜃樓，避開了所有的防禦機關。」\n\n沈天成手中的電弧權杖猛地向前一指，鑽艇兩側的八具高壓魚叉槍瞬間鎖定了觀星台上的誠浩：\n\n「現在，這塊天琴星盤，以及你們這群礙事的小蟲子……**都將成為這座深海墳墓的陪葬品！**」\n\n---\n\n*(第十七章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十七章：海市蜃樓與全息折射航線 (Chapter 17: The Mirage and the Holographic Refraction Route)\n\n## 一、破曉的二十七小時倒數 (I. Dawn's Twenty-Seven-Hour Countdown)\n\nAt six o'clock in the morning, when The Aoki Gear and the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor surfaced through the lighthouse hydraulic flume onto the open swells of the Gear Sea, an eerie violet-gold dawn was breaking along the eastern horizon.\n\nThere was not a breath of wind. The ocean lay as mirror-flat and motionless as an infinite expanse of liquid mercury.\n\nOld Morris's voice crackled through the long-wave underwater radio in the wheelhouse with heavy static:\n\n> *\"Cheng Hao, do you read me?\"*  \n> *\"The seismic wave sensors beneath the lighthouse recorded another 4.2-magnitude tremor... Shen Tian-Cheng's first seismic spike has begun injecting ultra-high-pressure superheated liquid steam into the mantle!\"*  \n> *\"The pressure needles of the geothermal clockwork array have slipped into the yellow hazard zone... You have exactly——**twenty-seven hours** remaining!\"*\n\n\"Copy that, Grandpa Morris!\" Cheng Hao gripped the microphone, his eyes hard as tempered steel. \"We have reached the northern quadrant of Windward Island. We will secure the Lyra Optical Astrolabe before nightfall!\"\n\nSigning off, Cheng Hao stepped out onto the forecastle.\n\nAboard the deck, every crew member was working feverishly against the ticking clock.\n\nJiang Jiang was slicing the remaining pineapple buns into small cubes, wrapping each tightly in tinfoil to distribute among the team, muttering: \"Three pieces per person—this is our final calorie reserve! If anyone tries to solve puzzles on an empty stomach, they answer to me!\"\n\nAcross the water, Buck and Ding-Ding were loading their final two crates of alloy clockwork munitions aboard the Iron Anchor.\n\n\"Hey, Cheng Hao!\" Lan called from the bow of the Seagull, her shell anemometer spinning gently in her palm, brow furrowed: \"Look ahead! We've entered the most treacherous sector north of the island—**The Sea of Phantoms**!\"\n\nCheng Hao and Yijie followed Lan's outstretched finger toward the horizon.\n\nLess than two miles dead ahead, morning fog and sunrise rays intertwined to manifest **three identical towering islands** floating upon the water!\n\nAtop each island rose crystal cliffs three hundred feet high, refracting brilliant prismatic rainbows under the morning sun. Even the crashing white surf at their bases and the spinning clockwork windmills turned in eerie, synchronous harmony!\n\n\"Three Lyra Reef Islands?!\" Jiang Jiang rubbed his eyes, nearly holding his binoculars backward. \"Sweet heavens! Does this island know how to cast shadow clones?!\"\n\n\"This is no supernatural sorcery; it is an atmospheric optical phenomenon known as a **'Superior Mirage'**, multiplied by an ancient holographic projection repeater network!\" Ye Yijie donned her polarized navigator's shades, her expression solemn.\n\n---\n\n## 二、布魯斯特角與大氣逆溫層 (II. Brewster's Angle and the Atmospheric Inversion Layer)\n\n\"A superior mirage?\" Buck leaned over suspiciously. \"I've sailed these seas for three years and only seen inferior mirages—like puddles on hot pavement. What on earth is a superior mirage?!\"\n\n\"Inferior mirages occur over scorching deserts or black asphalt, where hot air near the ground refracts light upward;\"\n\nYijie opened her black journal, sketching two curved optical paths with her pen:\n\n\"Here in the Thousand-Island Gear Sea, freezing upwelling currents from the Abyssal Rift chill the sea-surface air to near freezing, making it dense and giving it a high refractive index ($n_1$); meanwhile, the air layer fifty yards above is warmed by geothermal plumes and sunrise rays, becoming thin with a lower refractive index ($n_2$)!\"\n\n\"In meteorology, this is called an **'Extreme Temperature Inversion Layer'**!\"\n\n\"When light travels diagonally upward from the dense cold air into the thin warm air, it continuously bends downward toward the cold, dense sea surface, 'lifting' objects located below the horizon into midair, creating a floating superior mirage!\"\n\n\"Worse still—\" Cheng Hao unclasped the dodecahedral astrolabe from his chest, pointing to the precision brass engravings along its base: \"Grandpa left an encrypted inscription on the rim:\"\n\n```\n[LYRA MIRAGE DECRYPTION PROTOCOL]:\n\"Three islands appear as one; two are false and one is true.\"\n\"One falsehood is a mirror mirage of submerged reefs;\n one is a synthetic laser holographic trap deployed by Kuroshio;\"\n\"Entering a false island means destruction by underwater spikes\n or geothermal geysers.\"\n\nOptical Decryption Directive:\n\"Natural reflections exhibit Brewster's Polarizing Properties,\n while synthetic lasers possess no such order.\"\n\"Rotate the goggle polarizing dial to Brewster's Angle (θ_B):\"\ntan(θ_B) = n_2 / n_1\n\nAtmospheric Media Parameters:\nSea-surface cold air refractive index: n_1 = 1.00035\nInversion warm air refractive index: n_2 = 1.00020\nLaser wavelength: λ = 532 nm\n\nOperational Law:\nSet the polarizing filter to θ_B to eliminate reflective glare;\nthe island whose refraction shows no step-distortion with altitude\nand whose starlight polarization axis remains vertical is TRUE!\n```\n\n\"**BREWSTER'S ANGLE! THE LAW OF TOTAL POLARIZATION!**\"\n\nBrilliance ignited in Ye Yijie's eyes: \"When natural unpolarized light strikes the boundary between two media at a specific angle, the reflected beam becomes completely linearly polarized perpendicular to the plane of incidence! By rotating a polarizing filter to that precise angle, we can completely extinguish synthetic holographic lasers and sea-surface glare!\"\n\n\"Calculate Brewster's Angle!\"\n\nYijie's pen glided across the paper:\n\n$$\\tan\\theta_B = \\frac{n_2}{n_1} = \\frac{1.00020}{1.00035} \\approx 0.99985$$\n\n$$\\theta_B = \\arctan(0.99985) \\approx 44.995^{\\circ} \\approx 45.0^{\\circ} !$$\n\n\"**FORTY-FIVE DEGREES POLARIZATION ANGLE!**\"\n\nYijie yelled to Cheng Hao: \"Cheng Hao! Dial the right polarizing thumbwheel on your Ghost Goggles to **forty-five degrees**! Scrutinize the baseline of all three islands!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、偏振鏡下的真偽撕裂 (III. Truth and Fiction Under the Polarizing Filter)\n\n\"Understood! Polarizer thumbwheel—locked at forty-five degrees!\"\n\nCheng Hao took a deep breath, delicately rolling the knurled brass dial on the right rim of his goggles.\n\n*Click, click...*\n\nWith a muted detent click of internal micro-lenses, the world transformed through the eyepieces—\n\nBlinding morning glare vanished in a microsecond, the milky sea turning into a deep, crystal-clear emerald-black.\n\nAnd under the forty-five-degree polarizing filter, the three towering crystal islands revealed their true natures:\n\nTo the left, **\"Island A\"**: through the polarizer, horizontal green laser scan lines flickered violently along the rock face! It was an artificial holographic interference projection deployed by Kuroshio upon marine buoys—a deadly lure designed to draw vessels onto floating sea mines!\n\nIn the center, **\"Island B\"**: the island's reflection was bizarrely inverted upside down, the cliffs rippling like water! It was an atmospheric superior mirage of an uninhabited atoll miles away, beneath which lay a lethal, boiling thousand-meter geothermal geyser!\n\nAnd at thirty degrees to the starboard, **\"Island C\"**:\n\nUnder the forty-five-degree polarizing filter, its outline not only held firm, but became razor-sharp!\n\nThe basalt ramparts gleamed with natural deep brown hues, centered around an ancient bronze sundial observatory! Skyward, the faint rays of Vega in Lyra aligned directly with the bronze gnomon of the observatory!\n\n\"**STARBOARD! ISLAND C IS THE ONLY TRUE ISLAND!**\"\n\nCheng Hao threw open the wheelhouse sash, shouting at thirty degrees to starboard: \"Buck! Lan! Starboard thirty degrees! FULL THROTTLE! BREAK THROUGH THE MIRAGE!\"\n\n\"Starboard thirty! CHARGE!!\"\n\nBoth vessels sounded battle whistles, carving parallel white wakes across the calm sea, roaring straight toward Island C!\n\n---\n\n## 四、蜃樓中的致命伏擊 (IV. Deadly Ambush Within the Mirage)\n\nYet just as The Aoki Gear trimmed her heading, a deafening turbine howl erupted from within the holographic shroud of \"Island A\"!\n\n*WHOOSH——WHOOSH——WHOOSH!*\n\nEight high-speed **\"Manta-Ray Stealth Skimmers\"** deployed by Kuroshio burst through the holographic veil like a flock of predatory black falcons, diving straight down from the sky!\n\nMounted beneath their hulls, six-tube micro surface-skimming rocket pods pulsed with lethal red laser targeters!\n\n\"Ambush!\" Lan cried, the Seagull executing three high-speed evasive drifts across the swells, hurling dual smoke cannisters to raise a towering wall of white spray.\n\n\"Ding-Ding! BLOW THOSE IRON BATS OUT OF THE SKY!\" Buck spun the anchor cannon handwheels with furious speed.\n\n\"Triple-burst clockwork salvo, primed!\" Ding-Ding swung her heavy hammer, landing three titanic blows with her brute strength!\n\n*THUD! THUD! THUD!*\n\nThree timed fragmentation canisters exploded in midair, hurling a storm of white-phosphorus shrapnel that shredded the wings of the two lead manta skimmers, sending them spiraling into the sea in plumes of black smoke!\n\nYet the remaining six skimmers maintained formation, unleashing a barrage of armor-piercing rockets straight at The Aoki Gear's rudder!\n\n\"Cheng Hao! WATCH THE HELM!\" Jiang Jiang screamed, hurling himself toward the stern, his cast-iron skillet ringing with *CLANG-CLANG-CLANG* deflections as it batted away rocket fragments!\n\n\"PICO! HYDROFOIL RIOT SHIELD MODE!!\"\n\n*HUMMMMM——SHING!*\n\nPoised at the prow, PICO's alloy plates fanned outward in a tenth of a second like a peacock's tail, reassembling into a six-foot-wide, two-inch-thick **Heavy Alloy Ballistic Riot Shield** locking directly across the wheelhouse window!\n\n*BANG-BANG-BANG-BANG!*\n\nRocket shrapnel blossomed across the shield in a blinding storm of white-hot sparks, incandescent slag sliding harmlessly along flow channels into the ocean. PICO's sapphire optics burned unwavering through the inferno, refusing to yield a single inch!\n\nShielded by PICO's golden defensive window, The Aoki Gear knifed cleanly through the natural limestone archway into the sea cave of Island C!\n\nThe thick, solid basalt walls of the sea cave acted like a natural bunker, sealing the pursuing gunships' bombardment outside!\n\n---\n\n## 五、天琴座光學星盤與深海鑽艇 (V. The Lyra Optical Astrolabe and the Deep-Sea Drill Sub)\n\nPassing through the shadowy sea cave, the cavern expanded into a breathtaking sanctuary.\n\nHidden at the heart of the island lay a natural sea cenote. Luminous stalactites hung from the vaulted roof, morning light streaming down through ceiling fissures like celestial spotlights.\n\nIn the center of the tranquil pool rose an extraordinary **Ancient Lyra Observatory**, fashioned entirely from translucent white jade and solid brass gears.\n\nAnd floating in the center of the dais was a twelve-inch astrolabe core ground from pure natural amethyst—**【The Lyra Optical Astrolabe】**!\n\nSuspended upon four beams of acoustic levitation microwaves, twelve delicate clockwork hands turned in gentle synchrony with Vega in the sky above, radiating an enchanting, serene pale-violet starlight!\n\n\"We found it... The third Celestial Key!\"\n\nYe Yijie held her racing heart, tears of wonder glinting in her eyes: \"With this and the dodecahedral astrolabe, we can fully ignite the Fresnel lens of the Lost Lighthouse!\"\n\nCheng Hao stepped onto the stone stairs of the observatory, reaching out with both hands to reverently receive the floating amethyst disc.\n\nYet in the microsecond before Cheng Hao's fingers touched the astrolabe—\n\n*RUMBLE-CRASH————!!*\n\nThe tranquil pool at the base of the cenote erupted with an earth-shattering tremor that shook the entire island!\n\nThe stone floor shattered into rubble as a thirty-foot-wide black mechanical behemoth armed with six rotating diamond auger heads—**Kuroshio Heavy Industries' \"Deep-Sea Heavy Shield-Tunneling Sub Mk-IV\"**—burst from the bedrock in a geyser of mud and froth, violently smashing the lower pedestal of the observatory!\n\nThe upper hatch popped open. Holding a metal scepter crackling with high-voltage arcs, Shen Tian-Cheng appeared atop the conning tower like a phantom that refused to die!\n\nBehind him, a holographic display flashed a terrifying blood-red countdown:\n\n> `[TIME TO SEVEN SEISMIC SPIKES OVERLOAD DETONATION: 23 HOURS 59 MINUTES!]`\n\nShen Tian-Cheng straightened his necktie with aristocratic poise, a cold, triumphant sneer curling his lip:\n\n\"Heheheh... Truly a magnificent optical decryption, children.\"\n\n\"I must thank you for guiding me through the mirage and neutralizing every defensive obstacle.\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng pointed his scepter forward, eight high-pressure harpoon launchers along the sub's hull locking onto Cheng Hao upon the altar:\n\n\"Now, that Lyra Astrolabe—and every single one of you meddlesome pests... **shall be buried forever in this watery grave!**\"\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 17, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":18,"rawContent":"# 第十八章：聲納共振與夜光機械群\n\n## 一、天坑深處的死局\n\n封閉的海蝕天坑之內，空氣凝固得幾乎能滴出水來。\n\n晨曦透過頭頂百公尺高的岩洞天窗傾瀉而下，灑在中央那座純白透光的「古代天琴觀星台」上。\n\n淡紫色的【天琴座光學星盤】正靜靜懸浮在四道由高頻超聲波交織而成的透明能量柱中央，星盤內部的十二枚發條指針隨風微顫，宛如一顆沉睡在深海仙境中的紫水晶心臟。\n\n然而，這份寧靜在一瞬間被徹底撕碎！\n\n「深海重型盾構鑽艇 Mk-IV」那長達十公尺的漆黑鋼鐵艦首，如同一頭面目猙獰的鋼鐵巨獸，盤踞在水池的中央。六枚由人造金剛石熔鑄而成的巨型螺旋鑽頭，正冒著高溫摩擦的青白色青煙，滴滴答答淌著刺鼻的黑油。\n\n沈天成站在艦橋頂端，手中的高壓電弧權杖發出「劈啪」作響的刺目藍白色電光。\n\n「誠浩小朋友，我勸你最好把手縮回去。」\n\n沈天成臉上掛著貓捉老鼠般的優雅微笑，眼神卻如禿鷲般陰鷙：\n\n「這座古代觀星台利用的是深海頂級的**『聲學駐波懸浮（Acoustic Levitation）』**。星盤懸浮在駐波的零壓平衡節點上，底座裝有高靈敏度的微型自毀震盪器。只要未經音頻校準的生物體強行觸碰，懸浮場瞬間坍塌，這塊價值連城的紫水晶星盤……就會當場炸成齏粉！」\n\n「沈天成，你休想拿它去破壞地殼！」嵐握緊折疊雙刃船槳，厲聲怒喝。\n\n「破壞地殼？不不不，小姑娘，這叫『能源重組』。」沈天成冷笑著看了一眼身後屏幕上瘋狂跳動的紅色計時器：\n\n> `[距離七枚地震針全面超載引爆剩餘：23小時15分！]`\n\n「只要引爆海底地熱火山，千島海所有的古代結晶能源將會全部噴湧而出。黑潮重工將會掌控整個大洋的能源命脈！至於這片海域的島民、那所可笑的小學……誰在乎呢？」\n\n沈天成猛地舉起電弧權杖，對準了水面：「把星象儀扔過來！否則，我先用十萬伏特的高壓電把這池水變成電烤箱，再慢慢拆了你們的骨頭！」\n\n「滋滋滋——！」\n\n跳躍的電弧在水面上激盪出一道道藍色的恐怖火花！\n\n---\n\n## 二、甦醒的深海螢光機械群\n\n然而，沈天成那肆無忌憚的高壓放電，卻在一瞬間犯下了致命的大忌！\n\n「咕嚕嚕嚕嚕——！」\n\n天坑底部深達百公尺的水潭深處，突然傳來了一陣宛如巨鯨心跳般的沉悶共鳴。\n\n原本澄澈的水體，突然泛起了一圈圈令人屏息的**幽綠色與天藍色冷光**！\n\n緊接著，在所有人不可思議的注視下，成千上萬隻直徑從三十公分到兩公尺不等的**奇異發光生物**，自水下裂縫中如繁星般冉冉升起！\n\n「那是……水母？不，是機械水母！」將江瞪大了眼睛，嘴裡的半塊菠蘿麵包差點掉進水裡。\n\n那不是自然生物，而是由古代千島文明工程師所研發的深海巡衛自律生態群——**「古代夜光機械水母（Photonic Jellyfish）」**！\n\n它們的傘狀體由薄如蟬翼的半透明光電水晶打造，內部嵌著一枚枚飛速咬合的黃銅微型發條機芯；數十根長達三公尺的金屬觸手在水中輕柔飄曳，觸手末端垂掛著高純度的**冷等離子體發光球**！\n\n整座原本幽暗的天坑水池，在短短幾秒鐘內，被數萬隻機械水母點綴成了一片如夢似幻、美得令人窒息的幽藍色星海！\n\n「警告！水下遭遇高密度不明無人潛航器集群！」鑽艇內部的警報聲瘋狂響起。\n\n「這是什麼破爛玩意兒？開火驅散！」沈天成厭惡地揮了揮權杖。\n\n鑽艇側翼的兩門高壓水下聲波砲猛然開火，發出一陣刺耳無比、雜亂狂暴的高頻噪聲！\n\n「嗡————轟！」\n\n這一擊，徹底捅了馬蜂窩！\n\n被雜亂噪聲刺激的機械水母群，原本溫和的天藍色光芒，在一瞬間整齊劃一地切換成了**狂暴的猩紅血光**！\n\n數萬枚水母觸手上的等離子發光球同時劇烈過載，水池表面跳躍起成片成片的電離子火花，恐怖的電磁脈衝在岩洞中瘋狂積聚！\n\n「不要用雜亂噪聲攻擊它們！」老莫里斯的聲音突然自耳麥中焦急響起，「那是燈塔的古代清潔防衛群！它們只服從純淨的諧波共振！如果在六十秒內不能平息它們的憤怒，它們釋放的集體等離子電漿風暴，會把整個天坑融化成熔岩岩漿！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、聲學駐波與五度相生律\n\n「純淨的諧波共振！還有天琴星盤的聲學懸浮！」\n\n葉旖緁的目光在觀星台四周飛速掃視，指針迅速定格在天坑四周岩壁上矗立的**四根天然玄武岩青銅管風琴柱**上！\n\n```\n【天琴諧波共振破譯參數】：\n聲學駐波壓力平衡方程：\nΔP(z) = 2 × P₀ × sin(kz) × cos(ωt)\n懸浮波節位置：z = n × (λ / 2)\n\n天坑四根青銅共振管風琴柱長度標註：\n管柱 1：L₁ = 4.0 m\n管柱 2：L₂ = 3.0 m\n管柱 3：L₂ = 2.67 m (8/3 m)\n管柱 4：L₄ = 2.0 m\n\n聲學物理定則：\n管風琴基頻與管長成嚴格反比：f ∝ 1 / L！\n音程頻率比例法則（五度相生律 / Pythagorean Tuning）：\nf₁ : f₂ : f₃ : f₄ = (1/4) : (1/3) : (3/8) : (1/2) ＝ 6 : 8 : 9 : 12！\n對應音樂和弦純律：\n6 (Do) ➡️ 8 (Fa) ➡️ 9 (Sol) ➡️ 12 (High Do)！\n\n雙重解密目標：\n同時向四根管柱注入高壓氣流，奏響【天琴純五度和弦】！\n1. 抵消觀星台駐波，使天琴星盤安全降落；\n2. 共振頻率剛好匹配機械水母的 440 Hz 基頻通信母頻，平息暴怒並引導其定向放電！\n```\n\n「**五度相生律！天琴純五度和弦（Do - Fa - Sol - High Do）！**」\n\n葉旖緁猛地抬頭，聲音穿透了水母群噼啪作響的電弧噪聲：\n\n「誠浩！觀星台四周有四根管風琴風柱！只要用四種不同強度的氣流同時吹響它們，頻率比例達到 **6 : 8 : 9 : 12**，就能讓天琴星盤的聲學懸浮場平穩著陸，同時操控這群水母！！」\n\n「四根風柱？！我們哪有那麼多高壓氣泵？！」巴克大吼。\n\n「誰說沒有？！」誠浩的眼中燃燒著前所未有的冒險光芒，大腦飛速佈置戰術：\n\n「**一號柱（4.0 米 · Do）：** 嵐！用海鷗號的蒸汽滑行發動機尾氣管接上去！」  \n「**二號柱（3.0 米 · Fa）：** 巴克！破浪鐵錨號的艦首重型蒸汽霧角管，正好是三米長度！」  \n「**三號柱（2.67 米 · Sol）：** 將江！用你的黑鐵平底鍋扣在青木齒輪號的副鍋爐洩壓閥上，壓住蒸汽噴進第三根管子！」  \n「**四號柱（2.0 米 · High Do）：** 交給皮可！水下高速渦輪噴氣，吹響最短的第四管柱！」\n\n「聽我口令——**三、二、一，全域放氣奏樂！！**」\n\n---\n\n## 四、天琴海鳴與等離子審判\n\n「轟——嗚————！！」\n\n天坑之內，一場前所未有、融合了海盜戰艦、廚房鐵鍋、滑行艇與機械柴犬的奇蹟交響樂，在同一秒鐘震撼奏響！\n\n嵐將海鷗號的油門踩到底，滾燙的蒸汽如長龍般灌入一號青銅石柱；  \n巴克咬牙拉死海盜霧角閥門，渾厚雄壯的八十節蒸汽咆哮著衝進二號石柱；  \n將江大吼著將黑鐵平底鍋死死按在洩壓閥上，金屬震盪出高亢精準的第三聲頻；  \n皮可化作雙翼渦輪形態，萬轉超導涵道噴射出純淨的超高頻氣流，呼嘯刺入四號管柱！\n\n「咚——！！」  \n「嚀——！！」  \n「昂——！！」  \n「鈴————！！」\n\n四記宏大、悠揚、宛如天神撥動豎琴琴弦的純淨和弦，在整座封閉的石灰岩天坑內轟然共鳴！\n\n物理聲學的奇蹟在這一刻降臨！\n\n在「Do - Fa - Sol - High Do」的完美純五度諧波震盪下，天琴觀星台中央的四道超聲波懸浮光柱，波節相位在千分之一秒內被平滑抵消——\n\n「嗡……」\n\n淡紫色的【天琴座光學星盤】沒有觸發自毀，而是宛如一片輕盈的羽毛，優雅地自半空中飄落，分毫不差地穩穩落在了誠浩張開的手掌心之中！\n\n入手冰涼溫潤，十二道發條指針瞬間爆發出萬道紫金色的神聖星芒！\n\n與此同時，更震撼的一幕發生了——\n\n天坑水池中那數萬隻原本通體血紅狂暴的機械水母群，在聽見這組熟悉的古代和弦的一瞬間，全身的血光驟然熄滅，重新轉化為無比純淨溫和的**幽藍極光色**！\n\n而在這片幽藍極光的背後，這群古老的深海守衛者，齊刷刷地將觸手轉向了在水池中央製造噪音的入侵者——沈天成的黑潮盾構鑽艇！\n\n「不……不可能！你們怎麼可能控制它們？！」沈天成看著鋪天蓋地圍攏上來的數萬隻機械水母，臉色在一瞬間慘白如紙，眼珠子幾乎瞪裂！\n\n「滋啦啦啦————轟隆隆隆隆！！」\n\n數萬隻機械水母的等離子電漿球同時引爆！\n\n一道粗如水缸、完全由純淨冷等離子體構成的**億萬伏特深海電漿風暴**，化作一道璀璨奪目的雷霆巨龍，自四面八方狠狠吞噬了黑潮鑽艇！\n\n鑽艇那厚實的冷軋鎢鋼外殼在等離子體的洗禮下劇烈燃燒，六枚金剛石螺旋鑽頭當場被恐怖的電流融化熔焊成了一團廢鐵！艦橋的所有儀表盤瞬間爆出漫天火花，主動力爐轟然短路熄火！\n\n「小鬼……我絕不會放過你們的……絕不……」\n\n沈天成發出一聲撕心裂肺的絕望慘叫，整艘龐大的盾構鑽艇徹底癱瘓，冒著滾滾濃煙，向著天坑水池的深不見底處緩緩沉沒！\n\n---\n\n## 五、三匙合一與地心的悲鳴\n\n「贏啦————！！」\n\n將江舉著被燻得漆黑的平底鍋在觀星台上瘋狂蹦跳：「我們用音樂打敗了高科技鑽頭！！」\n\n丁丁一把撲上前，抱著皮可開心地打滾，皮可高興地伸出小金屬舌頭舔了舔丁丁的臉頰，電子眼閃爍著溫柔的微光。\n\n嵐拔出折疊船槳，走到誠浩身旁，看著少年手中的紫水晶星盤，由衷地讚嘆道：「這就是天琴座星盤……傳說千島齒輪海每隔三百年才會現世的神器！」\n\n此時，誠浩深吸了一口氣。\n\n他從胸前解下了那枚金色的「十二面體古代星象儀」，緩緩按進了「天琴座光學星盤」中央那處嚴絲合縫的十二邊形凹槽之中。\n\n「咔噠！」\n\n伴隨著一陣極其悅耳的金屬咬合脆響，兩件上古神器在三十年後再度合而為一！\n\n星盤內部的發條指針與星象儀的棱鏡同時飛速旋轉，一道純淨無暇的**金色超聚光星空激光柱**，自天琴星盤的頂端筆直地射向了天坑頂部的天窗裂隙，直插雲霄，如同一支刺破天際的命運之箭！\n\n透過黃銅護目鏡，誠浩在光束中看見了一組通往深海大裂谷底部的終極坐標——\n\n迷失燈塔的頂端，正是這道光芒唯一的歸宿！\n\n然而，還沒等大家品味勝利的喜悅，老莫里斯那急促欲裂的狂吼聲，突然透過通訊器炸響：\n\n> 『誠浩！快回來！沈天成在被電漿擊中前，按下了全域地震針的遠程總引爆開關！』  \n> 『第七根地震針已經徹底貫穿了地殼岩漿層！萬米大裂谷正在塌陷，整個千島海的中心正在形成一個吞沒一切的深海超巨型黑洞！』  \n> 『我和燈塔最多只能再維持最後**三小時**！』  \n> 『三個小時之內不把星盤插入菲涅耳透鏡核心……這片海域的所有島嶼，將全部化為地獄火海！！』\n\n「轟隆隆隆隆————！！」\n\n腳下的海島劇烈震顫，天坑四周的鐘乳石如雨點般轟然墜落！\n\n最後的三小時！\n\n終極的海戰與最後的營救，在咆哮的波濤中正式打響！\n\n---\n\n*(第十八章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十八章：聲納共振與夜光機械群 (Chapter 18: Sonar Resonance and the Bioluminescent Mechanoids)\n\n## 一、天坑深處的死局 (I. Deadlock Deep Within the Cenote)\n\nInside the enclosed sea cenote, the air was so dense with tension it felt on the verge of liquefying.\n\nMorning light streamed through the natural skylight hundreds of feet overhead, illuminating the pristine, translucent white \"Ancient Lyra Observatory\" at the center of the grotto.\n\nThe pale-violet 【Lyra Optical Astrolabe】 floated serenely in the center of four transparent energy pillars woven from high-frequency ultrasonic waves. Its twelve internal clockwork hands turned with delicate micro-adjustments, resembling an amethyst heart sleeping inside a deep-sea sanctuary.\n\nYet this tranquility was shattered in an instant!\n\nThe thirty-foot black steel prow of the \"Deep-Sea Heavy Shield-Tunneling Sub Mk-IV\" loomed like a primeval iron monster across the pool. Six diamond-tipped rotary augers smoked with friction heat, dripping pungent black lubricating grease into the water.\n\nShen Tian-Cheng stood atop the bridge balcony, his high-voltage arc scepter crackling with blinding blue-white sparks.\n\n\"Little Cheng Hao, I strongly advise you to draw your hand back.\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng smiled with feline grace, though his gaze was as predatory as a circling vulture:\n\n\"This ancient observatory utilizes the pinnacle of **'Acoustic Levitation'**. The astrolabe floats upon the zero-pressure nodes of standing waves, its base wired to hyper-sensitive self-destruct oscillators. If an uncalibrated biological entity touches it, the field collapses in a millisecond, pulverizing that priceless crystal astrolabe into dust!\"\n\n\"Shen Tian-Cheng, you will never use it to destroy the tectonic fault!\" Lan tightened her grip on her folding oar, barking with fiery indignation.\n\n\"Destroy the fault? No, no, my dear girl. We call it 'Energy Restructuring'.\" Shen Tian-Cheng glanced back at the flashing crimson timer behind him with a cold laugh:\n\n> `[TIME TO SEVEN SEISMIC SPIKES OVERLOAD DETONATION: 23 HOURS 15 MINUTES!]`\n\n\"Once the volcanic geothermal energy detonates, every drop of ancient crystallized power across the Gear Sea will erupt to the surface! Kuroshio Heavy Industries will monopolize the energy lifeblood of the entire ocean! As for the savages of these atolls and that quaint little school... who could possibly care?\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng leveled his arc scepter squarely at the pool: \"Toss the astrolabe over! Or I turn this pool into an electric furnace with a hundred thousand volts and snap your bones one by one!\"\n\n*ZZZZZZZZ——!*\n\nArcing lightning danced across the water, setting off terrifying blue sparks!\n\n---\n\n## 二、甦醒的深海螢光機械群 (II. Awakening of the Bioluminescent Mechanoids)\n\nYet Shen Tian-Cheng's reckless high-voltage discharge committed a fatal, unforgivable mistake!\n\n*GLUG-GLUG-GLUG——!*\n\nFrom the hundred-foot depths of the cenote pool, a subterranean resonance echoed like the heartbeat of a great whale.\n\nThe crystal-clear water erupted with rippling, breathtaking rings of **emerald and sky-blue cold light**!\n\nThen, before everyone's astonished eyes, tens of thousands of **luminescent creatures** ranging from one to six feet in diameter rose like a field of floating stars from the underwater fissures!\n\n\"Are those... jellyfish? No, they're mechanical jellyfish!\" Jiang Jiang gasped, his half-eaten pineapple bun nearly slipping into the drink.\n\nThey were no natural fauna; they were an autonomous deep-sea sentinel ecosystem engineered by the ancient Thousand-Island civilization—**\"Ancient Photonic Mechanoid Jellyfish\"**!\n\nTheir umbrella bells were sculpted from gossamer-thin photoelectric crystals, housing rapidly meshing miniature brass clockwork movements; dozens of ten-foot metallic tentacles swayed with graceful majesty through the water, tipped with glowing spheres of **pure cold plasma**!\n\nWithin seconds, the dim grotto was transformed by tens of thousands of mechanical jellyfish into a dazzling, ethereal sea of cerulean stars!\n\n\"Warning! High-density unidentified autonomous underwater vehicle swarm detected!\" alarms wailed inside the drill sub.\n\n\"What is this scrap iron? Fire acoustic cannons to disperse them!\" Shen Tian-Cheng waved his scepter in disgust.\n\nDual high-pressure sonic disruptor cannons along the sub's flanks fired simultaneously, unleashing a grating, discordant blast of chaotic high-frequency noise!\n\n*SCREEECH——BOOM!*\n\nThat blast stirred a hornets' nest!\n\nStimulated by the discordant noise, the serene sky-blue glow of the mechanical jellyfish flipped in a single synchronized millisecond into **raging, bloodthirsty crimson**!\n\nPlasma spheres across tens of thousands of tentacles overloaded violently, sheets of ionization sparks dancing across the pool as a catastrophic electromagnetic pulse built within the cavern!\n\n\"Do not attack them with discordant noise!\" Old Morris's voice crackled frantically through the comms. \"Those are the lighthouse's ancient purger sentinels! They obey ONLY pure harmonic resonance! If their fury is not pacified within sixty seconds, their collective plasma storm will melt the entire cenote into molten slag!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、聲學駐波與五度相生律 (III. Acoustic Standing Waves and Pythagorean Tuning)\n\n\"Pure harmonic resonance! And the astrolabe's acoustic levitation!\"\n\nYe Yijie's gaze swept across the observatory, locking instantly onto **four natural basalt-and-bronze pipe organ columns** rising along the cavern walls!\n\n```\n[LYRA HARMONIC RESONANCE DECRYPTION DATA]:\nAcoustic Standing Wave Pressure Balance Equation:\nΔP(z) = 2 × P₀ × sin(kz) × cos(ωt)\nLevitation Node Position: z = n × (λ / 2)\n\nCavern Bronze Resonant Pipe Organ Lengths:\nPipe 1: L₁ = 4.0 m\nPipe 2: L₂ = 3.0 m\nPipe 3: L₃ = 2.67 m (8/3 m)\nPipe 4: L₄ = 2.0 m\n\nAcoustic Physical Law:\nOrgan fundamental frequency is inversely proportional to pipe length: f ∝ 1 / L!\nPythagorean Tuning Interval Law:\nf₁ : f₂ : f₃ : f₄ = (1/4) : (1/3) : (3/8) : (1/2) = 6 : 8 : 9 : 12!\nCorresponding Just Intonation Chord:\n6 (Do) ➡️ 8 (Fa) ➡️ 9 (Sol) ➡️ 12 (High Do)!\n\nDual Decryption Mission:\nSimultaneously inject high-pressure airflow into all four pipes\nto play the 【Lyra Perfect Fifth Chord】!\n1. Neutralize the observatory standing wave, allowing the astrolabe to descend safely;\n2. Match the 440 Hz fundamental carrier frequency of the jellyfish swarm,\n   pacifying their wrath and directing their discharge!\n```\n\n\"**PYTHAGOREAN TUNING! THE LYRA PERFECT FIFTH CHORD (Do - Fa - Sol - High Do)!**\"\n\nYe Yijie looked up, her voice slicing clean through the crackling arcing of the jellyfish:\n\n\"Cheng Hao! There are four organ pipes surrounding the altar! If we blow high-pressure airflow through all four simultaneously at a frequency ratio of **6 : 8 : 9 : 12**, we can safely ground the astrolabe's levitation field AND command the jellyfish swarm!!\"\n\n\"Four organ pipes?! Where do we find four high-pressure air pumps?!\" Buck roared.\n\n\"Who said we don't have them?!\" The fires of bold adventure blazed in Cheng Hao's eyes as he laid out the battle plan:\n\n\"**Pipe 1 (4.0m · Do):** Lan! Jam the exhaust of the Seagull's steam engine onto it!\"  \n\"**Pipe 2 (3.0m · Fa):** Buck! The fog horn on the Iron Anchor's bow is exactly three meters long!\"  \n\"**Pipe 3 (2.67m · Sol):** Jiang Jiang! Clamp your cast-iron skillet over The Aoki Gear's boiler relief valve and duct the steam into the third pipe!\"  \n\"**Pipe 4 (2.0m · High Do):** PICO handles it! Superconducting turbine blast into the shortest pipe!\"\n\n\"On my count——**THREE, TWO, ONE, UNLEASH STEAM AND PLAY!!**\"\n\n---\n\n## 四、天琴海鳴與等離子審判 (IV. The Lyra Sea-Chime and Plasma Judgment)\n\n*VROOOOOM——TOOOOT————!!*\n\nInside the cenote, an unprecedented, magnificent symphony blending pirate warship steam, a kitchen skillet, a sea skimmer, and a mechanical Shiba Inu resonated in glorious unison!\n\nLan floored the Seagull's throttle, channeling superheated steam like an azure dragon into Pipe 1;  \nBuck hauled back the fog horn valve, eighty knots of booming steam thundering into Pipe 2;  \nJiang Jiang roared as he pressed his cast-iron skillet onto the relief valve, the vibrating metal tuning the third frequency;  \nPICO transformed into dual-turbine flight mode, screaming ten thousand RPMs of ultrasonic blast into Pipe 4!\n\n*DONG——!!*  \n*CHIME——!!*  \n*AUM——!!*  \n*RING————!!*\n\nFour majestic, transcendent notes—like gods strumming celestial harp strings—boomed through the enclosed limestone cenote!\n\nThe marvel of acoustic physics manifested in that glorious heartbeat!\n\nUnder the harmonic resonance of \"Do - Fa - Sol - High Do,\" the node phases of the four ultrasonic levitation pillars canceled each other out with mathematical perfection—\n\n*Hum...*\n\nWithout triggering self-destruct, the pale-violet 【Lyra Optical Astrolabe】 drifted down like an autumn leaf, descending with pinpoint grace straight into Cheng Hao's open palm!\n\nCool and smooth to the touch, its twelve internal clockwork hands flared with radiant violet-gold starlight!\n\nSimultaneously, a scene of awe-inspiring grandeur unfolded—\n\nUpon hearing that sacred ancient chord, the blood-red frenzy consuming the tens of thousands of mechanical jellyfish dissolved instantly, shifting back into serene, pure **aurora cerulean**!\n\nAnd guided by that cerulean dawn, the ancient ocean sentinels swiveled their tentacles in unison toward the noise-polluting intruder at the center of the pool—Shen Tian-Cheng's shield drill sub!\n\n\"N-No... IMPOSSIBLE! How could you possibly command them?!\" Shen Tian-Cheng shrieked, face draining to chalk as the horizon of luminescent jellyfish converged upon him!\n\n*ZZZZZZZZ————BOOOOOOOOOM!!*\n\nThe plasma spheres of tens of thousands of jellyfish detonated simultaneously!\n\nA colossal, swirling **billion-volt deep-sea plasma vortex**—thick as a fortress tower—surged forth like an incandescent lightning dragon, engulfing the Kuroshio drill sub!\n\nThe heavy tungsten-steel hull burned white-hot under the plasma torrent, the six diamond drill bits melting into slag within seconds! Every instrument across the bridge exploded in sparks as the primary reactor suffered a catastrophic short-circuit shutdown!\n\n\"Brat... I will never forgive you... NEVER...\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng unleashed a desperate, curdling howl as the paralyzed drill sub, belching black smoke, sank into the bottomless depths of the cenote pool!\n\n---\n\n## 五、三匙合一與地心的悲鳴 (V. Three Keys As One and the Earth's Agony)\n\n\"WE WON————!!\"\n\nJiang Jiang danced across the observatory, waving his scorched skillet: \"We defeated a high-tech drill with music!!\"\n\nDing-Ding tumbled across the platform with PICO in her arms, while PICO happily licked her cheek with its cold alloy tongue, its electronic optics blinking with affection.\n\nLan sheathed her oar and stepped to Cheng Hao's side, gazing at the amethyst disc in the boy's hand with heartfelt awe: \"So this is the Lyra Astrolabe... The fabled treasure that surfaces in the Gear Sea once every three hundred years!\"\n\nCheng Hao took a deep, steady breath.\n\nUnclasping the golden \"Dodecahedral Ancient Astrolabe\" from his chest, he seated it firmly into the dodecagonal receptacle at the center of the \"Lyra Optical Astrolabe.\"\n\n*CLACK!*\n\nWith a resonant, crystal-clear mechanical chime, the two ancient relics merged as one after thirty long years!\n\nThe clockwork hands and crystal prisms spun in harmonious frenzy, projecting a pure, dazzling **golden celestial laser beam** straight through the ceiling skylight, spearing into the clouds like a javelin of destiny!\n\nThrough his Ghost Goggles, Cheng Hao saw the final navigational vector pointing toward the bottom of the Abyssal Rift—\n\nThe pinnacle of the Lost Lighthouse was the sole destination for this celestial light!\n\nYet before they could celebrate, Old Morris's panicked roar tore through the comms:\n\n> *\"Cheng Hao! GET BACK HERE NOW! Before the sub sank, Shen Tian-Cheng hit the remote master trigger for all seismic spikes!\"*  \n> *\"The seventh spike has pierced the mantle magma reservoir! The ten-thousand-meter rift is collapsing, opening a supermassive oceanic black hole at the center of the Gear Sea!\"*  \n> *\"The lighthouse and I can hold the barrier for **three hours** at most!\"*  \n> *\"If the merged astrolabe is not slotted into the Fresnel lens core within three hours... every island across this sea will be consumed by a volcanic apocalypse!!\"*\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE————!!*\n\nThe island beneath their feet convulsed violently, stalactites raining down like stone hail!\n\nThe final three hours!\n\nThe ultimate ocean battle and the race to save Grandpa had officially begun!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 18, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":19,"rawContent":"# 第十九章：登上迷失燈塔！\n\n## 一、沸騰大洋的生死衝刺\n\n天琴礁島的外海，海面已經不再是平靜的水銀，而是沸騰的深紅煉獄！\n\n海底數千公尺處地熱熔岩的劇烈上湧，讓海面上噴發出一道道高達數十公尺的高溫硫磺熱泉。空氣中瀰漫著濃烈的燃燒瓦斯與刺鼻的臭氧，海面上漂浮著一層厚厚滾燙的浮石灰燼。\n\n「轟隆隆隆————！」\n\n遠方的海平面上，一圈巨大的環形下陷深淵，如同一隻張開在地表上的深海巨口，正以肉眼可見的速度將周圍數十公里的海水瘋狂吞入地心！\n\n「海嘯前兆！那是地殼塌陷引發的**『深海超級黑洞』**！」\n\n嵐雙手死死抓住青木齒輪號的舵輪，小麥色的手臂上青筋暴突。海鷗號已經被固定在戰艦側舷，她迎著撲面而來的滾燙水汽狂喊：\n\n「整片千島齒輪海的潮汐系統已經全面崩潰！距離超級海嘯爆發……只剩下最後**兩小時四十五分**！」\n\n「嗡————！」\n\n就在這時，誠浩手中緊握的「十二面體星象儀」與「天琴座光學星盤」合體神器，突然在黃昏的天幕下爆發出一道直徑半公尺粗的純金色彩虹光柱！\n\n這道凝聚了古代星穹力量的激光束，穿透了海面上翻滾的濃煙與毒霧，如同一條指引命運的金色鎖鏈，筆直地射向了十公里外那座隱沒在大裂谷深淵之中的青銅迷失燈塔！\n\n「看！那是爺爺留下的光學引航道！」誠浩指著海面上被激光劈開的一道平靜水路大喊，「順著光束衝過去！」\n\n「嗚————嘟————！！」\n\n然而，就在青木齒輪號準備全速俯衝的同一秒，右側的火光中，黑潮重工那艘兩百公尺長的終極母艦「利維坦零號」，正調轉黑洞洞的十二具超空泡重型魚雷發射管，以泰山壓頂之勢封鎖了裂谷入口！\n\n「鎖定目標！全彈幕集火，把裂谷入口徹底炸塌！」沈天成冰冷殘暴的聲音在公海廣播頻道中咆哮！\n\n「巴克！小心左側魚雷！」將江舉著望遠鏡驚聲尖叫。\n\n「老子看見了！！」\n\n只見破浪鐵錨號那龐大粗糙的黑鐵艦身，竟然在這一瞬間毫無畏懼地迎著十二枚魚雷的彈道，全速橫切到了青木齒輪號的前方！\n\n巴克船長站在高聳的艦首，身上的海軍大衣被烈火點燃了一角，但他那張滿是黑灰的臉上，卻綻放出一抹狂傲不羈的大笑：\n\n「誠浩！少看扁我們千島海盜的骨氣！拯救世界是你們名門正派的事，但守住這座海門……是老子鐵錨幫的特權！」\n\n「丁丁！把所有的發條水雷全給老子撒出去！給青木齒輪號爭取時間！！」\n\n「發條全彈齊發！！」十歲的小蘿莉丁丁掄起大鐵鎚，滿臉淚水卻無比剛毅地一錘砸爛了整排連環引爆閥門！\n\n「轟！轟！轟！轟！」\n\n破浪鐵錨號以粉身碎骨的勇氣，在利維坦零號的魚雷群正前方引爆了一道長達數百公尺的衝天水下火牆，將所有的魚雷硬生生在半空中攔截殉爆！\n\n「衝進去！誠浩！別回頭看老子！把老莫里斯和誠老爺子完好無損地帶回來！！」\n\n巴克嘶聲力竭的咆哮聲，伴隨著鐵錨號反擊的滾滾砲聲，被海浪永遠拋在了身後。\n\n誠浩眼眶通紅，指節泛白，對著通話管狂吼：「嵐！滿舵前進！衝進裂谷深淵！！」\n\n---\n\n## 二、重返迷失燈塔\n\n「呼————撲通！！」\n\n青木齒輪號順著激光導引的航道，以四十五度的極限角度俯衝扎進了深海裂谷之中。\n\n深海的水溫與壓力在一瞬間飆升。\n\n當船身穿過燈塔外廊厚重的水門、重重停泊在燈塔八十公尺高的懸空停機坪上時，整座青銅塔身正伴隨著地底傳來的沉悶震動劇烈搖晃。\n\n老莫里斯早已等候在停機坪邊緣。老人的額頭上包紮著厚厚的紗布，手裡提著四套高溫地熱防護服與重型深潛呼吸面罩：\n\n「你們做到了！天琴星盤拿到了？！」\n\n「在這裡！」誠浩將合體的神器捧到老莫里斯眼前。\n\n「太好了……快跟我來頂層控制台！」莫里斯大口喘著氣，領著眾人飛速衝進了八十公尺高空的水晶大廳：\n\n「遠山在三千公尺地心留下的能量護盾，必須依賴這座燈塔頂部的『菲涅耳大透鏡』進行光子激勵！黑潮剛才的震動震偏了透鏡的共焦光軸，如果不把透鏡重新校準，星盤的光束就無法穿透三千公尺的地殼岩層！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、菲涅耳共焦聚焦與幾何光學\n\n眾人踏入頂層大廳。\n\n那座直徑達十公尺、由數千片水晶稜鏡環形咬合而成的巨型「菲涅耳主透鏡」，正靜靜矗立在中央。而在主透鏡的後方，是一面由沉重黃銅齒輪架托舉著的「副校準凹面準直鏡」。\n\n此時，兩組透鏡的光軸嚴重偏離，原本應該匯聚成一束的光線，在天花板上散射成了一團混亂刺目的光斑。\n\n「幾何光學共焦聚焦（Confocal Collimation）！」\n\n葉旖緁一邊迅速套上防護服，一邊推動著海圖桌上的光學計算機：\n\n```\n【菲涅耳激光準直幾何光學方程】：\n薄透鏡成像公式：\n1 / f = 1 / d_o + 1 / d_i\n無限平行激光束條件（直貫地心三千公尺不發散）：\n像距 d_i ➡️ ∞，即 1 / d_i ＝ 0！\n\n複合透鏡系統參數：\n主菲涅耳水晶透鏡焦距：f₁ = +6.0 m（凸透鏡，會聚）\n副金屬校準鏡焦距：f₂ = -2.0 m（凹透鏡，發散）\n\n共焦無窮遠準直間距定理：\n兩透鏡共軸且後焦點重合時，射出光束為完全平行光束！\n共焦標準間距 d = f₁ + f₂ = 6.0 + (-2.0) = 4.0 m！\n\n【齒輪軌道調節參數】：\n當前導軌指針間距：d_curr = 2.5 m\n需位移距離：Δd = 4.0 - 2.5 = +1.5 m（向後拉伸）\n調節手輪傳動比：每搖動手輪整整一圈，導軌位移 0.5 m！\n所需精確旋轉圈數：1.5 / 0.5 = 3 圈！\n```\n\n「**共焦間距四公尺！手輪搖動整整三圈！**」\n\n旖緁大聲吶喊：「主凸透鏡焦距六米，副凹鏡焦距負兩米！只有當兩者相距剛好四米時，光線才會被壓縮成一束直徑只有十公分、強度提升一萬倍的**超級平行激光**，直貫三千公尺地心！」\n\n「四米導軌！三整圈！」\n\n誠浩、嵐、將江三人同時撲向導軌下方的重型黃銅手搖搖把！\n\n「一、二……推！！」\n\n齒輪在乾涸的機油中發出沉重的「喀啦啦」旋轉聲。\n\n「一圈……一米！」將江咬緊牙關，滿臉通紅。  \n「兩圈……一米五！」嵐的小麥色手臂青筋暴起。  \n「最後半圈……三圈卡死！！」誠浩一聲怒吼，將限位插銷「當」的一聲狠狠拍進了黃銅刻度槽內！\n\n「咔噠！」\n\n副凹鏡在四公尺共焦點上精準鎖定！\n\n---\n\n## 四、神聖光束與三千米地心升降機\n\n「誠浩！插入星盤！！」老莫里斯大吼。\n\n誠浩捧起合體的星盤，對準菲涅耳透鏡正中央那處散發著幽藍光暈的基座，狠狠壓了下去！\n\n「嗡————轟！！」\n\n整座八十公尺高的迷失燈塔，在這一微秒內爆發出了一聲宛如遠古巨鐘撞響般的純淨長鳴！\n\n數千片水晶稜鏡同時折射出億萬道刺目耀眼的金色光華，在四公尺共焦光軸的約束下，漫天散射的光斑在零點一秒內被暴力壓縮成了一道僅有手腕粗細、亮度卻宛如一千個太陽同時綻放的**「終極金色相干激光束」**！\n\n「轟！」\n\n這道金色光束帶著無可匹敵的穿透力，自燈塔頂端筆直向下轟出，穿透了八十公尺高的中空立體齒輪豎井，如同一柄神明的天罰之劍，狠狠貫穿了燈塔大理石基座中央那處深不見底的玄武岩深孔！\n\n下一秒，大廳中央那塊原本堅固的地板，突然伴隨著一陣劇烈的液壓排氣聲緩緩下陷——\n\n一座直徑達五公尺、四周包覆著十公分厚重型防熱鈦合金裝甲的圓形升降平台——**「三千米地心升降機（Geothermal Depth Elevator）」**，帶著沉悶的機械轟鳴，自地底緩緩升起！\n\n「這部升降機直通地熱大廳！」老莫里斯一把拉開防爆艙門，將四個孩子推進艙內，「快進去！」\n\n---\n\n## 五、莫里斯的抉擇：斷後死鬥\n\n然而，就在升降機門即將閉合的剎那——\n\n「砰！嘩啦啦啦——！」\n\n燈塔頂部厚達十公分的耐壓水晶觀測穹頂，突然被一記巨大的高爆聚能穿甲彈硬生生炸裂成漫天飛濺的晶瑩碎片！\n\n十二根黑色的高壓抓鉤鋼纜自廢墟中呼嘯射入，牢牢釘死在大廳的梁柱上！\n\n只見沈天成身穿一件泛著冰冷金屬光澤的外骨骼動力裝甲，手持電弧權杖，帶著八名全副武裝、手握高頻等離子切割刀的黑潮生化突擊兵，宛如一群地獄惡鬼，自破碎的穹頂索降而下！\n\n沈天成那張原本斯文的臉上布滿了猙獰扭曲的刀痕，眼神瘋狂至極：\n\n「哈哈哈……小雜種們！多虧你們替我啟動了透鏡，打開了通往地心的升降機！」\n\n「沈董事長，你的對手是我！！」\n\n一聲雄渾無比的怒吼在大廳中炸響！\n\n只見白鬍子老莫里斯猛地抓起一把重達三十公斤的重型磁暴干擾扳手，以泰山壓頂之勢狠狠橫掃而出，一記重擊當場將兩名衝在最前方的生化兵砸得吐血倒飛！\n\n隨後，老莫里斯猛地用肩膀撞上了升降機外的全封閉重型防爆安全閥，一把將升降機的艙門死死鎖定！\n\n「莫里斯爺爺！！」嵐撲在厚重的防彈觀察窗前，淚流滿面地拼命拍打著玻璃。\n\n「嵐丫頭！誠浩！聽我說！」\n\n老莫里斯背靠著升降機門，擦掉嘴角溢出的鮮血，回頭隔著玻璃對著孩子們露出了三十年來最欣慰、最豪邁的燦爛笑容：\n\n「三十年前，我和遠山、邱校長約定過……這座燈塔，由我來守護！」\n\n「你們的戰場在下面！去救遠山！去拔掉那七根該死的地震針！！」\n\n「莫里斯爺爺！！不要啊！！」誠浩拼命砸著艙門。\n\n老莫里斯沒有再回頭，他一把扯斷了升降機頂部的主控信號線，右手死死拉下了那根刻著骷髏標記的**「緊急極限俯衝下墜桿」**！\n\n「地心大門——給我開！！」\n\n「轟隆隆隆————！！」\n\n沉重無比的鈦合金升降機，在重力加速與超導磁懸浮的雙重推動下，如同一顆脫膛而出的流星，帶著撕裂耳膜的狂暴風嘯，朝著黑暗無底的三千公尺深海地心斷裂層，轟然向下極速墜落！\n\n在觀察窗最後的視野裡，老莫里斯揮舞著巨大的扳手，與狂暴撲上來的黑潮士兵戰作一團，金色的光華與刺目的電弧在大廳內轟然引爆……\n\n升降機儀表盤上的速度指針瘋狂飆升：\n\n> `[當前下墜速度：-55 m/s！]`  \n> `[深度：-500m……-1200m……-2400m……]`  \n> `[距離地熱熔岩大廳剩餘：600米！]`  \n> `[距第七地震針引爆超級海嘯剩餘：1小時45分！]`\n\n地心終極決戰，拉開帷幕！\n\n---\n\n*(第十九章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第十九章：登上迷失燈塔！ (Chapter 19: Boarding the Lost Lighthouse!)\n\n## 一、沸騰大洋的生死衝刺 (I. Life-or-Death Dash Across Boiling Seas)\n\nBeyond the waters of Lyra Reef Atoll, the sea was no longer placid mercury—it had transformed into a boiling, crimson inferno!\n\nTectonic magma surging from miles beneath the seabed spewed columns of superheated sulfurous geysers dozens of meters into the air. The atmosphere reeked of combusting gases and acrid ozone, while a thick crust of scalding pumice ash floated across the swells.\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE————!!*\n\nAlong the distant horizon, a colossal ring of sinking oceanic abyss—gaping like a subterranean maw upon the planet's crust—was swallowing millions of gallons of seawater into the mantle at terrifying speed!\n\n\"Tsunami harbinger! That's the **'Abyssal Oceanic Black Hole'** created by tectonic subsidence!\"\n\nLan gripped the helm of The Aoki Gear with both hands, muscles tensed along her sun-tanned arms. With the Seagull lashed securely to the starboard flank, she shouted against the scalding gale:\n\n\"The tidal balance of the entire Gear Sea has completely collapsed! The megatsunami will strike in... exactly **two hours and forty-five minutes**!\"\n\n*HUMMMMMM——!*\n\nAt that moment, the combined relic of the \"Dodecahedral Astrolabe\" and the \"Lyra Optical Astrolabe\" clutched in Cheng Hao's hands erupted with a two-foot-thick beam of pure, iridescent golden light!\n\nThis beam—imbued with ancient celestial energy—pierced through the churning smoke and volcanic toxins like a golden chain of destiny, spearing straight toward the bronze silhouette of the Lost Lighthouse six miles away in the rift!\n\n\"Look! Grandpa's optical navigation vector!\" Cheng Hao shouted, pointing to a serene channel of water cleaved open by the beam. \"Ride the light straight through!\"\n\n*HOOOOONK————BLARE————!!*\n\nYet the second The Aoki Gear lined up her dive, the six-hundred-foot dreadnought \"Leviathan-0\" swung twelve supercavitating heavy torpedo tubes around, blockading the rift canyon with crushing industrial menace!\n\n\"Target locked! All tubes salvo fire—collapse the canyon entrance and bury them!\" Shen Tian-Cheng's merciless voice barked through the open maritime frequency!\n\n\"Buck! WATCH STARBOARD TORPEDOES!\" Jiang Jiang screamed through his binoculars.\n\n\"I SEE 'EM!!\"\n\nThe scarred iron prow of the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor cut fearlessly across the twelve incoming torpedo tracks, interposing her entire hull directly before The Aoki Gear!\n\nCaptain Buck stood atop his forecastle, coat tails catching fire from stray sparks, yet his soot-blackened face broke into a wild, untamed grin:\n\n\"Cheng Hao! Don't you dare look down on the backbone of Thousand-Island pirates! Saving the world is for you righteous scholars, but holding this sea gate... is the sacred privilege of the Iron Anchor Gang!\"\n\n\"Ding-Ding! DUMP EVERY CLOCKWORK MINE OVERBOARD! BUY THE AOKI GEAR HER SHOT!!\"\n\n\"CLOCKWORK MINES AWAY!!\" Ten-year-old Ding-Ding swung her heavy sledgehammer with tears streaming down her soot-streaked cheeks, smashing the salvo detonation rack with unbreakable grit!\n\n*BOOM! BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!*\n\nWith breathtaking valor, the Wave-Breaker Iron Anchor detonated a thousand-foot wall of underwater fire right before Leviathan-0's torpedo salvo, triggering a cataclysmic sympathetic detonation mid-swell!\n\n\"PUNCH THROUGH, CHENG HAO! DON'T LOOK BACK AT ME! BRING OLD MORRIS AND GRANDPA CHENG BACK IN ONE PIECE!!\"\n\nBuck's hoarse roar, accompanied by the thunder of the Iron Anchor's return fire, was swallowed by the churning sea behind them.\n\nWith tears stinging his eyes and knuckles turning white, Cheng Hao barked into the speaking tube: \"Lan! MAXIMUM REVS! DIVE INTO THE RIFT!!\"\n\n---\n\n## 二、重返迷失燈塔 (II. Returning to the Lost Lighthouse)\n\n*SPLAAASH——WHOOOOSH!!*\n\nGuided by the celestial laser vector, The Aoki Gear plunged down into the Abyssal Rift at a suicidal forty-five-degree angle.\n\nAmbient water temperature and hydrostatic pressure skyrocketed in an instant.\n\nBursting through the heavy hydraulic blast doors of the lighthouse perimeter, the vessel berthed heavily upon the suspended cantilever pad two hundred and sixty feet above the seabed, the entire bronze sentinel shaking from tremors beneath the crust.\n\nOld Morris stood waiting at the gantry edge, his forehead wrapped in thick bandages, carrying four high-temperature thermal environmental suits and heavy diving masks:\n\n\"You made it! Did you secure the Lyra Astrolabe?!\"\n\n\"Right here!\" Cheng Hao presented the merged relics to Old Morris.\n\n\"Praise the stars... Follow me to the pinnacle console!\" Panting heavily, Morris led the youth sprinting into the crystalline rotunda atop the tower:\n\n\"The energy shield Yuan-Shan anchored three thousand meters below requires photonic stimulation from this pinnacle **Fresnel Lens**! Kuroshio's artillery fire knocked the lens off its confocal optical axis! If we don't recalibrate it now, the astrolabe's beam cannot penetrate the mantle crust!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、菲涅耳共焦聚焦與幾何光學 (III. Fresnel Confocal Collimation and Geometric Optics)\n\nThe team stormed into the pinnacle chamber.\n\nThe colossal thirty-foot \"Master Fresnel Lens,\" composed of thousands of concentric crystal prisms, stood at the center. Directly behind it, mounted upon heavy brass gear carriages, rested the \"Auxiliary Collimating Concave Mirror.\"\n\nCurrently, the optical axes of the two units were severely misaligned, scattering what should have been a tight pencil beam into a blinding, chaotic glare across the vaulted rafters.\n\n\"Confocal Collimation Geometric Optics!\"\n\nYijie slipped into her thermal suit, dialing parameters into the optical calculator upon the desk:\n\n```\n[FRESNEL LASER COLLIMATION GEOMETRIC OPTICS EQUATIONS]:\nThin Lens Imaging Formula:\n1 / f = 1 / d_o + 1 / d_i\nInfinite Parallel Laser Condition (Piercing 3000m of mantle without divergence):\nImage distance d_i ➡️ ∞, thus 1 / d_i = 0!\n\nCompound Optical System Parameters:\nMaster Fresnel Convex Crystal Lens Focal Length: f₁ = +6.0 m (converging)\nAuxiliary Metal Concave Mirror Focal Length: f₂ = -2.0 m (diverging)\n\nConfocal Infinity Collimation Separation Law:\nWhen two lenses share an optical axis with coincident focal points,\nthe emitted beam becomes perfectly parallel!\nConfocal Standard Distance d = f₁ + f₂ = 6.0 + (-2.0) = 4.0 m!\n\n[GEAR TRACK ADJUSTMENT PARAMETERS]:\nCurrent vernier track spacing: d_curr = 2.5 m\nRequired displacement: Δd = 4.0 - 2.5 = +1.5 m (extend backward)\nHandwheel Gear Ratio: 1 full rotation moves carriage by 0.5 m!\nPrecise turns required: 1.5 / 0.5 = exactly 3 turns!\n```\n\n\"**CONFOCAL SEPARATION: FOUR METERS! CRANK THE HANDWHEEL THREE FULL TURNS!**\"\n\nYijie cried out: \"Master convex focal length is plus six meters; auxiliary concave is minus two! Only when separated by exactly four meters will the beam be compressed into a four-inch **Super-Coherent Parallel Laser** intensified ten thousand times, spearing clean through three thousand meters of solid rock!\"\n\n\"Four-meter rail! Three full revolutions!\"\n\nCheng Hao, Lan, and Jiang Jiang threw their combined weight onto the heavy brass crank handles beneath the rail!\n\n\"One, two... HEAVE!!\"\n\nThe gears groaned against dry lubricant with heavy *clatter-clack* revolutions.\n\n\"One turn... one meter!\" Jiang Jiang strained, face crimson.  \n\"Two turns... one point five!\" Lan's arms bulged with effort.  \n\"Final half-turn... THREE TURNS LOCKED!!\" Cheng Hao bellowed, driving the locking detent pin home with a heavy *CLANG*!\n\n*CLACK!*\n\nThe concave mirror locked onto the four-meter confocal mark with pinpoint precision!\n\n---\n\n## 四、神聖光束與三千米地心升降機 (IV. The Celestial Beam and the 3000-Meter Depth Elevator)\n\n\"Cheng Hao! INSERT THE ASTROLABE!!\" Old Morris bellowed.\n\nHolding the merged relic with both hands, Cheng Hao drove it firmly into the cerulean-glowing receptacle at the heart of the Fresnel lens!\n\n*HUMMMMMM——BOOOOOM!!*\n\nThe two-hundred-and-sixty-foot Lost Lighthouse resonated with a majestic, crystalline bell chime that shook the abyss!\n\nThousands of crystal facets refracted blinding streams of golden fire. Constrained by the four-meter confocal axis, the scattered light was violently focused into a wrist-thick **Ultimate Golden Coherent Laser Beam** burning with the brilliance of a thousand suns!\n\n*BOOM!*\n\nWith unstoppable penetrating velocity, the golden lance speared straight down from the lantern room, knifing through the vertical clockwork labyrinth like a god's javelin, plunging into the bottomless basalt shaft at the center of the lighthouse floor!\n\nA heartbeat later, the floorboards of the rotunda began descending smoothly amidst a tremendous hiss of hydraulic pressure—\n\nA sixteen-foot circular elevator platform armored in four-inch thermal titanium plates—the **Geothermal Depth Elevator**—rose from the floor with heavy industrial clatter!\n\n\"This elevator descends straight to the Geothermal Hall!\" Old Morris hauled open the blast hatch, shoving the four children inside: \"GET IN!\"\n\n---\n\n## 五、莫里斯的抉擇：斷後死鬥 (V. Morris's Choice: Rearguard to the Death)\n\nYet in the split second before the hatch could seal—\n\n*CRASH! SHATTER——!!*\n\nThe four-inch pressure crystal dome of the lantern room was blasted inward into a blizzard of razor shards by an armor-piercing high-explosive shaped charge!\n\nA dozen black high-tension grappling cables anchored violently into the rafters!\n\nExoskeleton armor gleaming, arc scepter in hand, Shen Tian-Cheng descended through the shattered roof flanked by eight cybernetic shock troopers armed with plasma cutting blades!\n\nShen Tian-Cheng's cultured face was twisted with savage scars, his eyes burning with rabid madness:\n\n\"Hahaha... Little vermin! Thank you for firing up the lens and unlocking the elevator for me!\"\n\n\"SHEN TIAN-CHENG! YOUR OPPONENT IS ME!!\"\n\nA roar of righteous fury shook the rotunda!\n\nSnow-bearded Old Morris hoisted a seventy-pound heavy magnetic storm wrench, swinging it like an avalanche, hurling the two frontline cyborg troopers backward in a spray of oil and blood!\n\nThen, slamming his shoulder into the external blast interlock, Old Morris locked the elevator doors solid from the outside!\n\n\"GRANDPA MORRIS!!\" Lan threw herself against the observation glass, pounding against the pane in tears.\n\n\"Lan! Cheng Hao! Listen to me!\"\n\nBracing his back against the elevator door, Old Morris wiped blood from his lip. Looking through the glass at the children, his face broke into the most proud, radiant smile of his thirty years:\n\n\"Thirty years ago, Yuan-Shan, Chiu, and I made a vow... This lighthouse is MY post to hold!\"\n\n\"Your battlefield is below! Save Yuan-Shan! Tear out those seven damnable seismic spikes!!\"\n\n\"GRANDPA MORRIS!! NOOOO!!\" Cheng Hao hammered against the reinforced glass.\n\nWithout looking back, Old Morris severed the master telemetry cable atop the cabin, throwing his weight onto the red skull-engraved **Emergency Maximum Dive Plunge Lever**!\n\n\"MANTLE GATES——OPEN UP!!\"\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE————!!*\n\nPropelled by gravitational acceleration and superconducting maglev tracks, the heavy titanium elevator dropped like a meteor through the bottomless void, wind howling deafeningly as it plunged toward the mantle fault line three thousand meters below!\n\nThrough the fading glass window, Old Morris brandished his giant wrench, clashing with the swarming Kuroshio soldiers as blinding golden arcs and plasma bursts consumed the hall...\n\nAcross the elevator dashboard, the velocity needle spiked into the redline:\n\n> `[DESCENT VELOCITY: -55 m/s!]`  \n> `[DEPTH: -500m... -1200m... -2400m...]`  \n> `[DISTANCE TO GEOTHERMAL MAGMA HALL: 600 METERS!]`  \n> `[TIME TO SEVENTH SEISMIC SPIKE TSUNAMI DETONATION: 1 HOUR 45 MINUTES!]`\n\nThe final battle at the Earth's core had begun!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 19, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":20,"rawContent":"# 第二十章：老守燈人的三十年約定\n\n## 一、三千米地心的熔岩聖殿\n\n「呼嘯————！」\n\n高壓鈦合金升降機在垂直的玄武岩豎井中以近乎自由落體的極限速度瘋狂下墜。\n\n艙壁外側原本冰冷徹骨的岩層，隨著深度的急劇增加，溫度開始瘋狂飆升。從攝氏二十度、五十度、一直攀升到令人窒息的八十度！特種防熱裝甲外層的水珠瞬間蒸發成一片片白色的灼熱蒸汽。\n\n「嗡——喀啦啦！」\n\n在下墜整整三千公尺、儀表盤指針精準撞上底線的一剎那，底部的超導反向磁煞系統猛然啟動！\n\n強大的過載推背感將所有人緊緊壓在減震座椅上，升降機的十二組液壓緩衝支柱「轟」的一聲重重砸落在厚重平整的花崗岩基座上！\n\n厚達三十公分的雙層防爆氣密門，伴隨著一聲悠長的洩壓氣浪，朝兩側緩緩滑開。\n\n當所有人走出升降機的瞬間，眼前的景象，讓四個孩子與皮可的呼吸在同一微秒內徹底停滯——\n\n這是一座深藏在地殼深處、方圓超過一公里的古代地下熔岩聖殿！\n\n頭頂是宛如繁星般密密麻麻咬合的巨型青銅發條齒輪穹頂；腳下，數條奔騰咆哮的暗紅色地熱岩漿河，在厚達半公尺的透明天然金剛石防熱地磚下靜靜流淌，將整個宏偉的地下世界照耀得如同燃燒的赤紅神殿。\n\n而在聖殿正中央那座高達三十公尺的中央懸空控制橋上，一座由七根數十公尺粗的烏鋼發條巨柱構成的**「地殼發條錨定陣列」**，正伴隨著地脈的顫抖發出令人心驚膽戰的金屬哀鳴。\n\n此時此刻，在那座巨大陣列的主操縱桿前，正孤零零地站著一個蒼老卻如松柏般挺拔的身影。\n\n他穿著一件被高溫機油浸透的深藍色粗線水手毛衣，雙手死死握著一根碗口粗細的重型手動張力絞盤，渾身的肌肉因承受數千噸的發條拉力而劇烈顫抖，汗水順著他那布滿溝壑的蒼老臉龐滾滾滑落，滴在滾燙的地磚上瞬間化作青煙。\n\n在他的胸前，掛著一隻擦得鋥亮的黃銅雙齒輪懷錶。\n\n額頭上，推戴著一副鏡架磨損嚴重、鏡片上滿是微雕代碼的初代光學護目鏡。\n\n「爺……爺爺？！」\n\n誠浩的大腦在這一瞬間一片空白，兩行滾燙的熱淚毫无徵兆地決堤而出！\n\n---\n\n## 二、三十年的重逢與守燈人誓約\n\n站在絞盤前的老人渾身猛然一震。\n\n他吃力地轉過頭，布滿血絲的雙眼穿過蒸騰的熱浪，落在了那個穿著橙色救生背心、戴著黃銅護目鏡的少年身上。\n\n老人那雙歷經無數風暴與孤獨歲月的眼睛裡，先是閃過一抹難以置信的恍惚，緊接著，化作了無盡的溫柔與驕傲。\n\n「浩浩……」\n\n誠遠山老爺子的聲音沙啞得如同砂紙摩擦，但中氣依然無比充沛：「你這臭小子……真把爺爺的護目鏡……戴著找來了啊！」\n\n「爺爺！！」\n\n誠浩再也忍不住，發瘋似地衝過長長的花崗岩廊橋，一把死死撲進了老人的懷抱裡！\n\n老人用滿是老繭和燙傷痕跡的溫暖大手，緊緊抱住了孫子的肩膀，笑著拍了拍誠浩的後背，眼角泛起了淚光：\n\n「長高了……長結實了！像個頂天立地的真正男子漢了！」\n\n趴在誠浩腳邊的皮可，兩隻幽藍色的鏡頭歡快地閃爍成兩道月牙，小腦袋親暱地使勁蹭著老人的褲腿，發出一陣陣撒嬌般的「嚶嚶」電子歡叫。\n\n「好皮可……」老爺子蹲下身，慈祥地撫摸著銀色機械犬的小腦袋，「你的記憶合金外骨骼保養得很好，誠浩這孩子沒虧待你吧？」\n\n「汪！汪！」皮可興奮地立正敬了個禮。\n\n此時，葉旖緁、嵐與將江也快步走上了控制台。\n\n誠遠山抬起頭，目光掃過三個年輕的孩子，眼中滿是讚許的光芒：\n\n「這位是葉家的小姑娘吧？你眉宇間的這股靈氣與專注，簡直跟你父親當年一模一樣；」  \n「還有嵐……海風島暴風領航員的血脈，在你的眼神裡燃燒著，你爺爺當年的水手刀，想必傳給你了吧？」  \n最後，老爺子的目光落在了將江手裡那口黑漆漆的老鐵鍋上，忍不住爽朗地大笑出聲：  \n「哈哈！還有這個背平底鍋的小胖墩！三十年前我們船上的廚子也是這副行頭，走哪都不忘帶著油鹽醬醋！」\n\n將江不好意思地撓了撓圓圓的平頭，連忙從懷裡掏出一塊用錫箔紙包好的菠蘿麵包，雙手遞了上去：\n\n「誠爺爺！您辛苦了！這是我親手烤的特級菠蘿麵包，還熱乎著呢，您快補充點熱量！」\n\n老爺子接過麵包，咬了一大口，眼眶微濕地咀嚼著，連連點頭：「香！真香啊！這是我這三十年來，吃過最溫暖的一頓飯！」\n\n擦了擦嘴，老爺子神情鄭重地望向身後震顫不休的地熱陣列，長嘆了一口氣：\n\n「孩子們，你們一定很想知道，三十年前到底發生了什麼。」\n\n「三十年前，我和邱校長、老莫里斯駕駛著青木齒輪號，在千島海域勘測時意外發現了這座沉睡在地底的古代文明核心。這座地熱陣列，實際上是整個西太平洋構造板塊的『地殼減震發條』。」\n\n「當時，黑潮重工的前任董事長就企圖炸開地熱核心掠奪結晶。為了保護這片海域不被撕裂，我們三個人立下了**『三十年守燈人誓約』**——」\n\n「邱校長回到陸地，守護齒輪鎮與鹿陽國小的孩子們，建立地面的情報防線；莫里斯留守海面，用迷失燈塔的燈光警戒群島的異動；而我……則深入三千公尺地心，與這座古老的發條大陣融為一體，守護地脈的安寧。」\n\n老爺子的目光轉向誠浩，神色無比凝重：\n\n「但是現在，沈天成那畜生在周圍的地殼裂縫中刺入了**『七根地熱地震針』**！高壓蒸汽正以每秒數千噸的速度注入斷層，整座發條大陣……最多只能再撐最後**二十分鐘**！」\n\n---\n\n## 三、七星正多邊形與質數步長阻尼矩陣\n\n「二十分鐘？！」將江手裡的平底鍋差點嚇掉在地上。\n\n「不能直接把那些地震針拔出來嗎？」嵐急切地問道。\n\n「絕對不行！」誠遠山老爺子嚴厲地搖頭，「地震針深插地殼核心，內部充滿了超臨界態的高壓地熱流體。如果暴力強拆，會引發瞬間的『減壓沸騰（Cavitation Blowout）』，數萬噸的熾熱岩漿會像高壓水槍一樣噴穿地表，直接掀起百米超級海嘯！」\n\n「唯一的解法，是用天琴座光學星盤的共振頻率，依序向七根地震針注入**『反相抗震阻尼矩陣』**，讓它們內部的高壓共振逐步歸零！」\n\n葉旖緁快步走到主控光幕前，手指在全息投影的七根地震針坐標圖上飛速比對：\n\n```\n【地殼地震針阻尼消減矩陣】：\n陣列幾何構型：正七邊形（Heptagonal Array）\n編號標註：環形順時針標註為 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7\n\n地熱脈動基頻：f₀ = 7.5 Hz\n每根地震針諧波頻率：f_k = k × f₀（1至7階諧波疊加）\n\n消減禁忌：\n若按相鄰順序（1➡️2➡️3...）消減，相鄰兩針的頻率差（Δf = 7.5 Hz）\n將引發局部劇烈的「低頻拍頻共振（Beating Phenomenon）」，直接震裂地殼！\n\n數學拓撲消減法則（尤拉質數步長循環 / Hamiltonian Step）：\n利用正七邊形的對角星形折線，選取與 7 互質的跳步步長 s = 2！\n模運算狀態轉移方程：\nk_next = (k_curr + 2) mod 7\n（計算結果若為 0，則映射為第 7 號針！）\n\n起始基點：以能量最低的 1 號針為起點！\n```\n\n「**質數步長模運算（Modular Arithmetic）！星形拓撲消振法！**」\n\n葉旖緁的雙眼閃爍著數學之美：「大家看！這七根針構成了一個正七邊形！如果相鄰拔除，會產生致命的低頻拍頻！必須採用**步長為二**的跳步模運算！」\n\n旖緁迅速在地上寫出算式：\n\n$$\\text{第 1 步：} k_1 = 1$$  \n$$\\text{第 2 步：} k_2 = (1 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 3$$  \n$$\\text{第 3 步：} k_3 = (3 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 5$$  \n$$\\text{第 4 步：} k_4 = (5 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 7 \\quad (\\text{因為 } 7 \\bmod 7 = 0)$$  \n$$\\text{第 5 步：} k_5 = (7 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 9 \\bmod 7 = 2$$  \n$$\\text{第 6 步：} k_6 = (2 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 4$$  \n$$\\text{第 7 步：} k_7 = (4 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 6$$\n\n「消減序列出爐！」旖緁猛然抬頭，聲音清脆果斷：\n\n「**一號 ➡️ 三號 ➡️ 五號 ➡️ 七號 ➡️ 二號 ➡️ 四號 ➡️ 六號！**」\n\n「誠浩！轉動天琴星盤的七芒星撥輪，按照這個序列依序發射反相激光阻尼脈衝！！」\n\n「明白！」\n\n誠浩深吸一口氣，雙手穩穩托起合體的神器。天琴座光學星盤中央的七芒星校準指針，在誠浩穩定的指尖下發出清脆的「咔噠」咬合聲！\n\n「一號針——脈衝注入！！」\n\n「嗡！」一道金藍色的激光自星盤射出，遠方一號地熱巨柱的猩紅光芒瞬間熄滅！\n\n「三號針——注入！！」\n\n「五號針——熄滅！！」\n\n「七號針——熄滅！！」\n\n伴隨著一根根地震針的過載被平穩化解，地熱大廳劇烈的震顫開始奇蹟般地平息，金剛石地磚下的岩漿流速肉眼可見地減緩了下來！\n\n---\n\n## 四、浴血的莫里斯與電鋸惡魔\n\n「成功了！只剩最後兩根了！」嵐興奮地揮舞起合金船槳。\n\n然而，就在誠浩將星盤對準「四號針」的最後一瞬間——\n\n「轟隆隆隆————！！」\n\n身後的垂直升降機豎井頂部，突然傳來了一陣令人膽寒的恐怖爆炸巨響！\n\n緊接著，整部重達十噸的鈦合金升降機，在無數斷裂的鋼纜與刺目的火星中，如同一顆燃燒的隕石，自三千米高空狠狠砸落在聖殿邊緣的空地上，摔得四分五裂！\n\n而在廢墟的烈火與濃煙之中，一尊高達三公尺、通體塗裝著血紅色反光漆的**「重型外骨骼動力裝甲」**，踏著沉重得令地磚龜裂的鋼鐵步伐，緩緩走了出來！\n\n裝甲的手臂上，兩柄高速旋轉、燃燒著兩千度等離子電漿的**「高頻熱熔鏈鋸」**，正發出令人毛骨悚然的刺耳蜂鳴！\n\n駕駛艙的面罩緩緩掀開，露出了沈天成那張滿是鮮血、徹底癲狂的扭曲面孔：\n\n「哈哈哈哈……誠遠山！你以為藏在地心，我就找不到你了嗎？！」\n\n而在沈天成裝甲巨爪的後方，拖拽著一具已經嚴重變形的深海緊急逃生救生球。\n\n救生球的透明觀察窗上布滿了蛛網般的裂紋，老莫里斯滿頭是血地倒在裡面，身上的水手雨衣被撕裂成了布條，胸口微弱地起伏著，顯然在剛才的燈塔頂層死鬥中遭受了致命重創！\n\n「莫里斯爺爺！！」嵐看見老人的慘狀，眼淚瞬間奪眶而出，雙手握緊船槳就要不顧一切地衝上去！\n\n「嵐！別過去！那是黑潮最殘暴的『單兵決戰型等離子泰坦』！」誠遠山老爺子一把將嵐死死護在身後，眼神冷得如極地玄冰。\n\n沈天成揮動著滋滋作響的熱熔鏈鋸，居高臨下地指著控制台上的老爺子與誠浩，嘴角咧開一個令人作嘔的殘忍弧度：\n\n「老東西，還有你們這群自作聰明的小雜種。」\n\n「七根地震針，你們拔了五根對吧？很了不起啊！」\n\n沈天成猛地按下了裝甲胸口的一顆紅色自毀開關，獰笑道：\n\n「但是只要剩下最後一根，我體內的微型冷核動力爐就能引爆它！今天，要麼把星穹密鑰給我交出來……**要麼，你們所有人和這座深海聖殿，一起在地心熔岩裡化為灰燼吧！！**」\n\n「嗡————！」\n\n兩柄等離子熱熔鏈鋸同時拉滿最大轉速，如同一陣毀滅一切的烈焰風暴，帶著撕裂地面的火花，朝著誠浩與誠遠山當頭狠狠劈落！\n\n距離最後的自毀引爆，只剩下最後——**十五分鐘**！\n\n---\n\n*(第二十章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第二十章：老守燈人的三十年約定 (Chapter 20: The Old Lighthouse Keeper's Thirty-Year Vow)\n\n## 一、三千米地心的熔岩聖殿 (I. The Magma Sanctuary of the 3000-Meter Mantle)\n\n*WHOOOOOSH————!*\n\nThe high-pressure titanium elevator plummeted down the vertical basalt shaft at terminal free-fall velocity.\n\nBeyond the cabin walls, the ambient rock temperature surged violently as depth increased. From twenty degrees Celsius to fifty, then climbing to a suffocating eighty degrees! Condensation along the thermal armor exterior vaporized instantly into white clouds of scalding steam.\n\n*HUMMM——CLATTER!*\n\nAt the three-thousand-meter mark, just as the depth needle kissed the bottom stop, the superconducting reverse magnetic braking array engaged with a concussive shock!\n\nCrushing deceleration G-forces slammed everyone back into the shock-absorbing bucket seats, the elevator's twelve hydraulic suspension rams bottoming out with a thunderous crash onto the level granite foundations!\n\nWith a long pneumatic hiss of depressurization, the twelve-inch double blast doors slid smoothly open to both sides.\n\nThe instant everyone stepped through the portal, the breath of the four children and PICO froze in their throats—\n\nSpreading across an expanse of over one square kilometer deep within the Earth's crust was an ancient subterranean magma cathedral!\n\nSuspended overhead was a vaulted dome woven from thousands of interlocking colossal bronze clockwork gears; beneath their feet, rivers of roaring dark-red geothermal lava flowed under two-foot-thick transparent diamond thermal floor tiles, illuminating the magnificent underground realm in an ocean of incandescent scarlet glory.\n\nAnd at the center of the sanctuary, upon a suspended granite control bridge one hundred feet high, a colossal **Tectonic Clockwork Anchor Array** consisting of seven massive obsidian steel spring columns shrieked in mechanical strain as the continental plates convulsed.\n\nAt this very moment, standing solitary before the main tension lever of that gargantuan array, was an aged yet towering silhouette standing straight as an ancient cedar.\n\nHe wore a navy-blue cable-knit sailor's sweater soaked with high-temperature engine oil, his weathered hands locked around a heavy manual tension capstan as thick as a tree trunk. Every muscle in his body trembled under thousands of tons of clockwork torque, sweat pouring down his deeply lined face, turning to steam the second it hit the burning tiles.\n\nResting against his chest hung an immaculately polished brass dual-gear pocket watch.\n\nAnd perched over his brow was a battle-scarred optical goggle frame, its lenses etched with micro-code.\n\n\"G-Grandpa?!\"\n\nCheng Hao's mind went entirely blank, scalding tears bursting uncontrollably down his cheeks!\n\n---\n\n## 二、三十年的重逢與守燈人誓約 (II. Thirty-Year Reunion and the Keeper's Vow)\n\nThe elder before the capstan stiffened.\n\nTurning his head with agonizing effort, his bloodshot eyes looked through the shimmering heat haze, settling upon the boy in the orange floatation vest wearing brass Ghost Goggles.\n\nWithin those eyes—tested by thirty years of storms and solitary vigil—a flicker of disbelief gave way to boundless warmth, tenderness, and unconquerable pride.\n\n\"Hao-Hao...\"\n\nGrandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan's voice was hoarse as sandpaper, yet brimming with undiminished vigor: \"You little rascal... you actually wore Grandpa's goggles... and found your way down here!\"\n\n\"GRANDPA!!\"\n\nUnable to contain himself any longer, Cheng Hao sprinted wildly across the granite bridge, throwing himself headlong into the old man's embrace!\n\nWrapping warm, calloused, burn-scarred hands around his grandson's shoulders, the elder smiled through tears, patting Cheng Hao's back with hearty affection:\n\n\"You've grown taller... stronger! A true man who can shoulder the heavens!\"\n\nPerched at Cheng Hao's feet, PICO's sapphire optics curved into joyful crescents, nuzzling its alloy muzzle frantically against the old man's pant leg, emitting affectionate electronic whines.\n\n\"Good PICO...\" The elder knelt down, stroking the silver mechanical pup's head: \"Your shape-memory exoskeleton is impeccably maintained; Cheng Hao treated you well, didn't he?\"\n\n*Bark! Bark!* PICO snapped to attention and rendered a crisp salute.\n\nYe Yijie, Lan, and Jiang Jiang stepped onto the gantry.\n\nCheng Yuan-Shan raised his head, his gaze sweeping over the young heroes with shining admiration:\n\n\"You must be the young lady from the Ye family? That sharp, observant intellect behind your glasses is the spitting image of your father;\"  \n\"And Lan... the fiery spirit of Windward Island's storm navigators blazes in your eyes; your grandfather's sea cleaver passed to you, I take it?\"  \nFinally, the elder's eyes settled on the soot-blackened cast-iron skillet strapped to Jiang Jiang's waist, erupting into a hearty belly laugh:  \n\"Haha! And this chubby fellow with the skillet! Thirty years ago, our expedition ship's chef dressed exactly like that, never going anywhere without his seasoning kit!\"\n\nJiang Jiang rubbed his crew-cut head sheepishly, hastily pulling a tinfoil-wrapped pineapple bun from his coat, offering it with both hands:\n\n\"Grandpa Cheng! You've worked so hard! I baked this special reserve pineapple bun myself—it's still warm! Have some carbs, fast!\"\n\nAccepting the bun, the old engineer took an enormous bite, chewing with glistening eyes, nodding repeatedly: \"Delicious! Truly delicious! That's the warmest, finest meal I've tasted in thirty years!\"\n\nWiping his mouth, the elder's expression turned solemn as he looked back at the violently vibrating geothermal array, exhaling a long sigh:\n\n\"Children, you must be wondering what truly happened thirty years ago.\"\n\n\"Thirty years ago, Principal Chiu, Old Morris, and I were surveying the Thousand-Island Sea aboard The Aoki Gear when we stumbled upon this ancient civilization's core buried deep in the mantle. This geothermal array is, in truth, the 'Tectonic Shock-Absorbing Clockwork' for the entire Western Pacific plate.\"\n\n\"Back then, the previous chairman of Kuroshio Heavy Industries sought to blast the core to seize the crystals. To prevent our ocean from tearing apart, the three of us swore the **'Thirty-Year Lighthouse Keeper's Vow'**——\"\n\n\"Principal Chiu returned to the surface, safeguarding Gear Town and the children of Lu-Yang Elementary, establishing a surface intelligence perimeter; Morris held the waves, using the Lost Lighthouse's beam to watch over the atolls; and I... descended three thousand meters into the Earth's core, fusing my life with this ancient clockwork array to anchor the mantle fault line.\"\n\nThe elder looked toward Cheng Hao, his face grave:\n\n\"Yet now, that monster Shen Tian-Cheng has driven **'Seven Geothermal Seismic Spikes'** into the mantle fractures! Superheated steam is flooding the fault at thousands of tons per second; the entire clockwork array... can hold out for **twenty minutes** at most!\"\n\n---\n\n## 三、七星正多邊形與質數步長阻尼矩陣 (III. The Heptagonal Array and Prime Step-Damping Matrix)\n\n\"Twenty minutes?!\" The skillet nearly slipped from Jiang Jiang's hands.\n\n\"Can't we just yank those seismic spikes out?!\" Lan pressed urgently.\n\n\"Out of the question!\" Grandpa Cheng shook his head firmly. \"The spikes are embedded deep in the mantle core, saturated with supercritical geothermal fluid. Forcible extraction would trigger instantaneous 'Cavitation Blowout', spewing tens of thousands of tons of white-hot magma through the crust to unleash a hundred-meter megatsunami!\"\n\n\"The sole solution is using the Lyra Optical Astrolabe's resonance frequency to inject an **'Anti-Phase Damping Matrix'** into the seven spikes in exact sequence, reducing their internal high-pressure resonance to zero!\"\n\nYe Yijie rushed to the master holographic terminal, her fingers tracing the coordinates of the seven seismic spikes:\n\n```\n[TECTONIC SEISMIC SPIKE DAMPING DECAY MATRIX]:\nArray Geometry: Regular Heptagonal Array\nNumbering: Circular clockwise sequence 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7\n\nGeothermal Pulsation Base Frequency: f₀ = 7.5 Hz\nHarmonic Frequency per Spike: f_k = k × f₀ (Superposition of harmonics 1 to 7)\n\nAnnihilation Hazard:\nNeutralizing spikes in adjacent order (1 ➡️ 2 ➡️ 3...)\ncreates an adjacent frequency delta (Δf = 7.5 Hz),\ntriggering violent localized \"Low-Frequency Beating Phenomenon\",\ncracking the tectonic plate!\n\nMathematical Topology Annihilation Law (Eulerian Prime-Step Cycle):\nFollow the diagonal star-polygon trace of the heptagon\nwith a prime step size coprime to 7: step s = 2!\nModular State Transition Equation:\nk_next = (k_curr + 2) mod 7\n(If the result evaluates to 0, map to Spike 7!)\n\nStarting Node: Begin at lowest-energy Spike 1!\n```\n\n\"**MODULAR ARITHMETIC WITH PRIME STEP SIZE! STAR-TOPOLOGY DE-RESONANCE!**\"\n\nYe Yijie's eyes blazed with the sublime beauty of mathematics: \"Look! The seven spikes form a regular heptagon! Sequential removal triggers fatal low-frequency beating! We must utilize modular arithmetic with a **step size of two**!\"\n\nYijie jotted the equations across the console:\n\n$$\\text{Step 1: } k_1 = 1$$  \n$$\\text{Step 2: } k_2 = (1 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 3$$  \n$$\\text{Step 3: } k_3 = (3 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 5$$  \n$$\\text{Step 4: } k_4 = (5 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 7 \\quad (\\text{since } 7 \\bmod 7 = 0)$$  \n$$\\text{Step 5: } k_5 = (7 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 9 \\bmod 7 = 2$$  \n$$\\text{Step 6: } k_6 = (2 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 4$$  \n$$\\text{Step 7: } k_7 = (4 + 2) \\bmod 7 = 6$$\n\n\"The annihilation sequence is locked!\" Yijie shouted with decisive authority:\n\n\"**SPIKE 1 ➡️ SPIKE 3 ➡️ SPIKE 5 ➡️ SPIKE 7 ➡️ SPIKE 2 ➡️ SPIKE 4 ➡️ SPIKE 6!**\"\n\n\"Cheng Hao! Rotate the heptagram selector on the Lyra Astrolabe and fire the anti-phase laser damping pulses in that exact order!!\"\n\n\"Understood!\"\n\nCheng Hao took a deep breath, steadying the merged relic in his hands. The heptagram alignment needle at the core of the Lyra Astrolabe clicked with crisp, mechanical detents beneath his steady fingers!\n\n\"Spike 1——PULSE INJECTED!!\"\n\n*ZING!* A golden-blue laser speared from the astrolabe, extinguishing the crimson glow of the first distant geothermal pillar!\n\n\"Spike 3——INJECTED!!\"\n\n\"Spike 5——EXTINGUISHED!!\"\n\n\"Spike 7——EXTINGUISHED!!\"\n\nAs each seismic spike was neutralized, the violent tremors rattling the cathedral subsided miraculously, the magma churning beneath the diamond tiles slowing before their very eyes!\n\n---\n\n## 四、浴血的莫里斯與電鋸惡魔 (IV. Bloodstained Morris and the Chainsaw Fiend)\n\n\"It's working! Only two spikes remaining!\" Lan cheered, waving her oar.\n\nYet just as Cheng Hao aligned the astrolabe toward \"Spike 4\"—\n\n*RUUUUUUUUMBLE————BOOOOOM!!*\n\nA cataclysmic detonation tore through the vertical elevator shaft behind them!\n\nPlummeting through severed cables and a storm of fiery sparks, the crumpled, burning wreckage of the ten-ton titanium elevator smashed like a meteorite into the perimeter terrace three thousand meters below, shattering into flaming scrap!\n\nAnd striding out from the flames and smoke, towering ten feet tall in blood-red lacquered armor, was a **Heavy Powered Exoskeleton Titan**, its steel footfalls cracking the granite flagstones!\n\nMounted along the titan's arms, two high-speed **High-Frequency Thermal Plasma Chainsaws** spinning at two thousand degrees whined with blood-chilling fury!\n\nThe armored visor retracted, exposing Shen Tian-Cheng's gore-streaked, completely deranged face:\n\n\"Hahahaha... Cheng Yuan-Shan! Did you think hiding three thousand meters down would save you from me?!\"\n\nDragged behind the titan's armored claws was a severely crushed deep-sea emergency escape pod.\n\nSpiderweb fractures covered the viewing dome. Inside lay Old Morris, covered in blood, his oilskin coat shredded, his chest rising and falling with shallow, agonizing breaths after the brutal battle atop the lighthouse!\n\n\"GRANDPA MORRIS!!\" Lan screamed, tears bursting from her eyes as she raised her oar to charge!\n\n\"Lan! STAY BACK! That's Kuroshio's deadlier frontline assault unit—the 'Single-Pilot Plasma Titan'!\" Grandpa Cheng shielded Lan behind his body, his eyes cold as glacial ice.\n\nShen Tian-Cheng revved the sizzling plasma chainsaws, pointing them down toward the old master and Cheng Hao with a hideous, manic grin:\n\n\"Old dog, and you clever little runts.\"\n\n\"Seven seismic spikes—you pulled five of them, didn't you? Impressive!\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng jammed a red self-destruct toggle on the titan's breastplate, sneering:\n\n\"But as long as one remains, the micro cold-fusion core in my chassis can detonate it! Surrender the Celestial Key right now... **or every last one of you will burn to ash with this temple in the mantle magma!!**\"\n\n*VROOOOOOM——!!*\n\nBoth plasma chainsaws whined to maximum RPMs, screaming like an apocalyptic tempest of fire and sparks, descending toward Cheng Hao and Cheng Yuan-Shan!\n\nOnly **fifteen minutes** remained before the final self-destruct detonation!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 20, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":21,"rawContent":"# 第二十一章：深海大裂谷的終極防衛機關\n\n## 一、烈焰狂飆與洛倫茲護盾\n\n「滋啦啦啦————轟！！」\n\n兩柄長達兩公尺、燃燒著兩千度橘紅色電漿的高頻熱熔鏈鋸，帶著撕裂空氣的刺耳狂嘯，將中央控制橋堅硬的黑曜石地磚硬生生犁出了兩道流淌著熾熱熔岩的焦黑溝壑！\n\n沈天成那尊三公尺高的「單兵決戰型等離子泰坦」重型動力裝甲，胸口處的冷核反應堆正瘋狂泛著刺目的血紅警報光暈。\n\n「老東西！把你們的骨頭連同這座大陣一起化為飛灰吧！」\n\n沈天成面目猙獰地狂吼著，裝甲左臂的等離子鏈鋸如同一道烈焰巨輪，對著緊握絞盤的誠遠山老爺子當頭狠狠劈落！\n\n「爺爺小心！！」\n\n誠浩雙目圓睜，想都沒想，整個人如同一頭敏捷的獵豹，迎著兩千度的灼熱火浪瘋狂暴衝而上！\n\n「皮可！變形——**洛倫茲超導電磁臂鎧（Lorentz Magnetic Armature）**！！」\n\n「嗡——喀啦啦啦！」\n\n緊隨在誠浩身後的銀色機械柴犬皮可，發出了一聲高亢清越的金屬咆哮！它那一身薄如蟬翼的常溫超導記憶合金薄片，在千分之一秒內如流水般纏繞、壓縮、翻折，嚴絲合縫地包裹在誠浩的整條右臂之上！\n\n誠浩的右臂瞬間化為一隻通體泛著幽藍色冷光的重型超導機械巨臂！臂鎧頂端彈出四道微型強磁特斯拉線圈，誠浩手中的多功能螺絲筆充當了高頻電容擊發針！\n\n「給老子——**滾開！！**」\n\n誠浩怒吼著，將右臂的超導臂鎧正面迎向劈落的等離子鏈鋸！\n\n```\n【電磁力學洛倫茲力與楞次定律矩陣】：\n洛倫茲力公式：F = q × (E + v × B)\n法拉第電磁感應反斥力矩：\n當超導體（電阻 R ≈ 0）迎向兩千度高速等離子體（高密帶電粒子流 v）時，\n強磁線圈（B = 12 Tesla）將在千分之一秒內激發極限「抗磁渦電流（Eddy Currents）」！\n楞次定律定則：感應磁場必強烈反抗原磁通量的變化！\n形成絕對反斥磁壓：P_mag = B² / (2μ₀) ≈ 57.3 MPa（相當於 570 個大氣壓的反斥衝量！）\n```\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n半空中，一道肉眼可見的蔚藍色半球形**「洛倫茲強磁斥力護盾」**，在兩者碰撞的一瞬間轟然爆發！\n\n兩千度高溫的等離子電漿，在 12 特斯拉的超導強磁場扭曲下，竟然如同撞上了無形的鋼鐵大山，硬生生被偏轉了整整九十度，化作漫天四濺的絢爛火花，呼嘯著射進兩側的岩漿河中，激起沖天的岩漿狂瀾！\n\n強大的反衝力震得誠浩雙腿向後滑行了五公尺，防滑鞋底在岩石上擦出一道長長的白煙。\n\n但他那隻包裹在超導臂鎧裡的右臂，卻如磐石般紋絲未動！\n\n「什麼？！竟然用純物理電磁反斥擋下了我的熱熔刀？！」沈天成的眼珠子差點瞪出眼眶。\n\n---\n\n## 二、黑鐵鐵鍋與海島船槳的絕妙配合\n\n「老子的菠蘿麵包專用鍋，還沒給老爺子煎海鮮呢！吃我一記『老油暴擊』！！」\n\n就在沈天成裝甲重心不穩的千分之一秒，將江那圓滾滾的身影突然從岩壁陰影中殺了出來！\n\n只見將江雙手高高掄起那口燒得滾燙通紅的黑鐵平底鍋，鍋底抹著厚厚一層高純度豬油與海藻鹽，帶著破空的呼嘯聲，以一記無懈可擊的本壘打揮棒姿勢，狠狠掄在了泰坦裝甲後腦勺的微型散熱風扇排氣口上！\n\n「鐺————！！」\n\n一記清脆悠揚的金屬暴鳴在整座熔岩大廳內炸響！\n\n鍋底的高溫熱油在高壓排氣孔的瞬間引燃，化作一團熾熱的黑煙，直接灌進了沈天成的光學頭盔傳感器，燒得裝甲內部的視訊光幕一片雪花亂閃！\n\n「啊啊啊！我的眼睛！該死的小胖子！！」沈天成痛苦地嚎叫著，雙臂鏈鋸瘋狂胡亂揮舞。\n\n「暴風折疊！鎖死它的關節關閉閥！」\n\n側翼的嵐踩著岩漿河上的金剛石跳板凌空飛躍，手中的雙刃折疊合金船槳化作一桿標槍，精準無比地「咔噠」一聲插進了泰坦裝甲右膝蓋後方的液壓連桿縫隙中！\n\n女孩借著下墜的重量猛然下壓，合金船槳充當了一根無堅不摧的撬棍，硬生生將泰坦裝甲沉重的右腿卡死在原地！\n\n「誠浩！快去中央控制台！最後兩根地震針要失控了！」誠遠山老爺子雙手死死拉住鋼纜，青筋暴起地向誠浩大喊！\n\n---\n\n## 三、行星差速齒輪系與動態力矩平抑\n\n誠浩飛身衝上中央主控橋，葉旖緁早已在主光幕前完成了最後兩根地震針（四號與六號）的自律反饋計算。\n\n然而，眼前的景象卻讓所有人倒抽了一口涼氣——\n\n在控制台的正下方，一座由直徑達三公尺的中央太陽輪、三枚行星輪與外圈內齒圈構成的**「古代地熱行星差速齒輪系（Planetary Differential Gear Set）」**，正伴隨著地脈的劇烈顛簸，陷入了每分鐘高達兩千轉的瘋狂逆向飛車狀態！\n\n高達數十萬牛頓·米（$\\text{N}\\cdot\\text{m}$）的恐怖扭矩，讓齒輪箱的潤滑油劇烈沸騰冒煙，隨時都會徹底爆裂解體！\n\n```\n【古代地殼自平衡行星差速齒輪系參數】：\n中央太陽輪齒數：Z_s = 20\n行星輪齒數（三輪均布）：Z_p = 15\n外圈內齒圈齒數：Z_r = Z_s + 2 × Z_p = 20 + 30 = 50 齒！\n\n行星輪系轉速特性方程（Willis 方程）：\n(ω_s - ω_c) / (ω_r - ω_c) = - Z_r / Z_s = - 50 / 20 = - 2.5！\n\n【重啟平抑法則】：\n沈天成的自毀信號破壞了行星架（Carrier, c）的固定銷！\n若要平抑扭矩並同時關閉四號與六號地震針：\n1. 必須以不低於 50 kN 的超高抗剪強度材料，瞬間插死行星架（ω_c = 0）！\n2. 行星架鎖定後，轉速比簡化為：\n   ω_s / ω_r = - 2.5 ＝ - 5 / 2！\n3. 太陽輪（s）與內齒圈（r）必須以「反向 2.5 倍速（5 : 2）」精確同步旋轉，\n   方能抵消地下超載扭矩，引發古代自律安全閥全面鎖定！\n```\n\n「**行星差速比負二點五（-2.5）！轉速比五比二（5 : 2）！**」\n\n葉旖緁的聲音在警報聲中清脆高亢：「皮可！化身鎖死插銷，承受五萬牛頓的剪切力，鎖死中間的行星架！」\n\n「汪！！」\n\n皮可毫不猶豫地自誠浩手臂上脫離，化作一根直徑十公分、通體閃爍著堅不可摧菱形暗紋的**「常溫超導高強度鎖死合金樁」**，如同一枚精準的鋼釘，狠狠刺入了正在狂暴旋轉的行星架卡槽中央！\n\n「鐺————轟！」\n\n伴隨著一陣令人牙酸的金屬撞擊，高達數萬牛頓的狂暴扭矩被皮可那超越常規材料極限的記憶合金身軀硬生生接了下來！行星架瞬間被穩穩鎖定（$\\omega_c = 0$）！\n\n「太陽輪與內齒圈！五比二反向旋轉！！」誠浩狂吼！\n\n「太陽輪交給我！」誠浩雙手覆蓋著合金拳套，跳上中央太陽輪的驅動軸。  \n「內齒圈交給我們！！」嵐與誠遠山老爺子同時跳上外圈的重型青銅推桿！\n\n「一！二！三……推！！」\n\n$$\\omega_s = -2.5 \\times \\omega_r \\implies 5 \\text{ 圈對 } 2 \\text{ 圈！}$$\n\n誠浩以閃電般的五倍速瘋狂轉動中央太陽輪！  \n嵐與老爺子以沉穩如山的力量，將巨大的外圈內齒圈以精準的兩倍速反向推動！\n\n「喀啦……喀啦……咔噠！！」\n\n在五比二黃金差速比契合的同一微秒，兩道清脆純淨的古代金屬落鎖聲，如同天籟般在聖殿深處齊齊炸響！\n\n---\n\n## 四、惡徒伏誅與地震針全面歸零\n\n「嗡————！」\n\n整座龐大無比的行星差速齒輪系，在這一瞬間完成了完美的自平衡動力閉環！\n\n一股龐大無比的相干反相阻尼能量，順著地下水銀管道，呼嘯著注入了最後的四號與六號地熱巨柱！\n\n「轟！轟！」\n\n聖殿遠方，最後兩根閃爍著毀滅紅光的地震針，頂端的液壓卡榫同時彈開！重達千噸的鋼鐵巨柱被深海安全發條緩緩自地殼斷層中平穩拔出，收縮回了玄武岩發條發射井深處！\n\n地脈平息了。\n\n金剛石地磚下原本咆哮的暗紅色熔岩，迅速冷卻凝固為一層漆黑平整的安山岩岩層。\n\n那頭陷入瘋狂的等離子泰坦裝甲，胸口處的冷核反應堆在差速平抑的強磁脈衝掃蕩下，爆發出一連串劇烈的內部短路火花，所有的等離子烈焰在一瞬間徹底熄滅！\n\n沈天成整個人被強大的衝擊波自駕駛艙震飛了出去，重重砸在玄武岩牆壁上，那柄象徵權力的電弧權杖摔得粉碎。\n\n這個平日裡不可一世的跨國財閥總裁，此刻滿頭鮮血、狼狽如喪家之犬，眼神空洞地看著熄滅的控制台，發出絕望的哀嚎：\n\n「不……我的結晶……我的千島海……全都完了……」\n\n巴克與丁丁此時正好駕駛著小型搶修艇自暗河衝入大廳，少年海盜一步跨上前，單手將一記沉重的特大號生鏽鐵錨銬「喀嚓」一聲狠狠扣在了沈天成的雙手手腕上：\n\n「黑潮重工的沈大董事長，恭喜你，以盜採公海古代遺跡與企圖破壞地殼罪，正式被我們鐵錨幫與千島海警逮捕了！」\n\n丁丁掄起小拳頭在沈天成腦袋上敲了一記爆栗，氣呼呼地哼道：「大壞蛋！差點害得我沒地方抱銀色小狗！」\n\n---\n\n## 五、神聖之火與地心氣動飛升\n\n在聖殿的最邊緣，老莫里斯被將江小心翼翼地從破損的救生球中扶了出來。老人的傷口雖然滲著血，但在看到熄滅的地震針與安然無恙的遠山後，布滿皺紋的臉上露出了這三十年來最暢快、最釋懷的笑容。\n\n誠遠山老爺子快步走上前，兩個三十年未見的老兄弟，在經歷了生死大戰後，緊緊相擁在了一起，淚水打濕了各自襤褸的水手衣衫。\n\n「莫里斯……你這老傢伙，命真硬啊！」  \n「遠山……你也是，三十年了，骨頭還是這麼硬！」\n\n就在這時，聖殿中央那座沉寂的發條大陣頂端，突然爆發出了一道柔和純淨、宛如初生朝陽般的純白色聖光！\n\n失去了地震針的威脅，地底深處純淨無暇的古代恆光反應堆，在十二面體星象儀與天琴星盤的共振引導下，徹底甦醒了！\n\n整座聖殿的穹頂發條齒輪，開始以一種優雅宏大的節奏，有條不紊地自轉自洽運行。\n\n然而，老莫里斯指著頭頂那道穿透三千公尺岩層的金色通天光柱，大聲提醒道：\n\n「孩子們！最後一步還沒完成！」\n\n「地熱核心雖然穩定了，但迷失燈塔的頂層大透鏡，還需要把星盤的核心鑰匙帶回海面頂層，完成最後的**『永恆光束鎖定』**！」\n\n「只有當燈塔的三十萬流明神聖之光照亮整片千島齒輪海，海面上所有的發條浮島、海風島的鐘樓與鹿陽國小的時間節點，才會徹底重回正軌！」\n\n誠遠山老爺子笑著按下了主控台上那顆閃爍著純白光芒的菱形按鈕：\n\n「三十年了……我們這群老守燈人，是時候帶著新一代的少年，回海面上看看日出了！」\n\n「轟隆隆——！」\n\n主控台正後方，一座完好無損、採用古代高壓氣動推進的**「深海光速飛升艙（Pneumatic Ascension Pod）」**，帶著璀璨的金光轟然開啟！\n\n誠浩、葉旖緁、將江、嵐、巴克、丁丁、老莫里斯與誠遠山老爺子，齊齊邁著堅定的步伐走進艙內。\n\n皮可變回靈巧的銀色柴犬，歡快地躍上了誠浩的肩膀。\n\n「氣壓全開——目標：迷失燈塔頂層！出發！！」\n\n「咻————！！」\n\n氣動飛升艙化作一道璀璨的金色流星，迎著直貫蒼穹的神聖光束，朝著海平面的世界，呼嘯破空飛升！\n\n海平面的黑夜即將破曉，永恆的燈塔，即將在少年的手中迎來徹底的復甦！\n\n---\n\n*(第二十一章 完，請待續……)*\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第二十一章：深海大裂谷的終極防衛機關 (Chapter 21: The Ultimate Defense Mechanism of the Abyssal Rift)\n\n## 一、烈焰狂飆與洛倫茲護盾 (I. The Raging Inferno and the Lorentz Shield)\n\n*ZZZZZZZZ————BOOOOOM!!*\n\nTwin six-foot high-frequency thermal plasma chainsaws burning at two thousand degrees Celsius whined with deafening fury, carving two molten, scorched furrows across the obsidian flagstones of the central control bridge!\n\nAboard his ten-foot \"Single-Pilot Plasma Titan\" heavy exoskeleton, the cold-fusion reactor upon Shen Tian-Cheng's breastplate pulsed with blinding crimson alarm lights.\n\n\"Old dog! Turn to ash alongside your clockwork array!\"\n\nShen Tian-Cheng roared with demonic fury, the plasma chainsaw on his left arm sweeping downward like a flaming wheel straight toward Grandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan at the capstan!\n\n\"GRANDPA, LOOK OUT!!\"\n\nEyes wide, Cheng Hao didn't hesitate for a microsecond. Vaulting forward like a hunting leopard, he charged straight into the blinding two-thousand-degree wave of flame!\n\n\"PICO! TRANSFORM——**LORENTZ MAGNETIC ARMATURE**!!\"\n\n*VROOOOOM——CLANG-SHING!*\n\nFollowing hard on his heels, the silver origami Shiba Inu PICO unleashed a ringing metallic howl! Its gossamer-thin room-temperature superconducting memory-alloy plates wrapped, compressed, and folded in a millisecond, encasing Cheng Hao's entire right arm in a seamless gauntlet!\n\nCheng Hao's arm transformed into a heavy superconducting mechanical gauntlet gleaming with cold sapphire luminescence! Four miniature high-magnetic Tesla coils deployed at the knuckles, with his multi-tool screwdriver pen serving as the high-frequency discharge probe!\n\n\"GET... **AWAY FROM HIM!!**\"\n\nCheng Hao bellowed, thrusting the superconducting gauntlet straight into the path of the descending plasma chainsaw!\n\n```\n[ELECTROMAGNETIC LORENTZ FORCE & LENZ'S LAW MATRIX]:\nLorentz Force Equation: F = q × (E + v × B)\nFaraday Magnetic Repulsion Torque:\nWhen a superconductor (Resistance R ≈ 0) clashes with a 2,000°C\nhigh-velocity plasma stream (charged particle flux v),\nthe high-field coils (B = 12 Tesla) induce peak \"Diamagnetic Eddy Currents\"\nwithin a millisecond!\nLenz's Law Principle: Induced magnetic field violently opposes the flux change!\nResulting Diamagnetic Pressure:\nP_mag = B² / (2μ₀) ≈ 57.3 MPa (equivalent to 570 atmospheres of repulsive impulse!)\n```\n\n*BOOOOOOOOOM————!!*\n\nA visible, hemispherical **Lorentz Diamagnetic Repulsion Shield** erupted outward in midair at the point of impact!\n\nUnder the immense magnetic field of 12 Tesla, the two-thousand-degree plasma stream slammed against an invisible mountain, deflecting by a clean ninety degrees, raining fireworks into the lava canals below and churning towering geysers of molten rock!\n\nThe tremendous recoil pushed Cheng Hao sliding backward five meters across the stone, his non-slip soles smoking against the granite.\n\nYet his arm encased within the superconducting gauntlet held firm as granite!\n\n\"WHAT?! Deflecting my thermal cutter with pure electromagnetic diamagnetism?!\" Shen Tian-Cheng's eyes nearly bulged from his skull.\n\n---\n\n## 二、黑鐵鐵鍋與海島船槳的絕妙配合 (II. The Brilliant Tag-Team of Iron Skillet and Island Oar)\n\n\"My pineapple bun skillet hasn't fried seafood for Grandpa yet! TASTE MY SEASONED GREASE CRIT!!\"\n\nIn the millisecond Shen Tian-Cheng's titan lost its balance, Jiang Jiang's round figure burst from the shadows of the basalt wall!\n\nHeaving his glowing, scalding cast-iron skillet smeared with a thick crust of rendered pork lard and kelp sea-salt, Jiang Jiang swung it with a textbook home-run stroke, smashing it directly into the miniature exhaust port behind the titan's helmet!\n\n*CLANG————!!*\n\nA ringing metallic concussion echoed through the magma cathedral!\n\nThe scalding grease ignited instantly upon contact with the exhaust manifold, erupting in a cloud of blinding soot that sucked straight into Shen Tian-Cheng's optical sensors, drowning his interior HUD in snowy static!\n\n\"ARRRGH! MY EYES! YOU DAMNED FAT BRAT!!\" Shen Tian-Cheng shrieked in agony, flailing his plasma chainsaws in blind circles.\n\n\"Storm Cleaver! Lock the articulation valves!\"\n\nLan leaped from a diamond stepping stone across the lava river, her alloy folding oar thrusting forward like a javelin, jamming into the hydraulic linkages behind the titan's right knee with a sharp *CLACK*!\n\nUsing her falling body weight as a lever, the alloy oar served as an unbreakable crowbar, locking the titan's heavy right leg solid against the floor!\n\n\"Cheng Hao! To the master console! The final two seismic spikes are going critical!\" Grandpa Cheng yelled, veins bulging as he held fast to the tension cables!\n\n---\n\n## 三、行星差速齒輪系與動態力矩平抑 (III. The Planetary Differential Gear Train and Dynamic Torque Suppression)\n\nCheng Hao bolted onto the central control bridge, where Ye Yijie had already finalized the stabilization calculations for Spikes 4 and 6.\n\nYet what met their eyes chilled the blood—\n\nDirectly beneath the console, an **Ancient Planetary Differential Gear Set**—composed of a ten-foot sun gear, three planet gears, and a massive ring gear—was spinning in violent reverse runaway at over two thousand RPM!\n\nHundreds of thousands of Newton-meters ($\\text{N}\\cdot\\text{m}$) of terrifying torque caused the gearbox oil to boil and smoke, on the verge of cataclysmic explosive disintegration!\n\n```\n[ANCIENT SELF-BALANCING PLANETARY GEAR TRAIN PARAMETERS]:\nCentral Sun Gear Teeth: Z_s = 20\nPlanet Gear Teeth (3 equidistant gears): Z_p = 15\nOuter Ring Gear Teeth: Z_r = Z_s + 2 × Z_p = 20 + 30 = 50 teeth!\n\nPlanetary Gear Velocity Equation (Willis Equation):\n(ω_s - ω_c) / (ω_r - ω_c) = - Z_r / Z_s = - 50 / 20 = - 2.5!\n\n[RESTORATION BALANCE LAW]:\nShen's self-destruct signal severed the carrier locking pin (c)!\nTo suppress the runaway torque and disarm Spikes 4 and 6:\n1. Jam the carrier (ω_c = 0) with a material of shear strength >= 50 kN!\n2. With carrier locked, the speed ratio simplifies to:\n   ω_s / ω_r = - 2.5 = - 5 / 2!\n3. Sun gear (s) and Ring gear (r) must be rotated in opposite directions\n   at an exact 2.5 ratio (5 : 2) to cancel the overload torque,\n   tripping the ancient failsafe interlocks!\n```\n\n\"**PLANETARY RATIO MINUS TWO POINT FIVE (-2.5)! SPEED RATIO FIVE TO TWO (5 : 2)!**\"\n\nYe Yijie's voice cut through the blaring alarms: \"PICO! Act as the shear locking pin! Endure fifty thousand Newtons of shear force to lock the central planet carrier!\"\n\n*BARK!!*\n\nDetaching from Cheng Hao's arm without hesitation, PICO transformed into a four-inch-thick **Superconducting High-Tensile Diamond-Weave Locking Stake**, driving itself like an immovable steel wedge straight into the racing planet carrier slot!\n\n*CLANG————BOOM!*\n\nWith an ear-splitting metallic shock, tens of thousands of Newtons of runaway torque were absorbed by PICO's memory alloy! The planet carrier locked solid in a millisecond ($\\omega_c = 0$)!\n\n\"Sun gear and Ring gear! Five-to-two counter-rotation!!\" Cheng Hao roared!\n\n\"Sun gear is mine!\" Cheng Hao vaulted onto the sun gear drive shaft, gloved hands gripping the spokes.  \n\"Ring gear is ours!!\" Lan and Grandpa Cheng leaped together onto the outer bronze push-bars!\n\n\"One! Two! Three... HEAVE!!\"\n\n$$\\omega_s = -2.5 \\times \\omega_r \\implies 5 \\text{ turns to } 2 \\text{ turns!}$$\n\nCheng Hao cranked the central sun gear at fivefold speed!  \nLan and Grandpa threw their combined might into hauling the massive outer ring gear in reverse at an exact twofold pace!\n\n*CLATTER... CLATTER... CLANK!!*\n\nThe exact microsecond the 5:2 golden differential ratio aligned, two crisp, ancient locking chimes echoed like heavenly bells through the depths of the sanctuary!\n\n---\n\n## 四、惡徒伏誅與地震針全面歸零 (IV. The Villain Vanquished and the Seismic Spikes Zeroed)\n\n*HUMMMMMM——!*\n\nThe colossal planetary gear set snapped into a flawless, self-balancing energy loop!\n\nA massive surge of coherent anti-phase damping energy surged through subterranean mercury conduits, funneling directly into Spikes 4 and 6!\n\n*BOOM! BOOM!*\n\nIn the distance, the crimson warning lights on the final two seismic spikes died simultaneously as their hydraulic detents disengaged! Driven by ancient safety springs, the thousand-ton steel pillars were smoothly withdrawn from the fault line, retracting into the bedrock launch silos!\n\nThe tectonic fault fell still.\n\nBeneath the diamond tiles, the churning red lava cooled rapidly into smooth, dark andesite rock.\n\nSwept by the strong diamagnetic pulse from the differential stabilization, the cold-fusion reactor upon the plasma titan short-circuited in a shower of sparks, its thermal blades dying completely!\n\nThe concussive shockwave blasted Shen Tian-Cheng from his cockpit, slamming him hard against the basalt wall as his arc scepter shattered into pieces.\n\nThe once-arrogant multinational tycoon lay battered and bleeding, staring with hollow eyes at the dead console, groaning in ruined despair:\n\n\"No... My crystals... My Gear Sea... All gone...\"\n\nBuck and Ding-Ding burst through the watergate aboard an emergency skiff, the young pirate marching forward to clamp a pair of heavy, rusted anchor-iron manacles onto Shen Tian-Cheng's wrists with a resounding *CLACK*:\n\n\"Chairman Shen of Kuroshio Heavy Industries, congratulations! You are officially under arrest by the Iron Anchor Gang and the Thousand-Island Coast Guard for illegal deep-sea excavation and attempted tectonic terrorism!\"\n\nDing-Ding rapped him on the head with a stern fist, puffing her cheeks: \"Big bully! You almost wrecked my chances of hugging the silver puppy!\"\n\n---\n\n## 五、神聖之火與地心氣動飛升 (V. The Celestial Flame and Pneumatic Ascension)\n\nAt the perimeter of the sanctuary, Jiang Jiang helped Old Morris gently out from the battered escape pod. Though bleeding from his wounds, seeing the neutralized seismic spikes and his unharmed brother-in-arms, the old keeper's face beamed with the deepest relief of his thirty years.\n\nGrandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan strode forward. The two veteran brothers, separated for three decades, embraced tightly after surviving the fires of battle, tears soaking their tattered sailor sweaters.\n\n\"Morris... you old sea dog, your bones are made of iron!\"  \n\"Yuan-Shan... thirty years, and your grip is as tough as ever!\"\n\nAt that moment, the pinnacle of the central clockwork array erupted with a gentle, pure, solar-white celestial light!\n\nWith the threat of the seismic spikes extinguished, the pristine ancient Eternal Light Reactor in the mantle awakened completely, guided by the resonance of the dodecahedral astrolabe and the Lyra disc!\n\nAcross the vaulted ceiling, the colossal clockwork gears resumed their elegant, eternal orbits.\n\nYet Old Morris pointed toward the golden laser beam spearing three thousand meters skyward, shouting his reminder:\n\n\"Children! The final step remains!\"\n\n\"The mantle core is stable, but the master Fresnel lens at the top of the lighthouse requires the core key to achieve the final **'Eternal Beam Lock'**!\"\n\n\"Only when three hundred thousand lumens of sacred light bathe the Thousand-Island Sea will the floating atolls, Windward Island's clock tower, and Lu-Yang Elementary's timeline fully realign!\"\n\nGrandpa Cheng smiled, pressing the diamond-shaped white actuator on the master terminal:\n\n\"Thirty years... It is time for us old lighthouse keepers to take the new generation to the surface to watch the sunrise!\"\n\n*RUMBLE-SWOOSH——!*\n\nDirectly behind the terminal, an intact ancient high-pressure **Pneumatic Ascension Pod** parted its gleaming golden doors!\n\nCheng Hao, Ye Yijie, Jiang Jiang, Lan, Buck, Ding-Ding, Old Morris, and Grandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan stepped together into the cabin with resolute strides.\n\nPICO reassembled into the nimble silver Shiba Inu, bounding happily onto Cheng Hao's shoulder.\n\n\"Pneumatic pressure to maximum——destination: Pinnacle of the Lost Lighthouse! LAUNCH!!\"\n\n*WHOOOOOOSH————!!*\n\nThe ascension pod rocketed skyward like a brilliant golden shooting star, riding the celestial beam through the crust, hurtling toward the world of the sea surface!\n\nNight above the waves was breaking into dawn, and the Eternal Lighthouse was about to awaken completely in the hands of the youth!\n\n---\n\n*(End of Chapter 21, to be continued...)*\r\n"},{"id":22,"rawContent":"# 第二十二章：點亮永恆之光（第二卷大結局）\n\n## 一、破曉的八十公尺燈塔之巔\n\n「呼————轟！」\n\n氣動飛升艙在垂直豎井中劃過一道刺目的金色流光，伴隨著一聲雄渾悠長的排氣減壓聲，穩穩衝破了三千公尺的地底岩層，回到了迷失燈塔八十公尺高空的頂層水晶大廳！\n\n當厚重的防爆艙門緩緩開啟時，清晨第一縷純淨溫暖的陽光，正穿透破曉的雲層，灑在滿是硝煙與斑駁的大廳地板上。\n\n風暴散盡了。\n\n透過破碎的水晶穹頂極目遠眺，原本沸騰咆哮的千島齒輪海，此刻已經重歸寧靜。海面上波光粼粼，倒映著天邊絢爛璀璨的紫金色朝霞；遠方的海風島在晨曦中宛如一顆青翠欲滴的綠寶石，島上發條風車的巨大葉片在微風中悠然轉動。\n\n深海的大裂谷平息了，毀滅的地震針全部化為廢鐵，海底萬年沉睡的熾熱熔岩，重新變成了守護這片大洋的溫暖動脈。\n\n大廳中央，那座直徑達十公尺的「菲涅耳永恆大透鏡」在晨曦下靜靜矗立。\n\n然而，在透鏡正中央的燈座核心處，那團照亮了千島海數百年的神聖光芒，此刻依然熄滅著，正等待著它命中注定的主人將其重新點燃。\n\n「三十年了……」\n\n老莫里斯在巴克與丁丁的攙扶下，一步一步走到燈座前，抬起乾枯的手掌，顫抖著撫摸著冰涼的黃銅底座，眼眶濕潤：\n\n「遠山……三十年前我們沒能完成的最後一步，今天，該由孩子們來完成了。」\n\n誠遠山老爺子笑著拍了拍莫里斯的肩膀，隨後轉過頭，溫柔而堅定地注視著誠浩：\n\n「浩浩，把三件星穹神器拿出來吧。」\n\n---\n\n## 二、光柵繞射與三神具合體\n\n「嗯！」\n\n誠浩深吸了一口氣，解下胸前的裝備，在眾人的注視下走到了大理石祭壇前。\n\n三件歷經重重險阻、跨越三十年時光的神器，在晨光下一字排開：\n\n1. 銘刻著微雕矩陣代碼的【初代幽靈光學護目鏡】（光學偏振透鏡）；\n2. 象徵天地十二方位的金色【十二面體古代星象儀】（時空幾何核心）；\n3. 散發著淡紫色璀璨星芒的【天琴座光學星盤】（聲學與光譜調諧器）。\n\n當誠浩將三件神器緩緩靠近的瞬間，奇蹟發生了——\n\n三件原本獨立的神器內部，傳來了無比密集的齒輪咬合脆響！\n\n「咔噠……咔噠……錚————！」\n\n星象儀的棱鏡翻折為外環底座，天琴星盤的紫水晶軸芯化作光子聚集器，而護目鏡上的光學偏振鏡片則嚴絲合縫地卡入頂端，三者在千分之一秒內完美融合成了一具直徑約四十公分、通體流淌著金色液體般光華的終極核心——**【日冕三稜光子核心（Prismatic Sun Core）】**！\n\n然而，在核心安裝到底座卡槽的一刻，基座上的微雕黃銅日晷儀突然彈出了一圈精密微米刻度盤：\n\n```\n【菲涅耳永恆核心繞射色散方程式】：\n光柵繞射基本條件：\nd × sin(θ) = m × λ\n\n【古代恆光光譜參數】：\n基座透射光柵刻線密度：N = 500 條/mm\n光柵狹縫常數：d = 1 / N = 1 / 500 mm = 2.0 μm = 2000 nm！\n古代地熱結晶光子波長：λ = 589 nm（純淨金黃色太陽光譜線 / 鈉雙線中值）\n繞射階數（一階主極大值，能量集中度 98%）：m = 1\n\n【色散角校準法則】：\nsin(θ) = (m × λ) / d\nsin(θ) = (1 × 589) / 2000 = 0.2945！\n精確偏轉角：θ = arcsin(0.2945) ≈ 17.13° ≈ 17.1°！\n\n操作指引：\n轉動微米測微鼓輪，將稜鏡色散角精確定格在「十七點一度」！\n色散角若有 0.1 度偏差，光子將無法注入菲涅耳主焦點！\n```\n\n「**光柵繞射角十七點一度（17.1°）！**」\n\n葉旖緁推了推眼鏡，眼中滿是震撼的光芒：「誠浩！透過透鏡的光柵常數是兩千奈米，恆光結晶的波長是五百八十九奈米！只有當第一階繞射角精確鎖定在**十七點一度**時，地心升上來的光子才能形成完美的相干干涉，在十公尺透鏡中心引燃永恆之火！」\n\n「十七點一度……交給我！」\n\n誠浩屏住呼吸，右手捏住了黃銅微米測微旋鈕。\n\n這一次，沒有任何的猶豫，少年那歷經冒險洗禮的指尖無比沉穩。\n\n就在這時，一雙溫暖、長滿厚厚老繭的大手，輕輕覆蓋在了誠浩的手背上。\n\n誠浩轉過頭，看見了爺爺眼中那無盡的信任與溫柔。\n\n「浩浩，別緊張。跟著感覺走，想像你第一次拼裝出皮可時的那份心跳。」\n\n祖孫二人的手重疊在一起，共同旋動了那枚承載著三十年歲月的黃銅旋鈕。\n\n「咔噠……十七點零度……」\n\n「咔噠……**十七點一度！鎖死！！**」\n\n---\n\n## 三、點亮永恆之光！\n\n「嗡————轟隆隆隆隆！！！！」\n\n在十七點一度鎖定的剎那，整座八十公尺高的迷失燈塔，爆發出了一聲令整片大洋為之震撼共鳴的神聖巨響！\n\n三千公尺地心深處那座古代恆光反應堆中，浩瀚無垠、純淨溫和的金色光子流，如同一條甦醒的金色巨龍，順著燈塔底部的青銅管道呼嘯而上，在一微秒內全數灌注進了中央的「日冕三稜光子核心」！\n\n「轟————！！」\n\n直徑十公尺的菲涅耳水晶大透鏡，在這一瞬間被徹底點燃了！\n\n數千片環形水晶稜鏡，爆發出宛如一百個太陽同時升起般的壯麗金色聖芒！\n\n一道粗達三公尺、璀璨奪目、光芒柔和卻足以穿透千層迷霧的**「永恆金色光柱」**，自燈塔頂端衝天而起，破空而出，化作一柄旋轉不息的金色長劍，橫掃整片千島齒輪海！\n\n十海里！三十海里！五十海里！一百海里！！\n\n在這一瞬間，整片大洋被徹底點亮：\n\n海風島上，無數走出防空洞的島民仰望著天際劃過的金色光帶，爆發出震天動地的歡呼，嵐的母親淚流滿面地跪在沙灘上，感謝著燈塔的歸來；\n\n千島海盜的鐵錨灣基地裡，數百艘發條帆船齊聲鳴響了慶祝的汽笛，海盜少年們將帽子拋向天空；\n\n甚至在數百公里之外的陸地邊緣——鹿陽鎮的鹿陽國小鐘樓頂端，一頭白髮的邱校長手握著那枚同款雙齒輪懷錶，站在天台上極目遠眺。當看見海平面的盡頭，那道跨越三十年風暴、跨越生死誓約的金色光束劃破黑暗照亮鐘樓指針的剎那，老校長的嘴角露出了無比欣慰的笑容，兩行熱淚無聲地滑落……\n\n「遠山……莫里斯……孩子們……」\n\n「你們真的做到了。」\n\n---\n\n## 四、英雄的慶典與溫暖的告別\n\n午後的迷失燈塔停機坪上，海風吹拂，空氣中飄散著令人垂涎欲滴的濃郁香氣。\n\n將江繫著白色的廚師圍裙，正站在青木齒輪號的甲板上，用他那口立下奇功的黑鐵平底鍋，瘋狂翻炒著特大號的深海蒜香黃金蟹。鍋铲上下翻飛，香氣引得一旁的丁丁口水直流，不停地扯著皮可的耳朵：「小胖哥哥！蟹腿好了沒有呀？皮可都等急了！」\n\n皮可「汪」了一聲，小腦袋使勁點著，鏡頭裡閃爍著無數個小雞腿圖標。\n\n「別急別急！特級蒜香奶油蟹，外加剛剛出爐的金黃酥皮菠蘿麵包，人人有份！」將江豪氣干雲地擦著汗，笑得眼睛瞇成了一條縫。\n\n而在燈塔護欄邊，誠浩、葉旖緁、嵐、巴克並肩靠在黃銅欄杆上，吹著溫柔的海風。\n\n黑潮重工的犯罪證據已經被完整上報，海事巡警將被生鏽鐵錨五花大綁的沈天成押上了巡邏艦，這座深海財閥的陰謀宣告徹底粉碎。\n\n「喂，誠浩，」巴克嘴裡叼著一根棒棒糖，雙手枕在腦後，大大咧咧地笑道，「沈天成那老小子的利維坦母艦被海警拖走了，但黑潮丟在海裡的那些無人快艇，全被我們鐵錨幫笑納了！以後這片千島海，有我們鐵錨幫和海風島巡航，誰也別想動燈塔一根毫毛！」\n\n嵐握緊折疊船槳，對著誠浩和旖緁露出了燦爛英氣的笑容：\n\n「誠浩，旖緁，將江！你們永遠是海風島最尊貴的客人！等暑假到了，記得回來看我和莫里斯爺爺，我帶你們去千島海最美的珊瑚礁衝浪！」\n\n「一定會的，嵐！」誠浩用力點頭，伸出拳頭與嵐、巴克重重碰在一起。\n\n不遠處，老莫里斯穿著洗乾淨的油布雨衣，手裡端著兩杯朗姆茶，遞給了身旁的誠遠山老爺子。\n\n「遠山，你真的要回陸地了？」老莫里斯望著海平面。\n\n「嗯，三十年了，該回去看看老邱，看看鎮上的那所小學了。」老爺子笑著喝了一口熱茶，看著甲板上打鬧嬉笑的孩子們，眼神無比溫暖：\n\n「而且，這幫孩子成長的速度……遠遠超出了我的想像。世界已經屬於他們了。」\n\n---\n\n## 五、尾聲：來自雲端天穹的神秘呼叫\n\n傍晚時分，青木齒輪號在夕陽的餘暉中啟程返航。\n\n誠遠山老爺子坐在船尾，正拿著精密的工具，耐心地教誠浩如何校準皮可體內的納米發條齒輪。皮可乖巧地趴在誠浩的膝蓋上，發出舒適的「咕嚕咕嚕」機械震盪聲。\n\n葉旖緁坐在船艙的書桌前，將第二卷《千島齒輪海的迷失燈塔》的最後一頁工整地合上，黑皮筆記本的封底上，繪畫著一座在夕陽下旋轉閃耀的金色燈塔。\n\n將江抱著吃得乾乾淨淨的大保溫箱，靠在麻袋上發出呼嚕呼嚕的甜美鼾聲。\n\n大海一片祥和，航線無比平穩。\n\n然而，就在青木齒輪號即將駛入鹿陽鎮港口的那一瞬間——\n\n趴在誠浩膝蓋上的皮可，兩隻金屬耳朵突然猛地筆直豎立了起來！\n\n它胸口處那枚由誠浩、旖緁與爺爺共同維護的微型天線，突然不受控制地跳躍起一串奇異的**高空長波超高頻電信號**！\n\n「滋……滋啦啦……」\n\n一陣夾雜著呼嘯高空狂風、齒輪崩裂呻吟與斷斷續續的求救通訊，從萬米高空的雲層深處，突然穿透了青木齒輪號的電台揚聲器：\n\n> 『滋……這裡是……萬米高空……【天穹浮空城 · 奧秘之翼】……』  \n> 『引力反轉發條核心……遭到未知黑色結晶侵蝕……核心指針失控……』  \n> 『整座浮空大陸……正在以每秒八十公尺的速度……向地面墜落……』  \n> 『地面上的冒險者們……聽得見嗎……請救救……天穹之城……』\n\n「天穹浮空城？！萬米高空的空中大陸？！」\n\n誠浩、葉旖緁與誠遠山老爺子同時站起身，驚駭地抬起頭，望向鹿陽鎮上空那片無邊無際的深邃夜空！\n\n在璀璨的星河深處，一顆巨大的、宛如發條指針般的神秘星辰，正閃爍著不安的微光……\n\n新的齒輪已經轉動，更宏大的天際冒險，即將在雲端之巔轟然拉開序幕！\n\n---\n\n**（《第二卷：千島齒輪海的迷失燈塔》 全卷完）**  \n**（敬請期待《第三卷：雲端空島的發條天穹》！）**\n","rawContentEn":"﻿# 第二十二章：點亮永恆之光（第二卷大結局） (Chapter 22: Kindling the Eternal Light - Volume 2 Finale)\n\n## 一、破曉的八十公尺燈塔之巔 (I. Dawn Upon the Eighty-Meter Lighthouse Pinnacle)\n\n*WHOOOOSH——BOOM!*\n\nThe pneumatic ascension pod traced a blinding streak of golden light up the vertical shaft. Accompanied by a deep, resonant hiss of pressure depressurization, it burst through three thousand meters of mantle bedrock, arriving smoothly back within the crystalline rotunda atop the eighty-meter Lost Lighthouse!\n\nAs the heavy blast doors hissed open, the first pure rays of morning sunlight broke through the dawn clouds, bathing the scarred, smoke-blackened floor of the lantern room in warm golden light.\n\nThe tempest had dissipated completely.\n\nGazing out through the shattered crystal dome, the once-boiling, violent Thousand-Island Gear Sea had returned to tranquil, shimmering glass. The swells mirrored the violet-gold radiance of the morning horizon; Windward Island in the distance gleamed like a lush emerald, its giant clockwork windmills turning serenely in the ocean breeze.\n\nThe Abyssal Rift had fallen still, the destructive seismic spikes reduced to scrap iron, the ancient volcanic magma returning to its eternal slumber as a warm life-giving artery for the deep sea.\n\nIn the center of the rotunda, the thirty-foot \"Master Fresnel Lens\" stood silent under the morning sun.\n\nYet at the heart of the lens mount, the sacred beacon that had guided the Thousand-Island Sea for centuries remained dormant, awaiting its destined masters to reignite its eternal flame.\n\n\"Thirty years...\"\n\nSupported by Buck and Ding-Ding, Old Morris stepped toward the pedestal, his withered hand trembling as he stroked the cool bronze casing with tears in his eyes:\n\n\"Yuan-Shan... The final step we couldn't complete thirty years ago... falls to the children today.\"\n\nGrandpa Cheng Yuan-Shan smiled and patted Morris on the shoulder, then turned his gaze upon Cheng Hao with boundless warmth and quiet certainty:\n\n\"Hao-Hao, bring forth the three Celestial Relics.\"\n\n---\n\n## 二、光柵繞射與三神具合體 (II. Grating Diffraction and Fusion of the Three Relics)\n\n\"Yes, Grandpa!\"\n\nTaking a deep, steady breath, Cheng Hao unclasped his gear and walked to the marble altar under everyone's watchful eyes.\n\nThree relics that had journeyed across thirty years of peril were laid out under the morning light:\n\n1. The 【First-Generation Ghost Optical Goggles】 etched with micro-code (Optical Polarizing Filter);\n2. The golden 【Dodecahedral Ancient Astrolabe】 representing the twelve cosmic coordinates (Spatiotemporal Geometry Core);\n3. The pale-violet 【Lyra Optical Astrolabe】 (Acoustic and Spectral Harmonic Tuner).\n\nThe instant Cheng Hao brought the three relics together, a miracle occurred—\n\nFrom within their housings echoed the rapid, harmonious chattering of thousands of microscopic gear teeth!\n\n*CLACK... CLICK... SHING————!*\n\nThe prisms of the dodecahedral astrolabe folded into an outer ring pedestal, the amethyst axis of the Lyra Astrolabe transformed into a photonic condenser, and the polarizing lenses of the goggles clicked seamlessly into the apex, merging within a millisecond into a sixteen-inch masterpiece bathed in liquid golden light—**【The Prismatic Sun Core】**!\n\nYet as the core seated into the base socket, the micro-etched brass sundial upon the pedestal deployed a precision micrometer dial:\n\n```\n[FRESNEL ETERNAL CORE DIFFRACTION DISPERSION EQUATIONS]:\nGrating Diffraction Condition:\nd × sin(θ) = m × λ\n\n[ANCIENT ETERNAL LIGHT SPECTRAL PARAMETERS]:\nBase Transmission Grating Line Density: N = 500 lines/mm\nGrating Slit Constant: d = 1 / N = 1 / 500 mm = 2.0 μm = 2000 nm!\nAncient Geothermal Crystal Photon Wavelength:\nλ = 589 nm (Pure golden-yellow solar spectrum line / Sodium D-line median)\nDiffraction Order (First-order principal maximum, energy concentration 98%): m = 1\n\n[DISPERSION ANGLE CALIBRATION LAW]:\nsin(θ) = (m × λ) / d\nsin(θ) = (1 × 589) / 2000 = 0.2945!\nExact Deflection Angle: θ = arcsin(0.2945) ≈ 17.13° ≈ 17.1°!\n\nOperational Directive:\nRotate the micrometer drum to lock the dispersion angle at exactly \"17.1°\"!\nA deviation of even 0.1° will prevent photons from injecting into the Fresnel focus!\n```\n\n\"**GRATING DIFFRACTION ANGLE: SEVENTEEN POINT ONE DEGREES (17.1°)!**\"\n\nYe Yijie pushed her glasses up, eyes gleaming with awe: \"Cheng Hao! The grating constant across the lens is two thousand nanometers; the crystal wavelength is five hundred and eighty-nine nanometers! Only when the first-order diffraction angle locks onto **seventeen point one degrees** will photons from the mantle achieve perfect constructive interference, igniting the eternal flame at the lens focus!\"\n\n\"Seventeen point one degrees... Leave it to me!\"\n\nHolding his breath, Cheng Hao's fingers gripped the brass micrometer vernier dial.\n\nThis time, there was no hesitation. The young inventor's hands—tempered by trials of fire and sea—were as steady as bedrock.\n\nRight then, a pair of warm, calloused hands gently rested over Cheng Hao's.\n\nCheng Hao looked up to see the boundless faith and gentleness in his grandfather's eyes.\n\n\"Hao-Hao, breathe easy. Follow your instincts, just like the heartbeat you felt when you assembled PICO for the very first time.\"\n\nGrandfather and grandson turned the brass dial together, moving the hands that carried thirty years of dreams.\n\n*Click... 17.0 degrees...*\n\n*Click... **17.1 DEGREES! LOCKED!!***\n\n---\n\n## 三、點亮永恆之光！ (III. Kindling the Eternal Light!)\n\n*HUMMMMMM——BOOOOOOOOOM!!!!*\n\nThe instant the vernier locked at seventeen point one degrees, the eighty-meter Lost Lighthouse resonated with a majestic, sacred chime that reverberated across the ocean!\n\nFrom the ancient reactor three thousand meters deep within the mantle, an ocean of pure, golden photonic energy surged upward like an awakened celestial dragon, flooding through bronze flumes straight into the Prismatic Sun Core at the lantern center!\n\n*BOOOOOM————!!*\n\nThe thirty-foot Fresnel crystal lens ignited in all its glory!\n\nThousands of concentric prisms burst with the brilliance of a hundred suns rising as one!\n\nA three-meter-wide beam of dazzling, gentle, yet fog-cleaving **Eternal Golden Light** speared skyward from the lantern room, sweeping across the Thousand-Island Gear Sea like a spinning celestial blade!\n\nTen nautical miles! Thirty miles! Fifty miles! One hundred nautical miles!!\n\nIn that glorious heartbeat, the entire ocean was bathed in daylight:\n\nUpon Windward Island, islanders emerged from shelters to behold the golden beacon sweeping across the clouds, erupting into deafening cheers of joy; Lan's mother knelt upon the beach in tears of thanksgiving;\n\nAt the Iron Anchor pirate cove, hundreds of clockwork vessels sounded festive whistles as young pirates tossed caps into the morning sky;\n\nAnd hundreds of miles away at the edge of the continent—atop the clock tower of Lu-Yang Elementary in Gear Town—white-haired Principal Chiu held his twin-gear pocket watch, gazing into the horizon. When the golden beam crossed thirty years of storms and oaths to illuminate the clock hands, the old educator smiled through silent tears...\n\n\"Yuan-Shan... Morris... Children...\"\n\n\"You truly did it.\"\n\n---\n\n## 四、英雄的慶典與溫暖的告別 (IV. Heroes' Celebration and Warm Farewells)\n\nThat afternoon upon the cantilever flight deck of the Lost Lighthouse, a gentle breeze carried a mouth-watering aroma across the waves.\n\nWearing his white chef's apron aboard The Aoki Gear, Jiang Jiang swung his legendary cast-iron skillet, stir-frying oversized garlic butter King Crabs with dazzling flair. Little Ding-Ding tugged at PICO's alloy ears, drooling: \"Chef Jiang! Are the crab legs ready yet? PICO can't wait any longer!\"\n\nPICO gave a cheerful *BARK*, nodding its head as little drumstick icons danced across its optical displays.\n\n\"Patience, patience! Special Garlic Butter Crab plus freshly baked crispy pineapple buns—second helpings for everyone!\" Jiang Jiang wiped sweat from his brow, grinning from ear to ear.\n\nAlong the lighthouse balustrade, Cheng Hao, Ye Yijie, Lan, and Buck leaned shoulder-to-shoulder, savoring the ocean breeze.\n\nAll evidence of Kuroshio's crimes had been transmitted to the authorities; maritime patrol cruisers had taken the manacled Shen Tian-Cheng into custody, shattering the deep-sea syndicate's conspiracy forever.\n\n\"Hey, Cheng Hao,\" Buck said, a lollipop stick in his grin, hands resting behind his head: \"The Coast Guard towed away the Leviathan, but all those autonomous skimmers Kuroshio left behind belong to the Iron Anchor Gang now! With us and Windward Island on patrol, not a soul will touch a bolt of this lighthouse!\"\n\nLan gripped her alloy oar, beaming at Cheng Hao and Yijie:\n\n\"Cheng Hao, Yijie, Jiang Jiang! You are honorary heroes of Windward Island forever! Come summer vacation, visit Grandpa Morris and me—I'll take you surfing on the most gorgeous coral reefs in the sea!\"\n\n\"We will, Lan!\" Cheng Hao nodded, bumping fists with Lan and Buck.\n\nNearby, Old Morris, dressed in clean oilskins, handed two mugs of spiced rum tea to Grandpa Cheng.\n\n\"Yuan-Shan, you're really heading back to the mainland?\" Morris asked, watching the horizon.\n\n\"Aye. Thirty years... it's time to see old Chiu and check on that school in town.\" Grandpa smiled, sipping warm tea, watching the youngsters laughing on deck:\n\n\"Besides, these children have grown faster than I could have ever dreamed. The future belongs to them now.\"\n\n---\n\n## 五、尾聲：來自雲端天穹的神秘呼叫 (V. Epilogue: Mysterious Call from the Cloud Realm)\n\nToward dusk, The Aoki Gear set course for home beneath a pastel sky.\n\nAt the stern, Grandpa Cheng held delicate tools, patiently guiding Cheng Hao on calibrating PICO's internal nano-clockwork. PICO rested comfortably across Cheng Hao's lap, purring with gentle mechanical vibrations.\n\nInside the cabin, Ye Yijie neatly closed the final page of Volume 2: *The Lost Lighthouse of the Thousand-Island Gear Sea*. Etched upon the back cover was a sketch of a golden lighthouse revolving under the sunset.\n\nCurled over his empty cooler, Jiang Jiang snored sweetly against a sack of flour.\n\nThe sea was tranquil, the journey smooth.\n\nYet the instant The Aoki Gear approached the outer harbor of Gear Town—\n\nPICO's ears suddenly snapped straight up!\n\nThe miniature antenna on its chest—jointly maintained by Cheng Hao, Yijie, and Grandpa—began pulsing with an erratic, powerful **Stratospheric Long-Wave High-Frequency Signal**!\n\n*KZZZZZT... STATIC...*\n\nInterspersed with the howling of high-altitude gales and the grinding of fracturing gears, an urgent distress transmission filtered through The Aoki Gear's radio speaker from miles above the clouds:\n\n> *\"Kzzzt... Calling from... thirty thousand feet... 【The Stratospheric Floating City · Wings of Aether】...\"*  \n> *\"The Gravitational Reversal Clockwork Core... is corrupted by unknown black crystals... central hands are slipping...\"*  \n> *\"The entire floating continent... is falling toward the Earth... at eighty meters per second...\"*  \n> *\"Adventurers on the surface... can you hear us... please save... the City of the Heavens...\"*\n\n\"The Stratospheric Floating City?! An airborne continent at thirty thousand feet?!\"\n\nCheng Hao, Ye Yijie, and Grandpa Cheng sprang to their feet in unison, gazing upward into the boundless midnight sky above Gear Town!\n\nDeep within the glittering tapestry of stars, a colossal, mysterious star resembling a clockwork hand flickered with ominous brilliance...\n\nA new gear had begun to turn, and a grander adventure among the clouds was about to unfold!\n\n---\n\n**(End of Volume 2: The Lost Lighthouse of the Thousand-Island Gear Sea)**  \n**(Please look forward to Volume 3: The Clockwork Firmament of the Cloud Atolls!)**\r\n"}];
